  "SCR_TEXT_55": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_61": "\\Y ",
  "SCR_TEXT_62": "\\p ",
  "SCR_TEXT_99": "* You bid a quiet farewell&  to the \\[I].",
  "SCR_TEXT_100": "* You put the \\[I]&  on the ground and gave it a&  little pat.",
  "SCR_TEXT_102": "* You threw the \\[I]&  on the ground like the piece&  of trash it is.",
  "SCR_TEXT_103": "* You abandoned the &  \\[I].",
  "SCR_TEXT_104": "* The \\[I] was&  thrown away.",
  "SCR_TEXT_111": "   * I'm outta here.",
  "SCR_TEXT_112": "   * I've got better to do.",
  "SCR_TEXT_113": "   * Escaped...",
  "SCR_TEXT_114": "   * Don't slow me down.",
  "SCR_TEXT_121": "   * Ran away with \\[1] EXP&     and \\[2] GOLD.",
  "SCR_TEXT_127": "* (The shadow of the ruins&  looms above^1, filling you with&  determination.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_128": "* (HP fully restored.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_129": "* (Playfully crinkling through&  the leaves fills you with&  determination.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_130": "* (HP fully restored.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_131": "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day leave its hole and&  get the cheese...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_132": "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_133": "* (Seeing such a cute^1, tidy&  house in the RUINS gives&  you determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_134": "* Determination./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_135": "* (The cold atmosphere of a&  new land... it fills you&  with determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_136": "* (The convenience of that&  lamp still fills you&  with determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_137": "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day find a way to heat&  up the spaghetti...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_138": "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_140": "* (Knowing that dog will&  never give up trying to&  make the perfect snowdog...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_141": "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_142": "* (Snow can always be broken&  down and rebuilt into&  something more useful.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_143": "* (This simple fact fills&  you with determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_144": "* (The sight of such a friendly&  town fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_145": "* (The sound of rushing water&  fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_146": "* (A feeling of dread hangs&  over you...^1)&* (But you stay determined.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_147": "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day extract the cheese from&  the mystical crystal...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_148": "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_150": "* (The sound of muffled rain&  on the cavetop...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_151": "* (The serene sound of a&  distant music box...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_152": "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_153": "* (The feeling of your socks&  squishing as you step&  gives you determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_156": "* (The waterfall here seems&  to flow from the&  ceiling of the cavern...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_157": "* (Occasionally^1, a piece of&  trash will flow&  through...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_158": "* (... and fall into the&  bottomless abyss below.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_159": "* (Viewing this endless&  cycle of worthless&  garbage...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_160": "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_161": "* (Partaking in worthless&  garbage fills you&  with determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_164": "* (You feel a calming&  tranquility^1. You're filled&  with determination...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_165": "* (You feel..^1. something.)&* (You're filled with&  detemmienation.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_168": "* (The wind is howling^1.&* You're filled with&  determination...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_169": "* (The howling wind is&  now a breeze^1. This gives&  you determination...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_170": "* (The wind has stopped^1.&* You're filled with&  determination...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_174": "* (Seeing such a strange&  laboratory in a place like&  this...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_175": "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_180": "* (The wooshing sound of steam&  and cogs..^1. it fills you&  with determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_184": "* (An ominous structure looms&  in the distance...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_185": "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_187": "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day hack the computerized&  safe and get the cheese...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_188": "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_191": "* (A huge structure lies north.^1)&* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_195": "* (The relaxing atmosphere&  of this hotel..^1. it fills&  you with determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_199": "* (The air is filled with&  the smell of ozone..^1. it fills&  you with determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_203": "* (Behind this door must be&  the elevator to the King's&  castle.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_204": "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_208": "* (The smell of cobwebs fills&  the air...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_209": "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_242": "* You leave the Quiche on the&  ground and tell it you'll&  be right back./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_246": "* Use the box?& &         Yes         No      \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_247": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_248": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_270": "  %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_275": "* You have no items^1.&* You put a little time into&  the box./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_276": "* You have no items^1.&* You put a little effort&  into the box./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_277": "* You have no items^1.&* You put a little feeling&  into the box./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_282": "  %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_291": "\\W* Howdy^2!&* I'm\\Y FLOWEY\\W.^2 &* \\YFLOWEY\\W the \\YFLOWER\\W!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_292": "* Hmmm.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_293": "* You're new to the&  UNDERGROUND^2, aren'tcha?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_294": "* Golly^1, you must be&  so confused./",
  "SCR_TEXT_295": "* Someone ought to teach&  you how things work&  around here!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_296": "* I guess little old me&  will have to do./",
  "SCR_TEXT_297": "* Ready^2?&* Here we go!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_301": "\\E2* This way./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_302": "%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_306": "\\E2* Welcome to your new&  home^1, innocent one./",
  "SCR_TEXT_307": "* Allow me to educate you&  in the operation of the&  RUINS./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_311": "\\E2* The RUINS are full of&  puzzles./",
  "SCR_TEXT_312": "* Ancient fusions between &  diversions and doorkeys./",
  "SCR_TEXT_313": "* One must solve them&  to move from room to&  room./",
  "SCR_TEXT_314": "* Please adjust yourself    to the sight of them./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_318": "\\E2* To make progress here,^1 &  you will need to trigger&  several switches./",
  "SCR_TEXT_319": "* Do not worry,^1 I have &  labelled the ones that&  you need to flip./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_322": "* Do not worry,^1 I have &  labelled the ones that&  you need to flip./",
  "SCR_TEXT_323": "* ... eh^1?&* It seems that the&  labelling has worn away./",
  "SCR_TEXT_324": "* Oh dear./",
  "SCR_TEXT_325": "* This might be far more&  challenging than I&  anticipated.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_330": "\\E2* The first switch is over&  on the wall./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_334": "\\E1* Do you need some help..^1?&* Press the switch on the   wall./",
  "SCR_TEXT_335": "\\E0* Come on^1, you can do it!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_339": "\\E2* Go on^1, press the switch&  on the left./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_342": "\\E2* I believe it was&  the switch on the&  left./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_347": "\\E1* You do know which way&  left is^1, do you not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_348": "\\E0* Press the switch that I&  labelled for you./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_352": "\\E1* You do know which way&  left is^1, do you not?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_357": "\\E1* You are very curious,^1 &  are you not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_358": "\\E1* Please understand.^2 & \\E0I only want the best&  for you./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_362": "\\E0* Splendid!^2 &* I am proud of you,^1 &  little one./",
  "SCR_TEXT_363": "* Let us move to the&  next room./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_367": "\\E1* As a human living in&  the UNDERGROUND,^1 &  monsters may attack you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_368": "\\E2* You will need to be&  prepared for this&  situation./",
  "SCR_TEXT_369": "\\E0* However, worry not!^2 &* The process is simple./",
  "SCR_TEXT_370": "\\E2* When you encounter a &  monster,^1 you will enter&  a FIGHT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_371": "* While you are in a&  FIGHT^1, strike up a&  friendly conversation./",
  "SCR_TEXT_372": "\\E2* Stall for time.&  I will come to resolve&  the conflict./",
  "SCR_TEXT_373": "\\E2* Practice talking to&  the dummy./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_379": "\\E1* Ahh,^1 the dummies are&  not for fighting!^2 &* They are for talking!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_380": "* We do not want to hurt&  anybody, do we...?^2 \\E0 &* Come now./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_384": "\\E0* Ah,^1 very good!^2 &* You are very good./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_388": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_389": "\\E1* ... you ran away.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_390": "\\E0* Truthfully^1, that was&  not a poor choice./",
  "SCR_TEXT_391": "\\E0* It is better to&  avoid conflict&  whenever possible./",
  "SCR_TEXT_392": "\\E1* That..^1. however^1, is&  only a dummy^2.&* It cannot harm you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_393": "\\E1* It is made of cotton^1.&* It has no desire&  for revenge.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_394": "\\E0* Nevermind^2.&* Stay close to me and&  I will keep you safe./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_398": "\\E3* ^1.^1.^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_399": "\\E4* ^1.^1.^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_400": "\\E0* The next room awaits./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_405": "\\E2* Practice talking to&  the dummy./",
  "SCR_TEXT_406": "\\E1* You can say anything..^2.\\E2 &* I do not think the dummy&  will be bothered./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_411": "\\E0* Do you need some&  ideas for conversation&  topics?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_412": "* Well^1, I often start with&  a simple 'how do you&  do...'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_413": "* You could ask them about&  their favorite books.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_414": "* Jokes can be useful for&  'breaking the ice.'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_415": "* Listen to this one.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_416": "* What did the skeleton&  tile his roof with?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_417": "* ... SHIN-gles!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_418": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_419": "\\E0* Well^1, I thought it&  was amusing./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_423": "\\E2* Practice talking to&  the dummy./",
  "SCR_TEXT_424": "\\E1* You can say anything..^2.\\E0 &* The dummy will not&  be bothered./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_428": "\\E1* There is another puzzle&  in this room.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_429": "\\E0* I wonder if you can&  solve it?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_433": "\\E1* This is the puzzle^1,&  but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_434": "\\E0* Here^1, take my hand&  for a moment./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_438": "\\E1* Puzzles seem a little&  too dangerous for&  now./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_442": ".../%",
  "SCR_TEXT_446": "\\E2* Greetings,^1 my child^2.&* Do not worry^1, I did&  not leave you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_447": "\\E0* I was merely behind this&  pillar the whole time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_448": "* Thank you for trusting&  me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_449": "\\E2* However^1, there was an&  important reason for&  this exercise./",
  "SCR_TEXT_450": "* ... to test your&  independence./",
  "SCR_TEXT_451": "\\E1* I must attend to some&  business^1, and you must&  stay alone for a while./",
  "SCR_TEXT_452": "\\E0* Please remain here^2.&*\\E1 It's dangerous to&  explore by yourself./",
  "SCR_TEXT_453": "\\E0* I have an idea^2.&* I will give you a&  CELL PHONE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_454": "* If you have a need for&  anything^1, just call./",
  "SCR_TEXT_455": "\\E1* Be good^1, alright?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_459": "\\E0* You have done&  excellently thus&  far^1, my child./",
  "SCR_TEXT_460": "\\E2* However... I have a&  difficult request to ask&  of you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_461": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_462": "* I would like you to walk&  to the end of the room&  by yourself./",
  "SCR_TEXT_463": "\\E1* Forgive me for this./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_467": "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /",
  "SCR_TEXT_468": "\\F1 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_469": "* Hello?&* This is TORIEL./",
  "SCR_TEXT_470": "* For no reason in&  particular...&* Which do you prefer?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_471": "* Cinnamon or&  butterscotch?&  Cinnamon    Bscotch \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_472": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_490": "* Oh^1, I see.&* Thank you very much!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_491": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_492": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_493": "* /",
  "SCR_TEXT_497": "* It's a fishing rod affixed&  to the ground.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_498": "* Reel it in?& &         Yes         No      \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_499": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_511": "* All that's attached to&  the end is a photo of a&  weird-looking monster.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_512": "* (Call Me!&  Here's my number!)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_513": "* You decide not to call./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_516": "* All that's attached to&  the end is a note./",
  "SCR_TEXT_517": "* (Nevermind^1, guys!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_522": "* You leave it alone./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_529": "* I shouldn't have given myself&  away so easily.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_533": "* Did you just...&* Consume the part of me&  I had given you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_534": "* In front of my very eyes!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_535": "* I have no words for you..^1.&* Begone!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_540": "* Thank you for taking care&  of me.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_545": "* Huh^1? Again...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_546": "* I'm sorry..^1. if I give you&  any more^1, there will be&  nothing left of me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_547": "* I suppose it is true^1.&* Travelling beyond our limits&  is but a fantasy./",
  "SCR_TEXT_548": "* It's no different for&  anyone else./",
  "SCR_TEXT_549": "* All of monsterkind&  are doomed to stay&  underground^1, forever.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_554": "* How am I doing^1?&* By \"I\" I mean the piece&  of me I gave you.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_559": "* Huh^1? You lost it...^1?&* ... I suppose I can give&  you another piece.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_563": "* You don't have any room^1?&* OK..^1. I understand I am not&  a priority for you^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_567": "* Please be careful this&  time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_568": "* (You got the Snowman&  Piece.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_576": "* Hello^1.&* I am a snowman./",
  "SCR_TEXT_577": "* I want to see the world..^1.&* But I cannot move./",
  "SCR_TEXT_578": "* If you would be so kind^1,&  traveller^1, please.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_579": "* Take a piece of me and&  bring it very far away.&         Yes         No      \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_580": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_590": "* It seems you do not&  have enough room for me./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_593": "* Thank you... good luck!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_594": "* (You got the Snowman&  Piece.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_600": "* I see^1.&* Good journey^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_605": "SANS!!^1!&THAT DIDN'T DO&ANYTHING!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_606": "SANS!!^1!&THEY DIDN'T EVEN&LOOK AT IT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_608": "* whoops./",
  "SCR_TEXT_609": "* i knew i should have&  used today's crossword&  instead./",
  "SCR_TEXT_611": "WHAT!^1?&CROSSWORD!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_612": "I CAN'T BELIEVE&YOU SAID THAT!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_613": "IN MY OPINION.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_614": "\\E3JUNIOR JUMBLE&IS EASILY THE&HARDEST./",
  "SCR_TEXT_616": "* what^1? really^1, dude^1?&* that easy-peasy word&  scramble?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_617": "\\E1* that's for baby bones./",
  "SCR_TEXT_619": "UN^1. BELIEVABLE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_620": "\\E0HUMAN!!^1!&SOLVE THIS DISPUTE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_621": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_622": "* (Which is harder?)& &         Jumble      Crossword \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_623": "   ",
  "SCR_TEXT_631": "HA^1! HA^1! YES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_632": "HUMANS MUST BE&VERY INTELLIGENT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_633": "IF THEY ALSO FIND&JUNIOR JUMBLE&SO DIFFICULT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_634": "NYEH^1! HEH^1! HEH HEH!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_639": "YOU TWO ARE WEIRD!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_640": "\\E3CROSSWORDS ARE SO&EASY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_641": "IT'S THE SAME&SOLUTION EVERY&TIME./",
  "SCR_TEXT_642": "\\E0I JUST FILL ALL&THE BOXES IN WITH&THE LETTER \"Z\".../",
  "SCR_TEXT_643": "BECAUSE EVERY TIME&I LOOK AT A&CROSSWORD.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_644": "ALL I CAN DO IS&SNORE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_645": "NYEH HEH HEH!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_654": "* Hello^1!&* Would you like some&  Nice Cream?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_655": "* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_656": "* Now just 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_657": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_661": " %",
  "SCR_TEXT_662": "* Nice Cream^1!&* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_663": "* Now just 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_664": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_682": "* Here you go^1!&* Have a super-duper day^1!&* (You got the Nice Cream.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_684": "* Huh^1?&* You don't have enough&  money.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_685": "* I wish I could make&  Nice Cream for free.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_688": "* It looks like you're&  holding too much stuff^1!&* Oh well!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_691": "* Well then..^1.&* Tell your friends.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_692": "* There's ice cream..^1.&* Out in the middle of&  the woods.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_704": "* Hello^1!&* Would you like some&  Nice Cream?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_705": "* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_706": "* Now just 25G!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_707": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_711": " %",
  "SCR_TEXT_712": "* Nice Cream^1!&* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_713": "* Now just 25G!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_714": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_721": "* Hey^1, you have an umbrella^1,&  just like my cart.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_722": "* Such solidarity^1!&* I have no choice but to&  give you a deal!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_723": "* Discount Ice Cream! 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_724": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_728": " %",
  "SCR_TEXT_729": "* Umbrella solidarity!^1?&* I guess I have to give&  you a deal.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_730": "* Discount Ice Cream! 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_731": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_736": "* Hey^1!&* You have 3 Punch Cards!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_737": "* How about redeeming them&  for some Nice Cream!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_738": "* It's free!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_739": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_777": "* Super^1! Here you go^1!&* Your Card's in the box!&* (You got the Nice Cream.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_779": "* Huh^1? No money^1?&* Sorry^1, I can't give it to&  you for free./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_781": "* Huh^1? You can't afford it&  even with the discount^1?&* I.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_784": "* It looks like you're&  holding too much stuff^1!&* Oh well!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_803": "* Here^1! A free Nice Cream^1!&* (You lost 3 cards and got&  a Nice Cream.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_809": "* Well then..^1.&* Tell your friends.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_810": "* There's ice cream..^1.&* Hidden in the depths of a&  watery cavern.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_815": "* i've been thinking&  about selling treats&  too./",
  "SCR_TEXT_816": "* want some fried snow^1?&* it's just 5G.&  Buy         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_817": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_823": "* did i say 5G^1?&* i meant 50G^1.&  Buy         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_824": "  ",
  "SCR_TEXT_828": "* you're right./",
  "SCR_TEXT_829": "* i should charge way&  more than that./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_836": "* really^1?&* how about 5000G?&  Buy         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_837": "  ",
  "SCR_TEXT_841": "* you're right./",
  "SCR_TEXT_842": "* that's still too low./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_849": "* 50000G^1.&* that's my final offer.&  Buy         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_850": "  ",
  "SCR_TEXT_854": "* i have to pay for&  the raw materials&  somehow./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_861": "* what^1?&* you don't have the&  money?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_862": "* hey^1, that's okay./",
  "SCR_TEXT_863": "\\E1* i don't have any snow./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_867": "* wow^1, that's a lot&  of cash./",
  "SCR_TEXT_868": "\\E3* that's why i'm sorry&  to say.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_869": "\\E3* i can't sell you&  this fried snow./",
  "SCR_TEXT_870": "\\E2* it's got too much&  sentimental value./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_875": "* don't you know a&  good deal when you&  hear one?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_880": "WHAT!^1?&HOW DID YOU&AVOID MY TRAP?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_881": "\\E3AND^1, MORE&IMPORTANTLY.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_882": "\\E0IS THERE ANY&LEFT FOR ME???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_883": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_884": "* (What do you tell Papyrus&  about his spaghetti?)&         Ate it      Left it   \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_885": "   ",
  "SCR_TEXT_890": "REALLY!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_893": "\\E2WOWIE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_894": "NO ONE'S EVER&ENJOYED MY&COOKING BEFORE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_895": "\\E0WELL THEN!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_900": "\\E2WOWIE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_901": "YOU RESISTED THE&FLAVOR OF MY&HOMECOOKED PASTA.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_902": "JUST SO YOU&COULD SHARE&IT WITH ME???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_905": "\\E0FRET NOT HUMAN^1!&I^1, MASTER CHEF&PAPYRUS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_906": "WILL MAKE YOU ALL&THE PASTA YOU&COULD EVER WANT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_907": "HEH HEH HEH HEH&HEH HEH NYEH!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_911": "HEY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_912": "IT'S THE HUMAN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_913": "\\E0YOU'RE GONNA&LOVE THIS&PUZZLE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_914": "IT WAS MADE&BY THE GREAT&DR. ALPHYS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_915": "YOU SEE&THESE TILES&!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_916": "ONCE I THROW&THIS SWITCH.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_917": "THEY WILL&BEGIN TO&CHANGE COLOR!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_918": "EACH COLOR HAS&A DIFFERENT&FUNCTION!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_919": "RED TILES ARE&IMPASSABLE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_920": "YOU CANNOT&WALK ON THEM!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_921": "YELLOW TILES&ARE ELECTRIC!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_922": "THEY WILL&ELECTROCUTE&YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_923": "GREEN TILES&ARE ALARM&TILES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_924": "IF YOU STEP&ON THEM.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_925": "YOU WILL HAVE&TO FIGHT A&MONSTER!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_926": "ORANGE TILES&ARE ORANGE-&SCENTED./",
  "SCR_TEXT_927": "THEY WILL MAKE&YOU SMELL&DELICIOUS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_928": "BLUE TILES ARE&WATER TILES./",
  "SCR_TEXT_929": "SWIM THROUGH&IF YOU LIKE^1,&BUT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_930": "IF YOU SMELL&LIKE ORANGES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_931": "THE PIRANHAS&WILL BITE&YOU./",
  "SCR_TEXT_932": "ALSO^1, IF A&BLUE TILE IS&NEXT TO A,/",
  "SCR_TEXT_933": "YELLOW TILE^1,&THE WATER WILL&ALSO ZAP YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_934": "PURPLE TILES&ARE SLIPPERY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_935": "YOU WILL SLIDE&TO THE NEXT&TILE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_936": "HOWEVER^1, THE&SLIPPERY&SOAP.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_937": "SMELLS LIKE&LEMONS!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_938": "WHICH PIRANHAS&DO NOT LIKE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_939": "PURPLE AND&BLUE ARE OK!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_940": "FINALLY^1,&PINK TILES./",
  "SCR_TEXT_941": "THEY DON'T DO&ANYTHING./",
  "SCR_TEXT_942": "STEP ON THEM&ALL YOU LIKE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_943": "HOW WAS THAT!^1?&UNDERSTAND???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_944": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_945": "* (Understand the explanation?)& &         Of course   No        \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_946": "   ",
  "SCR_TEXT_953": "GREAT!^1!&THEN THERE'S ONE&LAST THING.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_954": "THIS PUZZLE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_955": "IS ENTIRELY RANDOM&!!!!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_956": "WHEN I PULL THIS&SWITCH^1, IT WILL&MAKE A PUZZLE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_957": "THAT HAS NEVER&BEEN SEEN BEFORE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_958": "NOT EVEN I WILL&KNOW THE SOLUTION!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_959": "NYEH HEH HEH^1!&GET READY...!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_965": "OKAY..^1.&I GUESS I'LL&REPEAT MYSELF.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_966": "\\E0RED TILES ARE&IMPASSABLE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_967": "YELLOW TILES ARE&ELECTRIC AND&DANGEROUS./",
  "SCR_TEXT_968": "BLUE TILES MAKE&YOU FIGHT A&MONSTER./",
  "SCR_TEXT_969": "GREEN TILES ARE&WATER TILES./",
  "SCR_TEXT_970": "ORANGE TILES ARE&ORANGE SCENTED./",
  "SCR_TEXT_971": "IF YOU STEP ON&ORANGE^1, DON'T STEP&ON GREEN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_972": "\\E3BROWN TILES ARE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_973": "\\E1WAIT!!^1!&THERE ARE NO&BROWN TILES.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_974": "\\E0PURPLE TILES&SMELL LIKE&LEMONS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_975": "\\E3WHY DON'T THE&YELLOW ONES&SMELL LEMONY?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_976": "\\E3UMM.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_977": "\\E1WAIT!^1!&DID I MIX UP&GREEN AND BLUE!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_978": "THE BLUE ONES&ARE WATER ONES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_979": "\\E3PINK TILES.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_980": "I DON'T..^1.&REMEMBER???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_981": "\\E1WAIT!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_982": "\\E3THOSE ONES DON'T&DO ANYTHING./",
  "SCR_TEXT_983": "\\E0OKAY^1!&DO YOU UNDERSTAND&BETTER NOW!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_984": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_985": "* (Understand the explanation?)& &         Yes         Even less \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_986": "   ",
  "SCR_TEXT_994": "GREAT!^1!&THEN THERE'S ONE&LAST THING.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_995": "THIS PUZZLE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_996": "IS ENTIRELY RANDOM&!!!!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_997": "WHEN I PULL THIS&SWITCH^1, IT WILL&MAKE A PUZZLE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_998": "THAT HAS NEVER&BEEN SEEN BEFORE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_999": "NOT EVEN I WILL&KNOW THE SOLUTION!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1000": "NYEH HEH HEH^1!&GET READY...!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1006": "........../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1007": "OK^1, YOU KNOW&WHAT???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1008": "HOW ABOUT..^1.&YOU JUST.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1009": "DO THIS PUZZLE..^1.&ON YOUR OWN.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1010": "I'LL LEAVE THE&INSTRUCTIONS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1011": "JUST READ THEM./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1012": "THEN WHEN YOU&UNDERSTAND IT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1013": "YOU CAN THROW&THE SWITCH./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1014": "AND DO IT AT&YOUR OWN PACE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1015": "GOOD LUCK./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1016": "NYEH..^1.&HEH..^1.&HEH!/%%",
