  "SCR_TEXT_1439": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1446": "* (There's a heart-shaped&  locket inside the box.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1447": "* (Will you take it?)& &         Take it     Leave it  \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1448": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1451": "* Nothing's here!!!/%%",
