  "SCR_TEXT_1478": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1483": "* (The box is empty.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1492": "* Hello...&* Would you like some&  Nice Cream...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1493": "* It's the frozen treat...&* That warms your heart./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1494": "* Now only 12G!& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1495": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1499": " %",
  "SCR_TEXT_1500": "* Nice Cream^1.&* It's the frozen treat^1.&* That warms your heart./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1501": "* Now just 12G.& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1502": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1520": "* Here^1.&* (You got the Nice Cream.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1522": "* You don't have enough&  money.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1525": "* Drop something./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1528": "* Well then..^1.&* Tell your friends.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1529": "* Life..^1. is suffering./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1535": "* (Golden flowers.^1)&* (They must have&  broken your fall.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1536": "%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1540": "* \"Press \\*Z to read signs!\"/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1544": "* Just a regular old pillar./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1548": "* Please don't step on the&  leaves./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1552": "* Didn't you read the sign&  downstairs?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1562": "* WHOA there^1, pardner^2!&* Who said you could push&  me around?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1563": "* HMM^2?&* So you're ASKIN' me to&  move over?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1564": "* Okay^1, just for you^1,&  pumpkin./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1569": "* HMM^2?&* You want me to move some&  more?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1570": "* Alrighty^1, how's this?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1575": "* HMM^2?&* That was the wrong direction?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1576": "* Okay^1, think I got it./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1579": "* Was that helpful?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1583": "* HMM^2?&* You wanted me to STAY there?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1584": "* You're giving me a real&  workout./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1589": "* Aren't things easier when&  you just ask?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1592": "* The exit's open^1?&* Guess I better roll out.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1593": "* Hey^1, y'mind giving me a&  push^1, pumpkin?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1603": "* 'Take one.'&* Take a candy?&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1604": "* It says 'take one.'&* Take a piece of candy?&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1606": "* Look at what you've done./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1607": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1624": "* You took a piece of candy.&* (Press \\*C to open the menu.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1625": "* You took more candy^1.&* How disgusting../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1626": "* You take another piece.&* You feel like the&  scum of the earth.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1628": "* You took too much too fast.&* The candy spills onto&  the floor./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1631": "* In this hellish world^1, you&  can only take 3 pieces&  of candy.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1635": "* You tried to take a piece&  of candy^1, but you didn't&  have any room./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1639": "* You decided not to take some./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1675": "* It says 'Take them all.'&* Take a candy?&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1676": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1692": "* You took a piece.&* Boy^1, that's heavy./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1694": "* You can't carry more.&* It's just too heavy./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1695": "* You tried to take a piece&  of candy^1, but you didn't&  have any room./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1698": "* You decided not to take some./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1644": "* zzzzzzzzzzzzzzz..^1.&* zzzzzzzzzzzzzz.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1645": "* zzzzzzzzzz..^1.&* (are they gone yet^1)&* zzzzzzzzzzzzzzz.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1646": "* (This ghost keeps saying 'z'&  out loud repeatedly^1,&  pretending to sleep.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1647": "* Move it with force?& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1648": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1705": "* Leave 7G in the web?& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1706": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1723": "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a donut./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1724": "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1726": "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1729": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1736": "* Leave 18G in the web?& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1737": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1754": "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a jug./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1755": "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1757": "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1760": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1771": "* You found a Faded Ribbon./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1772": "* You are carrying too&  much./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1778": "* It's a switch.&* Press it?&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1779": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1788": "* Nothing happened./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1789": "%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1790": "* You're making the switches&  uncomfortable with all&  this attention./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1796": "* It's a switch.&* Press it?&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1797": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1806": "* You hear a clicking sound./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1807": "%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1817": "* You found the Toy Knife./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1818": "* You are carrying too&  much./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1824": "* It's TORIEL's diary.&* Read the circled passage?&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1825": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1830": "* You read the passage.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1831": "* \"Why did the skeleton want&  a friend?\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1832": "* \"Because she was feeling&  BONELY...\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1833": "* The rest of the page is&  filled with jokes of&  a similar caliber./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1835": "%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1842": "* You found a slice of&  butterscotch-cinnamon&  pie./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1843": "* You are carrying too&  much./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1853": "* You found a slice of&  snail pie.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1854": "* You are carrying too&  much./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1859": "* Hello there^1,&  little one!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1860": "* The pie has not&  cooled down yet./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1861": "* Perhaps you should&  take a nap.&  Yes         No      \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1862": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1867": "* Sweet dreams./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1870": "\\E1* You'd rather stay&  up and chat with&  me^1, then?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1871": "* Up already^1, I see?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1872": "\\E0* Um^1, I want you to know&  how glad I am to&  have someone here./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1873": "* There are so many&  old books I want&  to share./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1874": "* I want to show you&  my favorite bug-&  hunting spot./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1875": "* I've also prepared&  a curriculum for&  your education./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1876": "* This may come as&  a surprise to you.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1877": "* But I have always&  wanted to be a&  teacher./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1878": "\\E1* ... actually^1, perhaps&  that isn't very&  surprising./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1879": "\\E5* STILL./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1880": "\\E0* I am glad to have&  you living here./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1881": "\\E1* Oh^1, did you&  want something?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1882": "* What is it?&               When can&  Nothing      I go home?\\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1883": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1891": "* Well^1, talk to me&  again if you&  need anything./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1895": "\\E1* What^1?&* This..^1. this IS your&  home now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1896": "* Um..^1. would you like&  to hear about this&  book I am reading?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1897": "\\E0* Oh^1, hello!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1898": "* Did you want to&  hear about the&  book I am reading?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1899": "\\E0* It is called&  \"72 Uses for Snails.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1900": "* How about it?&              How to exit&  Sure        the RUINS\\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1901": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1907": "* Here is an exciting&  snail fact./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1908": "\\E1* Um^1.^1.^1.&*\\E0 How about an exciting&  snail fact?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1909": "\\E2* Did you know&  that snails.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1911": "\\E0* Have a chainsaw-like&  tongue called a&  radula?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1912": "\\E0* Sometimes flip their&  digestive systems&  as they mature?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1913": "\\E0* Make terrible&  shoelaces?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1914": "\\E0* Talk^2. Really^2. Slowly^2?&* Just kidding^1, snails&  don't talk./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1915": "\\E0* Interesting.&              How to exit&  Yeah        the RUINS\\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1916": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1921": "* Well^1, bother me&  if you need anything&  else./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1924": "\\E1* ... I have to do&  something^1.&* Stay here./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1927": "\\E0* What is it?&              How to exit&  Nothing     the RUINS\\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1930": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1934": "* If you need anything^1,&  just ask./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1935": "\\E1* ... I have to do&  something.&* Stay here./%%.",
  "SCR_TEXT_1936": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1940": "\\E2NYOO HOO HOO.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1941": "I CAN'T EVEN&STOP SOMEONE AS&WEAK AS YOU.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1942": "UNDYNE'S GOING TO&BE DISAPPOINTED&IN ME./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1943": "I'LL NEVER JOIN THE&ROYAL GUARD..^1.&AND.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1944": "MY FRIEND QUANTITY&WILL REMAIN&STAGNANT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1945": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_1946": "* (What should you say?)&         Let's be    What a&         friends     loser\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_1947": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1956": "\\E0WOWIE!^1!&YOU DID IT!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1957": "YOU DIDN'T DO A&VIOLENCE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1958": "\\E5TO BE HONEST^1,&I WAS A LITTLE&AFRAID.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1959": "\\E0BUT YOU'RE ALREADY&BECOMING A GREAT&PERSON!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1960": "\\E7I'M SO PROUD I&COULD CRY!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1961": "\\E3... WAIT^1, WASN'T I&SUPPOSED TO&CAPTURE YOU...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1962": "\\E0WELL^1, FORGET IT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1963": "I JUST WANT YOU&TO BE THE BEST&PERSON YOU CAN BE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1964": "SO LET'S LET&BYBONES BE&BYBONES./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1965": "I'LL EVEN TELL YOU&HOW TO LEAVE THE&UNDERGROUND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1966": "JUST KEEP GOING&EAST!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1967": "EVENTUALLY YOU'LL&REACH THE KING'S&CASTLE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1968": "THEN YOU CAN&LEAVE!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1978": "REALLY!^1?&YOU WANT TO BE&FRIENDS^1, WITH ME???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1979": "WELL THEN.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1980": "\\E0I GUESS..^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_1981": "I GUESS&I CAN MAKE AN&ALLOWANCE FOR YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1982": " %",
  "SCR_TEXT_1987": "HUH^1?&WHY WOULD YOU.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1988": "BERATE YOURSELF&SO LOUDLY???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1989": "IS IT BECAUSE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1990": "\\E3YOU DON'T THINK&YOU'RE GOOD ENOUGH&TO BE MY FRIEND?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1991": "\\E0NO!!^1!&YOU'RE GREAT!!^1!&I'LL BE YOUR FRIEND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1996": "WOWIE!^1!&WE HAVEN'T EVEN HAD&OUR FIRST DATE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_1997": "AND I'VE ALREADY&MANAGED TO HIT&THE FRIEND ZONE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1998": "WHO KNEW THAT&ALL I NEEDED TO&MAKE PALS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2002": "WOW!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2003": "I HAVE FRIENDS!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2004": "AND WHO KNEW THAT&ALL I NEEDED TO&MAKE THEM.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2006": "WAS TO GIVE PEOPLE&AWFUL PUZZLES AND&THEN FIGHT THEM??/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2007": "YOU TAUGHT ME A&LOT^1, HUMAN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2008": "I HEREBY GRANT&YOU PERMISSION&TO PASS THROUGH!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2009": "AND I'LL GIVE&YOU DIRECTIONS&TO THE SURFACE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2010": "CONTINUE FORWARD&UNTIL YOU REACH THE&END OF THE CAVERN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2011": "\\WTHEN..^1. WHEN YOU&REACH THE CAPITAL^1,&CROSS \\YTHE BARRIER\\W./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2012": "THAT'S THE MAGICAL&SEAL TRAPPING US&ALL UNDERGROUND./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2013": "ANYTHING CAN ENTER&THROUGH IT^1, BUT&NOTHING CAN EXIT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2014": "... EXCEPT SOMEONE&WITH A POWERFUL&SOUL./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2015": "... LIKE YOU!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2016": "THAT'S WHY THE&KING WANTS TO&ACQUIRE A HUMAN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2017": "HE WANTS TO OPEN&THE BARRIER WITH&SOUL POWER./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2018": "THEN US MONSTERS&CAN RETURN TO&THE SURFACE!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2023": "YOU'RE BACK AGAIN?!?!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2024": "I FINALLY REALIZE&THE TRUE REASON WHY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2025": "YOU.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2026": "JUST MISS SEEING MY&FACE SO MUCH.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2027": "I'M NOT SURE I&CAN FIGHT SOMEONE&WHO FEELS THIS WAY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2028": "BUT MOSTLY..^1. I'M GETTING&REALLY TIRED OF&CAPTURING YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2029": "SO..^1.&WHAT DO YOU SAY?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2030": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2031": "* (Fight Papyrus?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2032": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2036": "\\TP %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2039": "OKAY.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2040": "I GUESS./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2041": "IF YOU WANT ME TO&CAPTURE YOU./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2042": "I'LL TRY AGAIN!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2047": "... OKAY.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2048": "I GUESS I'LL ACCEPT&MY FAILURE.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2058": "* Welcome to Snowed Inn^1!&* Snowdin's premier hotel!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2059": "* One night is 80G.& &         Stay        Leave\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2062": "* Back again^1?&* Well^1, stay as long as you&  like./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2063": "* How about it?& &         Stay        Leave\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2065": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2069": "* What^1?&* No^1, you can't get a&  second key!",
  "SCR_TEXT_2074": "* Hello^1!&* Sorry^1, no time for a&  nap.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2075": "* Snowed Inn is shutting&  down so we can all go&  to the surface./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2078": "* Oh^1, there you are^1.&* I was worrying about&  you!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2079": "* Things are going to be OK^1,&  you hear?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2080": "* We're all going to the&  surface world soon.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2081": "* There's bound to be a&  place you can stay there!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2089": "Error./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2092": "* Here's your room key^1.&* Make sure to bundle up!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2098": "* ... You don't even have 80G?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2099": "* Oh^1! You poor thing^1.&* I can only imagine what&  you've been through./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2100": "* One of the rooms upstairs&  is empty^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2101": "* You can sleep there for&  free^1, okay?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2109": "* Here's your room key^1.&* Make sure to bundle up!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2116": "* You aren't carrying enough&  money./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2121": "* Well^1, feel free to come&  back any time./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2125": "* (Look through the telescope?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2126": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2130": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2131": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2139": "* i'm thinking about&  getting into the&  telescope business./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2140": "* it's normally 50000G&  to use this premium&  telescope.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2141": "* but..^1.&*\\E1 since i know you^1,&  you can use it for free./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2142": "\\E2* howzabout it?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2143": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2144": "* (Use the telescope?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2148": "* huh^1?&* you aren't satisfied?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2149": "\\E1* don't worry./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2150": "\\E2* i'll give you a&  full refund./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2152": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2157": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2158": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2169": "* well^1, come back&  whenever you want./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2180": "* Ring..\\E0./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2182": "HELLO^1!&THIS IS PAPYRUS!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2183": "\\E3HOW DID I GET THIS&NUMBER...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2184": "\\E0IT WAS EASY!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2185": "\\E0I JUST DIALED EVERYNUMBER SEQUENTIALLYUNTIL I GOT YOURS!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2186": "NYEH HEH HEH HEH!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2187": "\\E2SO..^1.&WHAT ARE YOU&WEARING...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2188": "\\E3I'M..^1.&ASKING FOR A&FRIEND./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2189": "\\E0SHE THOUGHT SHE&SAW YOU WEARING A&\\[1]./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2190": "\\E3IS THAT TRUE^1?&ARE YOU WEARING A&\\[1]?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2191": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2192": "* (What will you say?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2193": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2206": "SO YOU ARE WEARING&A \\[1].../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2207": "GOT IT!!^1!&WINK WINK!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2208": "HAVE A NICE DAY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2209": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2210": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2215": "SO YOU AREN'T&WEARING A&\\[1].../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2216": "GOT IT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2217": "YOU'RE MY FRIEND^1,&SO I TRUST YOU&100-PERCENT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2218": "HAVE A NICE DAY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2219": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2220": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2227": "* (There's an empty pie tin&  inside the stove.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2231": "\\E0MY BROTHER ALWAYS&GOES OUT TO EAT^1.&BUT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2232": "\\E3RECENTLY^1, HE TRIED&'BAKING' SOMETHING./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2233": "IT WAS LIKE..^1.&A QUICHE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2234": "BUT FILLED WITH A&SUGARY^1, NON-EGG&SUBSTANCE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2235": "\\E0HOW ABSURD!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2240": "* (It's a joke book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2241": "* (Take a look inside?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2242": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2248": "* (Inside the joke book was&  a quantum physics book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2249": "* (You look inside...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2250": "* (Inside the quantum physics&  book was another joke&  book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2251": "* (You look inside...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2252": "* (There's another quantum&  physics book...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2253": "* (You decide to stop.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2257": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2265": "THAT'S MY ROOM^1!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2266": "IF YOU'VE&FINISHED LOOKING&AROUND.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2267": "WE COULD GO IN&AND.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2268": "\"HANG-OUT\" LIKE&A PAIR OF VERY&COOL FRIENDS?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2269": "\\E3DO WHATEVER&PEOPLE DO WHEN&THEY DATE???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2270": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2271": "* (Go inside?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2272": " %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2276": "* (It's the door to&  Papyrus's room.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2277": "* (It's covered in many&  labels...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2278": "\\TP %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2279": "* (NO GIRLS ALLOWED!)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2280": "* (NO BOYS ALLOWED!)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2281": "* (PAPYRUS ALLOWED.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2286": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2297": "THERE ARE NO&SKELETONS INSIDE&MY CLOSET!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2298": "\\E3EXCEPT ME&SOMETIMES./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2299": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2300": "* (Look in the closet?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2301": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2305": "* (Look in the closet?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2306": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2313": "* (Clothes are hung up&  neatly inside.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2317": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2322": "IT'S OK TO BE&INTIMIDATED BY&MY FASHION SENSE./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2328": "\\E3SO^1, UM.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2329": "\\E3IF YOU'VE SEEN&EVERYTHING.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2330": "\\E2DO YOU WANT TO&START HANGING OUT?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2331": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2332": "* (Begin the hangouts?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2333": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2336": "\\E2DO YOU WANT TO&START THE DATE?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2337": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_2338": "* (Begin the date?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2339": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2348": "\\E0OKAY!!^1!&DATING START!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2349": "\\E0OKAY!!^1!&LET'S HANG TEN!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2354": "\\E2TAKE YOUR TIME..^1.&I'LL WAIT FOR&YOU./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2359": "* (This mailbox is labelled&  \"PAPYRUS\".)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2360": "* (Look inside?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2361": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2366": "* (It's empty.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2368": "* (You realize that would&  probably be illegal.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2372": "* what^1?&* haven't you seen a guy&  with two jobs before?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2373": "\\E1* fortunately^1, two jobs&  means twice as many&  legally-required breaks./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2374": "\\E0* i'm going to grillby's.&* wanna come?&  Yeah        I'm busy \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2375": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2376": "* .../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2380": "\\E2* hey^1, looks like you're&  really turning yourself&  around./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2381": "\\E0* how about i treat you&  to lunch at grillby's?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2382": "\\E1* ... when everyone you&  scared away comes&  back^1, i mean./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2389": "* well^1, if you insist..^1.&* i'll pry myself away&  from my work.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2394": "* OK^1. have fun./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2399": "\\E1* whoops^1, watch where&  you sit down./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2400": "* sometimes weirdos put&  whoopee cushions on&  the seats./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2401": "\\E0* anyway^1, let's order./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2402": "* whaddya want...?& &  Fries       Burger\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2403": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2407": "* ok^1, coming right up./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2411": "* hey^1, that sounds&  pretty good./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2412": "* grillby^1, we'll have&  a double order of&  fries./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2418": "* hey^1, that sounds&  pretty good./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2419": "* grillby^1, we'll have&  a double order of&  burg./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2426": "* so^1, what do you&  think.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2427": "* of my brother?& &  Cool        Uncool\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2428": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2434": "* of course he's cool./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2435": "\\E1* you'd be cool too&  if you wore that&  outfit every day./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2436": "\\E0* he'd only take that&  thing off if he&  absolutely had to./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2437": "* oh well^1.&* at least he washes&  it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2438": "\\E1* and by that i mean&  he wears it in&  the shower./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2442": "* hey^1, pal./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2443": "\\E1* sarcasm isn't funny^1,&  okay?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2444": "\\E0* my brother's a real&  star./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2445": "* he's the person who&  pushed me to get&  this sentry job./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2446": "* maybe it's a little&  strange^1, but&  sometimes.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2447": "* ... it's nice to have&  someone call you out&  on being lazy./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2448": "\\E1* even though nothing&  could be further&  from the truth./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2453": "* here comes the grub./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2454": "* want some ketchup^1?& &  Yes         No    \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2455": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2461": "\\E2* bone appetit./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2465": "\\E2* more for me./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2472": "\\W* have you ever heard&  of a \\Ytalking flower\\W?&  Yes         No    \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2473": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2477": "\\E1* so you know all&  about it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2478": "\\E1* i'll tell you^1, then./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2479": "\\W*\\E0 the \\Becho flower\\W./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2480": "* they're all over the&  marsh./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2481": "* say something to them^1,&  and they'll repeat it&  over and over.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2482": "* what about it?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2483": "* well^1, papyrus told&  me something interesting&  the other day./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2484": "* sometimes^1, when no&  one else is around.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2485": "* a flower appears and&  whispers things to&  him./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2486": "* flattery..^1.&* advice..^1.&* encouragement.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2487": "* ... predictions./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2488": "* weird^1, huh?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2489": "* someone must be using&  an echo flower to&  play a trick on him./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2490": "* keep an eye out^1, ok?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2491": "* thanks./%%",
