  "SCR_TEXT_2675": "* (Look inside?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2676": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2682": "* (You open the fridge.^1)&* (The air fills with a&  rotten stench.)/",
