  "SCR_TEXT_2988": "%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2993": "* this is a ghost sandwich.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2994": "* do you want to try it...& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2995": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3001": "* (You attempt to bite&  into the ghost sandwich.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3002": "* (You phase right through&  it...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3003": "* oh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3004": "* nevermind.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3008": "* oh.....................&  ....................&  ................./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3014": "* after a great meal i like&  to lie on the ground and&  feel like garbage.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3015": "* it's a family tradition.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3016": "* do you want..^1.&* ... to join me...&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3017": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3023": "* okay..^1.&* follow my lead.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3028": "* oh.....................&  ....................&  ................./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3034": "* do you want to play a game^1?&* it's called thundersnail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3035": "* the snails will race^1, and if&  the yellow snail wins^1, you&  win./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3036": "* it's 10G to play.& &         Play        No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3037": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3045": "* um..^1.&* you don't have any money?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3046": "* n-no^1, you can still play^1,&  don't worry about it.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3047": "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3048": "* ready?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3052": "* um..^1. that's less than 10G./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3053": "* but since you're my only&  real customer^1, i guess i'll&  just take what you have.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3054": "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3055": "* ready?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3061": "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3062": "* ready?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3068": "* oh.........../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3073": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3074": "* Seven./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3075": "* Seven human souls./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3076": "* With the power of seven&  human souls^1, our king.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3077": "\\W* \\YKing \\RASGORE \\YDreemurr\\W.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3078": "* ... will become a god./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3079": "\\W* With that power^1, \\RASGORE\\W &  can finally shatter the&  barrier./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3080": "* He will finally take the&  surface back from humanity.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3081": "* And give them back the&  suffering and pain that&  we have endured./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3082": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3083": "* Understand^1, human?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3084": "* This is your only chance&  at redemption./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3085": "* Give up your soul.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3086": "* Or I'll tear it from&  your body./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3104": "* Yo^1, I know I'm not supposed&  to be here^1, but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3105": "* I wanna ask you something./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3106": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3107": "* Man^1, I've never had to ask&  anyone this before.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3108": "* Umm.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3109": "* Yo..^1. You're human^1, right?&* Haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3110": "* Man^1! I knew it!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3111": "* ... well^1, I know it now^1,&  I mean.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3112": "* Undyne told me^1, um^1, \"stay&  away from that human.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3113": "* So^1, like^1, ummm.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3114": "* I guess that makes us enemies&  or something./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3115": "* But I kinda stink at that^1,&  haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3116": "* Yo^1, say something mean so&  I can hate you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3117": "* Please? & &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3118": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3124": "* Huh...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3125": "* Yo^1, that's your idea of&  something mean?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3126": "* My sister says that to me&  ALL THE TIME!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3127": "* Guess I have to do it^1, haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3128": "* Yo^1, I..^1. I hate your guts./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3129": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3130": "* Man^1, I..^1. I'm such a turd./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3131": "* I'm..^1. I'm gonna go home&  now./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3135": "* Yo^1, what^1?&* So I have to do it?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3136": "* Here goes nothing.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3137": "* Yo^1, I..^1. I hate your guts./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3138": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3139": "* Man^1, I..^1. I'm such a turd./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3140": "* I'm..^1. I'm gonna go home&  now./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3148": "* (It's a water cooler.)&* (Take a cup of water?)&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3149": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3153": "* (There's no more water left&  in the cooler.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3155": "* (Sadistically^1, you've poured&  out all the water right in&  front of Undyne's eyes.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3163": "* (You take a cup of water.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3171": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3177": "* (Get rid of the water?)& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3178": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3184": "* (You pour the water on&  the ground next to the&  water cooler.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3196": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3201": "* A rousing error./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3205": "* (Give Undyne the water?)& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3206": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3210": "* (She looks dry...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3215": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3238": "* Ring..\\E0./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3240": "HELLO^1!&THIS IS PAPYRUS!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3241": "REMEMBER WHEN&I ASKED YOU&ABOUT CLOTHES?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3242": "\\E3WELL^1, THE FRIEND&WHO WANTED TO&KNOW.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3243": "\\E0HER OPINION OF&YOU IS VERY.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3244": "\\E3MURDERY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3245": "\\E0ERROR!!^1!&SEE YOU LATER!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3250": "\\E0BUT I BET YOU&KNEW THAT&ALREADY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3251": "\\E3AND BECAUSE YOU&KNEW THAT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3252": "\\E0I TOLD HER WHAT&YOU TOLD ME&YOU WERE WEARING!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3253": "A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3254": "BECAUSE I KNEW^1,&OF COURSE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3255": "\\E3AFTER SUCH A&SUSPICIOUS&QUESTION.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3256": "\\E0YOU WOULD&OBVIOUSLY CHANGE&YOUR CLOTHES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3257": "YOU'RE SUCH A&SMART COOKIE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3258": "THIS WAY YOU'RE&SAFE AND I&DIDN'T LIE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3259": "NO BETRAYAL&ANYWHERE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3260": "BEING FRIENDS&WITH EVERYONE&IS EASY!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3261": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3262": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3268": "\\E0WELL^1, WORRY&NOT DEAR HUMAN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3269": "PAPYRUS WOULD&NEVER BETRAY YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3270": "\\E3I AM NOT A&CRUEL PERSON./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3271": "\\E0I STRIVE TO BE&COMFORTING AND&PLEASANT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3272": "PAPYRUS!&HE SMELLS LIKE&THE MOON./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3273": "SO, BECAUSE OF&MY INHERENT&GOODNESS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3274": "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE NOT WEARING&A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3275": "\\E3EVEN THOUGH YOU&TOLD ME YOU&WERE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3276": "INSTEAD^1, I MADE&SOMETHING UP!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3277": "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE WEARING.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3278": "\\E0A \\[2]./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3279": "\\E3IT PAINED ME TO&TELL SUCH A&BOLDFACED LIE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3280": "I KNOW YOU WOULD&NEVER EVER WEAR&A \\[2]./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3281": "\\E0BUT YOUR SAFETY&IS MORE IMPORTANT&THAN FASHION./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3282": "\\E3DANG!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3283": "I JUST WANT TO&BE FRIENDS WITH&EVERYONE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3284": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3285": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3291": "\\E0WELL^1, WORRY&NOT DEAR HUMAN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3292": "\\E3PAPYRUS WOULD&NEVER BETRAY YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3293": "\\WY\\E0OU SAID YOU WERE\\Y &NOT WEARING A&\\[1]\\W./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3294": "\\E3SO OF COURSE&I ACTUALLY&TOLD HER.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3295": "\\E0YOU WERE&INDEED WEARING&A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3296": "\\E3IT PAINED ME TO&TELL SUCH A&BOLDFACED LIE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3297": "BUT SINCE YOU&AREN'T WEARING&A \\[1]./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3298": "\\E0SHE SURELY&WON'T ATTACK&YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3299": "NOW YOU ARE&SAFE AND SOUND./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3300": "\\E2WOWIE..^1.&THIS IS HARD./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3301": "I JUST WANT TO&BE EVERYBODY'S&FRIEND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3302": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3303": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3309": "\\E0BUT I BET YOU&KNEW THAT&ALREADY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3310": "\\E3AND BECAUSE YOU&KNEW THAT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3311": "\\E0I KNEW WHEN&YOU SAID:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3312": "\\E3\"I AM NOT&WEARING A&\\[1].\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3313": "\\E0IT WAS REALLY&A SECRET CODE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3314": "\\E3YOU REALLY&MEANT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3315": "\\E0\"I ACTUALLY AM&WEARING&A \\[1]!\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3316": "YOU WERE TRYING&TO PROTECT&YOURSELF.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3317": "WHILE MAKING IT&SO I DIDN'T&HAVE TO LIE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3318": "I PICKED UP ON&THIS, AND FOLLOWED&YOUR PLAN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3319": "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE NOT WEARING&A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3320": "IN FACT I TOOK&IT ONE STEP&FURTHER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3321": "\\E3I TOLD HER YOU&WERE PROBABLY.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3322": "\\E0WEARING A&\\[2]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3323": "\\E3OF COURSE, YOU&WOULD NEVER&WEAR THAT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3324": "\\E0BUT THAT'S THE&POINT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3325": "SHE WON'T&RECOGNIZE YOU&NOW!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3326": "AND I DIDN'T&HAVE TO BETRAY&EITHER OF YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3327": "SINCE I JUST&TOLD HER WHAT&YOU SAID!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3328": "WOWIE^1!&YOU'RE SUCH A&SMART COOKIE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3329": "I REALLY CAN&BE FRIENDS WITH&EVERYONE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3330": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3331": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3337": "* Ring..\\E0./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3339": "HEY^1!&WHAT'S UP!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3340": "I WAS JUST&THINKING.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3341": "YOU^1, ME^1, AND&UNDYNE SHOULD ALL&HANG OUT SOMETIME!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3342": "I THINK YOU&WOULD MAKE&GREAT PALS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3343": "LET'S MEET UP&AT HER HOUSE&LATER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3344": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3345": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3348": "AFTER YOU HANG&OUT WITH ME.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3349": "LET'S MEET UP&AT HER HOUSE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3350": "I THINK YOU&WOULD MAKE&GREAT PALS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3351": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3352": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3393": "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 7.)&         Read it     Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3394": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3398": "* When a human dies^1, its&  soul remains stable&  outside the body./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3399": "* Meanwhile^1, a monster's soul&  disappears near-instantly&  upon death./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3400": "* This allows monsters to&  absorb the souls of&  humans.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3401": "* While it is extremely&  difficult for humans to&  absorb a monster's soul./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3402": "* This is why they feared us./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3403": "* Though monsters are weak^1,&  with enough human souls.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3404": "* They could easily destroy&  all of mankind./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3407": "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3413": "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 8.)&         Read it     Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3414": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3418": "* There is one exception&  to the aforementioned&  rules:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3419": "* A certain type of monster^1,&  the \"boss\" monster./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3420": "* Due to its life cycle^1, it&  possesses an incredibly&  strong soul for a monster./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3421": "* This soul can remain&  stable after death^1, if&  only for a few moments./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3424": "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3429": "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3430": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3434": "* (You look inside a book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3435": "* (It's a comic of a giant&  robot fighting a beautiful&  alien princess.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3436": "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3441": "* (You decide not to.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3446": "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3447": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3451": "* (You look inside a book.)&* (It's a comic book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3452": "* (Two scantily-clad chefs are&  flinging energy pancakes&  at each other.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3453": "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3458": "* (You decide not to.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3463": "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3464": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3469": "* (You look inside a book.)&* (It's a comic book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3470": "* (A hideous android is running&  to school with toast in&  its mouth.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3471": "* (Seems like it's late.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3472": "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3477": "* (You decide not to.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3482": "* (There's a piano here.^1)&* (Play it?)&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3483": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3487": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3488": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3495": "See that heart^1? &That is your SOUL^1,&the very culmination&of your being!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3496": "Your SOUL starts off&weak^1, but can grow&strong if you gain&a lot of LV./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3497": "What's LV stand for^1?&Why^1, LOVE^1, of course!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3498": "You want some&LOVE, don't you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3499": "Don't worry,&I'll share some&with you!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3503": "Down here^1, LOVE is&shared through..^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3504": "Little white..^2.\\E1 &\"friendliness&pellets.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3505": "\\E2Are you ready\\E0?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3509": "Move around^1!&Get as many as&you can^2!%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3510": "%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3514": "You idiot./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3515": "In this world^1, it's&kill or BE killed./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3516": "Why would ANYONE pass&up an opportunity&like this!?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3520": "Die./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3524": "Hey buddy^1,&you missed them./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3525": "Let's try again^1,&okay?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3528": "Is this a joke^2?&Are you braindead^2?&RUN^2. INTO^2. THE^2.&BULLETS!!!",
  "SCR_TEXT_3531": "You know what's&going on here^1,&don't you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3532": "You just wanted to&see me suffer./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3535": "\\E1What a terrible&creature^1, torturing&such a poor^1,&innocent youth.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3536": "\\E2Ah, do not be&afraid^1, my child./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3537": "\\XI am \\BTORIEL\\X,&caretaker of&the \\RRUINS\\X./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3538": "I pass through this&place every day to&see if anyone has&fallen down./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3539": "You are the first&human to come here&in a long time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3540": "I will do my best&to ensure your&protection during&your time here./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3541": "\\E2Come^2!&I will guide you&through the&catacombs./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3542": "%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3548": "* Three gold for the ferry.& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3549": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3553": "* Later^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3554": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3559": "* Hop on!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3564": "* (It's a switch.)& &         Press it    Don't\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3565": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3571": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3584": "* (The lasers were deactivated.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3591": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3604": "* (The lasers were reactivated.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3612": "* Ring.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3613": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3614": "\\E1* Um.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3615": "\\E0* I noticed you've been&  kind of quiet.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3616": "\\W*\\E8 Are you w-worried&  about meeting \\RASGORE\\W...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3617": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3618": "\\E0* W-well^1, don't worry^1,&  okay?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3619": "\\E7* Th-the king is a&  really nice guy.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3620": "\\E0* I'm sure you can&  talk to him^1, and.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3621": "* W-with your human&  soul^1, you can pass&  through the barrier!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3622": "* S-so no worrying^1, OK^1?&* J-just forget about it&  and smile./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3623": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3624": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3630": "* hey buddy^1, what's up^1?&* wanna buy a hot dog?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3631": "* it's only 30G.& &  Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3632": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3638": "* here^1.&* have fun./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3641": "* here's another hot&  dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3642": "* it's on the house^1.&* well^1, no^1.&* it's on you./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3653": "* sorry^1, thirty is&  the limit on&  head-dogs./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3656": "\\TS*^1 \\Tsi'll be 'frank' with&  you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3657": "* as much as i like&  putting hot dogs&  on your head.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3658": "* thirty is just&  an excessive number./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3659": "* twenty-nine^1, now&  that's fine^1, but&  thirty.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3660": "* does it look like&  my arms can reach&  that high?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3687": "* thanks, kid^1.&* here's your hot dog./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3690": "* thanks, kid^1.&* here's your 'dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3691": "* yeah^1. 'dog^1.&* apostrophe-dog^1.&* it's short for hot-dog./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3695": "* another h'dog^1?&* here you go.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3696": "* whoops^1, i'm actually&  out of hot dogs./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3697": "* here^1, you can have&  a hot cat instead./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3701": "* another dog^1, coming&  right up.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3702": "* ... you really like&  hot animals^1, don't&  you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3703": "* hey^1, i'm not judging./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3704": "* i'd be out of a job&  without folks like you./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3708": "* cool^1.&* here's that ''dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3709": "* apostrophe-apostrophe&  dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3710": "* it's short for&  apostrophe-dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3711": "* which is^1, in turn^1,&  short for.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3715": "* another one^1?&* okay./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3716": "* careful^1.&* if you eat&  too many hot dogs.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3717": "* you'll probably get&  huge like me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3718": "* huge as in super-&  popular^1, i mean./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3719": "* i'm practically&  a hot-dog tycoon now./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3725": "* whoops^1, you don't have&  enough cash./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3726": "* you should get a job^1.&* i've heard being a&  sentry pays well./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3729": "* you're holding too much^1.&* ... guess i'll just put&  it on your head./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3738": "* yeah^1, you've gotta&  save your money for&  college and spiders./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3743": "* Ring.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3744": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3745": "* L-looks like you&  beat him!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3746": "\\E0* Y-you did a really&  great job out there./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3747": " &  All thanks&  to you      ... \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3748": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3754": "\\E3* What^1?&* Oh no^1, I mean.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3755": "\\E4* You were the one&  doing everything cool!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3756": "\\E0* I just wrote some&  silly programs for&  your phone./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3760": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3761": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3762": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3765": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3766": "\\E4* ... umm^1, h-hey^1, this&  might sound strange^1,&  but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3767": "\\E6* ... c-can I tell&  you something?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3768": "\\E9* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3769": "\\E4* B-before I met you^1,&  I d-didn't really.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3770": "\\E9* I didn't really&  like myself very&  much./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3771": "* For a long time^1,&  I f-felt like a&   total screw-up./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3772": "\\E9* L-like I couldn't&  do a-anything&  w-without.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3773": "\\E9* W-without ending up&  letting everyone&  down./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3774": "\\E3* B-but...!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3775": "\\E4* Guiding you has&  made me feel.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3776": "\\E9* A lot better about&  myself./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3777": "\\E0* So... thanks for&  letting me help&  you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3778": "\\E9* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3779": "\\E4* Uhhh^1, anyway^1, we're&  almost to the CORE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3780": "\\E0* It's just past&  MTT Resort./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3781": "\\E6* Come on^1!&* Let's finish this!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3782": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3783": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3787": "\\E0EUREKA!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3788": "I'VE FIGURED OUT&THE PUZZLE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3789": "\\E3YOU SEEM LIKE&YOU'RE HAVING&FUN^1, THOUGH.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3790": "\\E0DO YOU ABSOLUTELY^1,&DAPSOLUTELY WANT&THE SOLUTION???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3791": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3792": "* (Do you absolutely^1,&  dapsolutely want the answer?)&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3793": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3800": "THE^1!&SOLUTION^1!&IS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3801": "(PLEASE IMAGINE&A DRUMROLL IN&YOUR HEAD)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3802": "... THAT TREE&OVER THERE HAS&A SWITCH ON IT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3803": "CHECK IT&OUTIE!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3807": "WOW..^1.&YOU'RE TRULY A&PUZZLE PASSIONEER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3808": "I'M SO ENTHUSED&BY YOUR&ENTHUSIASM!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3809": "YOU CAN DO IT^1,&HUMAN!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3814": "I'VE FIGURED OUT&THE PUZZLE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3815": "\\E0DO YOU ABSOLUTELY^1,&DAPSOLUTELY WANT&THE SOLUTION???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3816": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3817": "* (Do you absolutely^1,&  dapsolutely want the answer?)&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3818": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3825": "THE^1!&SOLUTION^1!&IS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3826": "(PLEASE IMAGINE&A DRUMROLL IN&YOUR HEAD)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3827": "... THAT TREE&OVER THERE HAS&A SWITCH ON IT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3828": "CHECK IT&OUTIE!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3832": "WOW..^1.&YOU'RE TRULY A&PUZZLE PASSIONEER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3833": "I'M SO ENTHUSED&BY YOUR&ENTHUSIASM!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3834": "YOU CAN DO IT^1,&HUMAN!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3839": "* (There's a switch on the&  trunk of this tree.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3840": "* (Press it?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3841": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3845": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3859": "OHO^1!&THE HUMAN ARRIVES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3860": "ARE YOU READY TO&HANG OUT WITH&UNDYNE?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3861": "I HAVE A PLAN&TO MAKE YOU TWO&GREAT FRIENDS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3862": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3863": "* (Will you hang out?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3864": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3872": "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3878": "HMMM..^1.&STILL GETTING&READY?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3879": "\\E0TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3884": "OKAY^1!&ALL READIED-UP&TO HANG OUT!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3885": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3886": "* (Will you hang out?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3887": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3895": "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3901": "TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3910": "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3916": "TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3921": "\\E4* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3922": "\\E5* So why are YOU&  here?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3923": "\\E4* To rub your victory&  in my face?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3924": "\\E4* To humiliate me&  even further?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3925": "\\E1* IS THAT IT? & &  Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3926": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3932": "\\E2* Oh-ho-ho-ho./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3933": "\\E1* Well^1, I've got news&  for you^1, BRAT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3934": "\\E2* You're on MY&  battlefield now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3935": "\\E3* And you AREN'T&  going to&  humiliate me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3936": "\\E3* I'll TELL you&  what's going to&  happen./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3937": "\\E0* We're going to&  hang out./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3938": "\\E2* We're going to&  have a good&  time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3939": "\\M1* We're going to&  become \"friends.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3940": "\\E3* You'll become so&  enamored with me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3941": "\\E1* YOU'LL be the one&  feeling humiliated&  for your actions!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3942": "\\E6* Fuhuhuhuhu!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3943": "\\M2* It's the perfect&  revenge!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3944": "\\E1* Err.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3945": "\\E9* Why don't you&  have a seat?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3951": "\\E4* Then why are you&  here?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3952": "\\E1* ...!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3953": "\\E2* Wait^1, I get it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3954": "\\E3* You think that I'm&  gonna be friends&  with you^1, huh?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3955": "* Right???&              NEVER &  Yes         with you\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3956": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3963": "\\E6* Really^1?&* How delightful!^1!&* I accept!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3964": "* Let's all frolick&  in the fields&  of friendship!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3965": "\\E2* ...NOT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3966": "\\E2* Why would I EVER&  be friends with&  YOU!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3967": "\\E3* If you weren't my&  houseguest^1, I'd beat&  you up right now!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3968": "\\E0* You're the enemy&  of everyone's hopes&  and dreams!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3969": "\\E1* I WILL NEVER&  BE YOUR FRIEND./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3970": "\\E3* Now get out of&  my house!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3976": "\\E1* WHAT?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3977": "\\E4* First you parade&  into my house^1,&  then you INSULT me?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3978": "\\E2* You little BRAT^1!&* I have half a&  mind to.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3979": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3980": "\\E3* Wait./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3981": "\\E2* I'll prove you&  WRONG./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3982": "\\E3* We ARE going to&  be friends./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3983": "\\E1* In fact.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3984": "\\E3* We./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3985": "\\M1* Are going to be&  BESTIES./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3986": "* I'll make you like&  me so much.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3987": "\\E1* Your WHOLE LIFE&  will revolve around&  me!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3988": "\\M2* It's the perfect&  revenge!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3989": "\\E6* FUHUHUHUHU!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3990": "\\E1* Err.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3991": "\\E9* Now^1, why don't&  you have a seat?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3998": "* (Sit down and progress?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3999": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4003": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4010": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4011": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4016": "* That sugar's for&  the tea./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4017": "\\E2* I'm not gonna give&  you a cup of&  sugar!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4018": "\\E6* What do I look&  like^1, the ice-cream&  woman?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4019": "\\E2* Do human ice-cream&  women TERRORIZE HUMANITY&  with ENERGY SPEARS?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4020": "\\E3* Are their ice-cream&  songs a PRELUDE TO&  DESTRUCTION?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4021": "\\E1* IS THAT IT? & &  Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4022": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4028": "\\E1* ... what^1?&* REALLY?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4029": "\\E6* That rules!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4033": "\\E3* That's what I&  thought./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4038": "* Envision these&  vegetables as your&  greatest enemy!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4039": "\\E2* Now!^1!&* Pound them to dust&  with your fists!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4041": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4042": "* (How will you pound?)& &         Strong      Wimpy\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4043": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4050": "* (You punch the vegetables&  at full force^1.&* You knock over a tomato.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4052": "* YEAH^1!&* YEAH!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4053": "\\E1* Our hearts are&  uniting against these&  healthy ingredients!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4054": "\\M2* NOW IT'S MY TURN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4055": "* NGAHHH!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4060": "* (You pet the vegetables&  in an affectionate&  manner.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4062": "* OH MY GOD!!^1!&* STOP PETTING THE&  ENEMY!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4063": "\\M2* I'll show you&  how it's done!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4064": "* NGAHHH!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4071": "* ... we add the&  noodles!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4072": "\\E0* Homemade noodles&  are the best!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4073": "\\E6* BUT I JUST BUY&  STORE-BRAND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4074": "\\M2* THEY'RE THE&  CHEAPEST!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4075": "\\E1* NGAHHHHHHHHH&  HHHHHHHHHH!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4076": "\\E9* Uhh^1, just put them&  in the pot./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4077": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4078": "\\M0* (How will you put them in?)& &         Fiercely    Careful\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4079": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4086": "* (You throw everything into&  the pot as hard as you can^1,&  including the box.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4087": "* (It clanks against the&  empty bottom.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4089": "\\M2* YEAH!!^1!&* I'M INTO IT!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4094": "* (You place the noodles&  in one at a time.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4095": "* (They clank against the&  empty bottom.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4097": "* Nice???/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4103": "\\E0* Humans suck^1, but&  their history..^1.&* Kinda rules./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4104": "\\E2* Case in point^1:&* This giant sword!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4105": "\\E0* Historically^1, humans&  wielded swords up&  to 10x their size./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4106": "\\E1* RIGHT?& &  True        False\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4107": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4113": "\\E6* Heh^1, I knew it!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4114": "\\E2* When I first heard&  that^1, I immediately&  wanted one!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4115": "\\E0* So me and Alphys&  built a giant&  sword together./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4116": "\\E0* She figured out all&  the specs herself.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4117": "\\E6* She's smart^1, huh!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4121": "\\E2* Pfft^1!&* You liar!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4122": "\\E3* I've READ Alphys's&  human history book&  collection!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4123": "\\E3* I know all about&  your giant swords.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4124": "\\E3* Your colossal^1,&  alien-fighting&  robots.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4125": "* Your supernatural&  princesses.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4126": "\\E6* Heh^1! There's no&  way you're gonna&  fool me!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4131": "* (Look inside the bone drawer?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4132": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4136": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4147": "\\M5* WHAT A SENSATIONAL OPPORTUNITY&  FOR A STORY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4148": "\\M3* I CAN SEE THE HEADLINE NOW:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4149": "\\M4* \"A DOG EXISTS SOMEWHERE.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4150": "\\M2* FRANKLY^1, I'M BLOWN AWAY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4151": "* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4152": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4159": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4165": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4170": "\\M5* THIS DOG..^1.&* STILL EXISTS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4171": "* THIS STORY..^1.&* JUST KEEPS GETTING&  BETTER AND BETTER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4172": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4173": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4179": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4185": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4191": "\\M5* OH MY!!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4192": "\\M2* ... IT'S A COMPLETELY&  NONDESCRIPT GLASS OF WATER./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4193": "\\M4* BUT ANYTHING CAN MAKE&  A GREAT STORY WITH ENOUGH&  SPIN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4194": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4195": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4201": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4207": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4214": "\\M3* I'M HONORED TO BE IN THE&  PRESENCE OF SUCH A HUGE&  LUKEWARM WATER FAN^1, FOLKS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4215": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4216": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4222": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4228": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4234": "\\M5* OH NO!!^1!&* THAT MOVIE SCRIPT!!^1!&* HOW'D??^1? THAT GET THERE???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4235": "\\M4* IT'S A SUPER-JUICY SNEAK&  PREVIEW OF MY LATEST&  GUARANTEED-NOT-TO-BOMB FILM:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4236": "\\M6* METTATON THE MOVIE XXVIII..^1.&  STARRING METTATON!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4237": "\\M1* I'VE HEARD THAT LIKE THE&  OTHER FILMS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4238": "\\M1* IT CONSISTS MOSTLY OF A SINGLE&  FOUR-HOUR SHOT OF ROSE PETALS&  SHOWERING ON MY RECLINING BODY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4239": "\\M5* OOH!!^1!&* BUT THAT'S!!^1!&* NOT CONFIRMED!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4240": "\\M5* YOU WOULDN'T (COUGH) SPOIL MY&  MOVIE FOR EVERYONE WITH A&  PROMOTIONAL STORY^1, WOULD YOU?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4241": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
