  "SCR_TEXT_4255": "\\M2 %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4260": "\\M3* OH^1!&* YOU'RE BACK!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4261": "\\M6* THAT'S RIGHT^1, FOLKS^1!&* IT SEEMS NO ONE CAN RESIST&  THE ALLURE OF MY NEW FILM!/",
