  "SCR_TEXT_4318": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4326": "\\M5* OH MY^1! IT'S A PRESENT^1!&* AND IT'S ADDRESSED TO YOU^1,&  DARLING!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4327": "\\M6* AREN'T YOU JUST BURSTING&  WITH EXCITEMENT?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4328": "\\M5* WHAT COULD BE INSIDE^1?&* WELL^1, NO TIME LIKE THE&  \"PRESENT\" TO FIND OUT!/",
