  "SCR_TEXT_4356": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4362": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4369": "\\M5* OOH LA LA^1!&* THIS VIDEO GAME YOU FOUND..^1.&* IS DYNAMITE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4370": "\\M4* THOUGH I DON'T MAKE AN&  APPEARANCE IN IT UNTIL&  THREE-FOURTHS IN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4371": "\\M3* BUT I LIKE THAT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4372": "\\M6* APPEARING FROM THE HEAVENS LIKE&  MANNA^1, SLAKING THE AUDIENCE'S&  HUNGER FOR GORGEOUS ROBOTS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4373": "\\M5* OOH^1!&* THAT'S METTATON!/",
