  "SCR_TEXT_4415": "* Buy a Spider Cider for 9999G?& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4416": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4433": "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a jug./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4434": "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4436": "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4439": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4447": "* Buy a Spider Donut for 9999G?& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4448": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4465": "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a donut./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4466": "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4468": "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4471": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4477": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit.&* (I have heard you are quite&  merciful^1, for a human...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4478": "\\W* (Surely you know by now a&  monster wears a \\YYELLOW\\W name&  when you can \\YSPARE\\W it.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4479": "* (What do you think of that?)&         Very        It's&         Helpful     Bad\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4480": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4486": "* (It is rather helpful.^1)&* (Remember^1, sparing is just&  saying you won't fight.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4487": "* (Maybe one day^1, you'll&  have to do it even if&  their name isn't yellow.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4491": "* (Really^1? Then^1, I'll tell all&  of my friends to tell&  their friends' friends...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4492": "* (Never use yellow names.)&* (How about that?)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4493": "         Keep        No more&         Yellow      Yellow&         Names       Names\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4494": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4501": "* (OK^1, they will still&  use yellow names.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4505": "* (OK^1, I will let them&  know not to use yellow&  names.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4511": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (How are you doing without&  yellow names?)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4512": "                     Bring &         It's        Them&         great       Back\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4513": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4519": "* (Glad to hear it.^1)&* (Though^1, I do not know why&  you dislike yellow.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4520": "* (You had better hope you do&  not encounter a banana-themed&  monster.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4524": "* (Huh^1? It's rather inconvenient&  that you changed your mind&  like this.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4525": "* (Since I told everyone&  not to use yellow names^1,&  everyone threw theirs out.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4526": "* (This is really troubling...^1)&* (Hmmm...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4527": "\\W* (Well^1, last year it was&  fashionable to have \\ppink\\W &  names.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4528": "* (I think everyone still&  has those in their closets&  somewhere...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4529": "* (I'll ask everyone to look.^1)&* (But this is the last time!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4535": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit...&* (I hope you're satisfied.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4540": "* \\YNAPSTABLOOK22 has sent you&  a friend request.\\W /",
  "SCR_TEXT_4541": "* Accept the request?& &         Accept      Reject\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4542": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4547": "* (It seems to have already&  rejected itself...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4588": "* hey^1.&* i heard you're going&  to the core./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4589": "\\E0* how about grabbing some&  dinner with me first?&  Yeah        I'm busy \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4590": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4591": "* .../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4597": "* great^1, thanks for&  treating me./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4602": "* well^1, have fun in&  there./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4609": "* This is the barrier./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4610": "* This is what keeps&  us all trapped&  underground./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4611": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4612": "* If.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4613": "* If by chance you&  have any unfinished&  business.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4614": "* Please do what you&  must./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4615": " & &         Continue    Go Back\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4616": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4623": "* ..^2.&* ... I see.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4624": "* This is it^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4630": "* I see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4631": "* Anything you want to&  do is important&  enough./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4632": "* Even something as small&  as reading a book^1,&  or taking a walk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4633": "* Please take your time./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4639": "* Oh..^1.&* Back so soon?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4640": "* How are you feeling?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4641": " & &         Ready       Go Back\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4642": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4649": "* ..^2.&* ... I see.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4650": "* This is it^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4655": "* I see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4656": "* Do what you have to./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4662": "* Tra la la^1.&* I am the riverman./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4663": "* Or am I the riverwoman...^1?&* It doesn't really matter./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4664": "* I love to ride in my boat^1.&* Would you care to join me?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4665": "* (Ride in the boat?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4666": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4669": "* Tra la la^1.&* Care for a ride?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4670": "* (Ride in the boat?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4671": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4678": "* Where will we go today?& &         Error       Error\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4680": "* Where will we go today?& &         Snowdin     Waterfall\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4682": "* Where will we go today?& &         Snowdin     Hotland\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4684": "* Where will we go today?& &         Waterfall   Hotland\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4686": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4691": "* Then perhaps another time^1.&* Or perhaps not^1.&* It doesn't really matter./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4713": "* Then we're off.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4720": "* (There's a switch on the&  wall.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4721": "* (Press it?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4722": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4725": "* (The switch doesn't do&  anything.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4729": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4743": "* (Seems like a comfortable&  bed.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4744": "* (Lie on it?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4745": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4749": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4763": "* (It's just a regular suspicious&  bed now.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4767": "* (It's a yellow key.^1)&* (You put it on your&  keychain.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4772": "* (There's something under&  the sheets.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4773": "* (Check it out?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4774": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4779": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4791": "* (The power has been turned&  on.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4794": "* (It seems like this controls&  the elevator's power.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4795": "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4796": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4801": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4816": "\\E7* I always was a crybaby^1,&  wasn't I^1, \\[C]?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4817": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4818": "\\E2* ... I know./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4819": "\\E0* You're not actually&  \\[C], are you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4820": "\\E7* \\[C]'s been gone for&  a long time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4821": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4822": "\\E9* Um..^1. what.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4823": "\\E0* What IS your name?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4824": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4825": "\\E5* \"Frisk?\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4826": "\\E7* That's.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4827": "\\E5* A nice name./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4828": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4829": "\\E7* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4830": "\\E0* I haven't felt like&  this for a long time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4831": "\\E2* As a flower^1, I was&  soulless./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4832": "\\E1* I lacked the power to&  love other people./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4833": "\\E2* However^1, with everyone's&  souls inside me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4834": "\\E7* I not only have my own&  compassion back.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4835": "\\E5* But I can feel every&  other monster's as&  well./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4836": "\\E7* They all care about&  each other so much./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4837": "\\E0* And..^1. they care about&  you too^1, Frisk./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4838": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4839": "\\E7* I wish I could tell&  you how everyone&  feels about you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4840": "* Papyrus..^1. Sans..^1.&* Undyne..^1. Alphys.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4841": "\\E0* ... Toriel./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4842": "\\E7* Monsters are weird./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4843": "\\E5* Even though they barely&  know you.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4844": "\\E6* It feels like they&  all really love&  you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4845": "\\E8* Haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4846": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4847": "\\E1* Frisk..^1. I..^1.&* I understand if you&  can't forgive me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4848": "* I understand if you&  hate me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4849": "* I acted so strange and&  horrible./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4850": "\\E3* I hurt you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4851": "* I hurt so many people./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4852": "\\E1* Friends^1, family^1,&  bystanders.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4853": "\\E3* There's no excuse for&  what I've done./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4855": " & &  Forgive     Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4856": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4862": "\\E3* Wh..^1. what?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4863": "\\E7* ... Frisk^1, come on./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4864": "\\E0* You're..^1.&* You're gonna make me&  cry again./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4865": "\\E7* ... besides^1, even if&  you do forgive me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4869": "\\E2* ... right^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4870": "* I understand./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4871": "\\E1* I just hope that.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4872": "* I can make up for&  it a little right&  now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4875": "\\E1* I can't keep these&  souls inside of me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4876": "\\E0* The least I can do&  is return them./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4877": "\\E2* But first.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4878": "\\E4* There's something I&  have to do./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4879": "* Right now^1, I can feel&  everyone's hearts&  beating as one./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4880": "* They're all burning&  with the same&  desire./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4881": "* With everyone's power..^1.&* With everyone's&  determination.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4882": "* It's time for&  monsters.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4883": "* To finally go free./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4887": "\\E7* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4888": "\\E0* I have to go now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4889": "\\E7* Without the power of&  everyone's souls.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4890": "\\E1* I can't keep&  maintaining this&  form./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4891": "* In a little while.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4892": "* I'll turn back into&  a flower./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4893": "\\E3* I'll stop being&  \"myself.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4894": "* I'll stop being able&  to feel love again./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4895": "\\E1* So..^1. Frisk./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4896": "\\E7* It's best if you&  just forget about&  me^1, OK?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4897": "\\E0* Just go be with&  the people who&  love you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4898": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4899": " &         Comfort&         him         Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4900": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4919": "\\E0* So^1, Alphys.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4920": "\\E9* What do you want&  to do now that&  we're all free?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4921": "\\E0* We have the whole&  world to explore&  now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4923": "\\E3* W-well^1, of course&  I'm going to go&  out and.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4924": "\\E4* Um.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4925": "\\E3* No^1, I should be&  honest!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4926": "\\E1* I'm gonna stay inside&  and watch anime like&  a total loser!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4928": "\\E0THAT'S THE SPIRIT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4929": "EVERYONE!!^1!&A CELEBRATION!!!&TO BEING LOSERS!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4931": "\\E9* Heh^1.&* Papyrus has the&  right idea./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4932": "\\E0* Losing to Frisk is&  the best thing to&  ever happen to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4933": "\\E0* So I'm glad that&  we.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4934": "\\E9* Huh^1?&* What is it^1, Asgore?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4936": "\\E2* Um..^1. what's an.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4937": "\\E0* ... anime?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4939": "\\E1* (Oh My God?)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4940": "\\E3* (Frisk^1. Please.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4941": "\\E2* (Help me explain what&  anime is to Asgore.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4942": "\\E0* Y-you see^1, it's&  like a cartoon^1,&  but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4943": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4944": " &         With        With&         Sword's     Gun's\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4945": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4950": "\\E2* So it's like a&  cartoon..^1.&* But with swords?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4952": "\\E2* So it's like a&  cartoon..^1.&* But with guns?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4953": "\\E0* Golly^1!&* That sounds neato!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4954": "\\E3* Where is this^1?&* Where can I see the&  Anime./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4956": "\\E3* H-hold on^1, uh..^1.&* I think I have&  some on my phone./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4957": "\\E0* Here^1, l-look at&  this!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4958": "\\E0* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4959": "\\E3*...Oh^1, uh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4960": "\\E4* Um..^1. that's the..^1.&* That's the wrong.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4961": "\\E5* Uh^1, nevermind./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4963": "* Golly^1.&* Were those two robots.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4965": "\\E9* ... kissing?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4967": "\\E0* Boy^1!&* Technology sure is&  something^1, isn't it?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4969": "\\E5* Eheheh..^1. yeah^1!&* It sure is!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4973": "\\E0* Psst..^1.&* F-Frisk./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4974": "\\E3* Um^1, you've gotta&  tell me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4975": "\\E6* D..^1. do you think&  Asgore and Toriel&  are...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4976": "\\E3* Uh^1, ever gonna get&  back together?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4977": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4978": "& &         Yeah        Nope\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4979": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4983": "* Error.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4987": "\\E7* Y-yeah!!^1!&* Yeah^1, that's what&  I hope^1, too./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4988": "\\E7* Just think about how&  cute they must have&  been together./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4989": "\\E0* It's quickly becoming&  my number one ship&  of all time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4990": "\\E7* Tori and Gorey.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4991": "\\E5* My..^1.&* My old boss and&  his ex-wife./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4992": "\\E8* ... uh^1, that sounds&  a lot less cool&  all of a sudden./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4998": "\\E8* ... yeah^1, that's what&  I thought./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4999": "\\E7* A woman can dream&  though^1, right?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5000": "\\E2* And write fanfiction./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5001": "\\E1* A LOT of fanfiction./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5007": "\\E0* Frisk^1!&* I just realized!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5008": "\\E3* Now that we aren't&  fighting each&  other.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5009": "\\E2* I can finally ask&  you.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5010": "\\E0* \"Would you like a&  cup of tea?\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5011": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5012": "\\E0* Would you like a&  cup of tea?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5013": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5014": "& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5015": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5019": "* Error.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5023": "* Oh^1!&* Well!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5024": "\\E3* Actually^1, the cup I&  had is cold now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5025": "* So you shouldn't&  have it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5026": "\\E0* But^1, I am so&  happy you said&  yes./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5027": "\\E0* As soon as I can^1,&  I will make some&  more for you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5028": "\\E0* Then we can be&  great pals./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5034": "\\E3* Oh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5035": "\\E3* Okay./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5037": "\\E2* Frisk^1! Stop^1!&* You're breaking his&  big burly heart!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5039": "\\E2* Um^1, it's OK^1, Undyne./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5040": "\\E0* My heart's already&  broken./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5042": "\\E6* ASGORE^1! STOP^1!&* YOU'RE BREAKING MY&  BIG BURLY HEART!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5044": "\\E9* Y-yeah^1, Asgore^1.&* Don't break Undyne's&  heart./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5045": "\\E2* That's my job./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5047": "\\E2* OH MY GOD!&* YOU'RE GOING BACK&  IN THE TRASH!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5049": "\\E0CAN I GO IN THE&TRASH TOO?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5051": "\\E9* Sure^1, Papyrus./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5053": "\\E1* guess i have to&  go in the trash&  too./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5055": "\\E0* Oh^1, may I enter&  the trash as well?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5057": "\\E1* Uh^1, okay?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5059": "\\E0* Am I invited to&  the trash?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5061": "\\E6* SURE!!!&* WHY NOT!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5063": "\\E1* On second thought^1,&  do not put me&  in the trash./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5065": "\\E5* Oh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5067": "\\E1* OH MY GOD!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5073": "* (If you leave here^1, your&  adventure will really&  be over.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5074": "* (Your friends will follow&  you out of the underground.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5075": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5076": " &         Don't       I'm&         leave       ready\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5077": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5081": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5095": "\\E0* Oh my.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5097": "\\E0* Isn't it beautiful^1,&  everyone?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5099": "\\E3* Wow..^1. it's e-even&  better than on TV./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5100": "\\E7* WAY better^1!&* Better than I ever&  imagined!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5102": "\\E1* Frisk^1, you LIVE with&  this!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5103": "\\E9* The sunlight is so&  nice..^1. and the air&  is so fresh!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5104": "* I really feel alive!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5106": "\\E0HEY SANS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5107": "\\E3WHAT'S THAT GIANT&BALL?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5109": "\\E1* we call that&  \"the sun^1,\" my friend./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5111": "\\E0THAT'S THE SUN!^1?&WOWIE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5112": "I CAN'T BELIEVE&I'M FINALLY MEETING&THE SUN!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5114": "\\E0* I could stand here&  and watch this for&  hours.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5116": "\\E0* Yes^1, it is beautiful^1,&  is it not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5117": "\\E1* But we should really&  think about what comes&  next./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5119": "\\E3* Oh^1, right./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5120": "\\E0* Everyone.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5121": "* This is the beginning&  of a bright new&  future./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5122": "* An era of peace between&  humans and monsters./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5123": "\\E2* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5124": "* I have something to&  ask of you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5125": "\\E0* Will you act as our&  ambassador to the&  humans?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5126": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5127": "* (Be the ambassador?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5128": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5133": "WOWi, Nice error./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5136": "\\E0YEAH^1!&FRISK WILL BE THE&BEST AMBASSADOR!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5137": "AND I^1, THE GREAT&PAPYRUS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5138": "WILL BE THE BEST&MASCOT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5139": "I'LL GO MAKE A&GOOD FIRST&IMPRESSION!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5143": "\\E0IT'S OK FRISK^1!&I'VE GOT YOU&COVERED!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5144": "IF YOU DON'T WANT&TO BE THE&AMBASSADOR.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5145": "I CAN DO IT FOR&YOU!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5146": "I'LL GO MAKE A&GOOD FIRST&IMPRESSION!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5151": "* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5152": "\\E2* You came from this&  world^1, right...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5153": "\\E1* So you must have&  a place to return to^1,&  do you not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5154": "\\E2* What will you do&  now?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5155": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5156": "         I want      I have&         to stay     places&         with you    to go\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5157": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5161": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5182": "* (The door has no mail slot.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5183": "* (Slide the letter under?)& &         Slide       NO!!!! \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5184": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5197": "* (You slide the letter under&  the door and give it a&  knock.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5206": "* (You'll keep the letter&  warm for a little longer.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5212": "* (It's a note from Alphys.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5213": "* (Read it...?)& &         Read        Do not \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5214": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5220": "* (It's hard to read because&  of the handwriting^1, but&  you try your best...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5221": "* Hey./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5222": "* Thanks for your help back&  there./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5223": "* You guys..^1.&* Your support really means a&  lot to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5224": "* But..^1.&* As difficult as it is&  to say this.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5225": "* You guys alone can't&  magically make my own&  problems go away./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5226": "* I want to be a better&  person./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5227": "* I don't want to be&  afraid anymore./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5228": "* And for that to happen^1,&  I have to be able to&  face my own mistakes./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5229": "* I'm going to start&  doing that now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5230": "* I want to be clear./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5231": "* This isn't anyone else's&  problem but mine./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5232": "* But if you don't ever&  hear from me again.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5233": "* If you want to know&  \"the truth.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5234": "* Enter the door to the&  north of this note./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5235": "* You all at least deserve&  to know what I did./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5236": "* (That's all she wrote.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5240": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5250": "* (Buy chips for 25G?)& &         Buy         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5251": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5255": "* (There were no chips left&  in the machine.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5256": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5274": "* (The vending machine&  dispensed some chisps.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5275": "* (You didn't have enough&  gold.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5277": "* (You are carrying too&  many items.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5280": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5285": "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /",
  "SCR_TEXT_5286": "\\F1 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5290": "* Hello?&* This is TORIEL./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5291": "* For no reason in&  particular...&* Which do you prefer?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5292": "* Cinnamon or&  butterscotch?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5293": "\\E1* ... wait^1.&* Do not tell me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5294": "\\E0* It is ERROR MESSAGE!& &  Yes         No      \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5295": "\\E0* Is it Butterscotch?& &  Yes         No      \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5296": "\\E0* Is it Cinnamon?& &  Yes         No      \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5297": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5309": "\\E0* Hee hee hee^1.&* I had a feeling./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5310": "\\E1* When humans fall down&  here^1, strangely..^1.&* I.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5311": "\\E1* I often feel like&  I already know them./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5312": "\\E0* Truthfully^1, when I first&  saw you^1, I felt.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5313": "\\E1* ... like I was seeing&  an old friend for&  the first time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5314": "\\E0* Strange^1, is it not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5315": "* Well^1, thank you for&  your selection./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5316": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5317": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5323": "\\E1* Oh..^1. I see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5324": "\\E0* Well^1, thank you^1.&* Goodbye for now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5325": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5326": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5337": "* (Seems like you could skip&  Mettaton's monologue by&  turning him around now.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5338": "* (What will you do?)& &         Skip        Hear again\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5339": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5345": "* (You told Mettaton there&  was something cool&  behind him.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5353": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5359": "* though.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5360": "* one thing about you&  always struck me&  as kinda odd./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5361": "* now^1, i understand&  acting in self-defense./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5362": "* you were thrown into&  those situations&  against your will./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5363": "* but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5364": "* sometimes.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5365": "* you act like you&  know what's gonna&  happen./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5366": "* like you've already&  experienced it all&  before./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5367": "* this is an odd thing&  to say^1, but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5368": "\\W* if you have some sort&  of \\Yspecial power\\W.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5369": "* isn't it your&  responsibility to do&  the right thing?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5370": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5371": " & &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5372": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5379": "\\E1* ah./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5380": "\\E0* i see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5381": "\\E3* .../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5390": "\\E1* heh./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5391": "\\E0* well^1, that's your&  viewpoint./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5392": "\\E2* i won't judge you&  for it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5393": "\\E3* .../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5402": "* (Ring...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5404": "\\E0* Hey!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5405": "\\E3* This um^1, doesn't have&  anything to do with&  guiding you..^1. but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5406": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5407": "\\E6* Uhh^1, hey^1, would you want&  to watch a human TV&  show together???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5408": "* Sometime???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5409": "\\E4* It's called^1, um^1,&  M..^1.Mew Mew Kissy&  Cutie.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5410": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5411": " & &         Sure!       ...no...\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5412": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5420": "* R-really!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5421": "\\E3* It's so good^1!&* It's um^1, my favorite&  show!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5422": "* It's all about this&  human girl named Mew Mew&  who has cat ears!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5423": "\\E3* Which humans don't have!&* S-so she's all&  sensitive about them!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5424": "\\E6* But like...&* Eventually!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5425": "* She realizes that her&  ears don't matter!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5426": "* That her friends like&  her despite the ears!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5427": "\\E7* It's really moving!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5428": "\\E5* Whoops, spoilers%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5429": "\\E6* Also, this sounds&  weird, but she has&  the power!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5430": "\\E5* To control the minds&  of anyone she kisses!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5431": "\\E3* She kisses people and&  controls them to fix&  her problems!!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5432": "\\E5* They don't remember&  anything after the&  kiss I mean!!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5433": "\\E3* BUT IF SHE MISSES&  THE KISS!!!&* THEN!!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5434": "\\E4* Then^1, uh^1, and^1, uh^1,&  also I mean^1, of course%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5435": "\\E5* Eventually^1, she&  realizes that&  controlling people%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5436": "\\E3* OKAY WELL I almost&  spoiled the whole&  show^1, but%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5437": "\\E5* Uhhh^1, I think you'd&  really like it!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5438": "\\E0* We should watch it^1!&* After you get through&  all this!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5439": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5440": "* (Click...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5445": "\\E5* Um^1! Well^1!&* That's okay!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5446": "* Just thought I'd!^1!&* Ask!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5447": "\\E6* B-but I think you'd&  really like it!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5448": "* If you gave it a&  chance!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5449": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5450": "* (Click...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5455": "\\M1* Did y'hear!^1?&* You're back!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5456": "\\M0* I'll tell you a big secret./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5457": "\\M1* I'm starting a band^1, y'hear?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5458": "\\M1* It's called the Red Hot&  Chibi Peppers./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5459": "\\M0* All I've thought of is&  the name./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5460": "\\M3* And I don't^1, play...&* Instruments^1, or sing./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5461": "\\M1* Well^1!&* Do you think we'll be&  popular!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5462": " & &         Yeah        No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5463": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5471": "\\M0* Yeah^1, me too.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5477": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5485": "* (It's a lamp.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5486": "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5487": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5493": "* (There's no lightbulb.^1)&* (A flashlight is stuck in&  the bulb socket.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5494": "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5495": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5499": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5506": "* (The flashlight is out of&  batteries.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5510": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5517": "* Hey^1, hey^1!&* Did you remember my name?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5518": "* (Did you?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5519": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5527": "* Wh-WHAT!^1?&* You REMEMBER!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5528": "* How could I be so easily&  defeateeeeeeeeed!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5533": "* Wh-WHAT!^1?&* You DON'T REMEMBER!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5534": "* How could I be so easily&  defeateeeeeeeeed!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5541": "* (It's a small white dog.^1)&* (It's fast asleep...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5542": "* (Fight the dog?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5543": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5550": "* (Can't fight the dog.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5551": "* (Seems like the fabric it's&  sleeping on has too many&  holes in it.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5552": "* (Seems like the dog needs&  to \"patch\" the fabric.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5553": "* (Then you can fight the dog.^1)&* (... maybe.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5554": "* (Upon closer examination^1,&  the holes in the fabric&  seem to be growing.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5555": "* (Might take a while for the&  dog to fix all of them.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5556": "* (Dogs aren't usually very&  good at knitting.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5557": "* (A crocheting dog is out of&  the question.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5561": "* (Let sleeping dogs lie^1, instead&  of fighting them.^1)&* (That's how the saying goes.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5566": "* (Knock knock)./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5569": "* Oooooaaah ^1!&* Room service !/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5570": "* Got my \"Sea Tea\" ?& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5571": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5575": "* Room service never came ^1.&* (Sigh ...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5581": "* Thanks a million ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5585": "* (No response.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5598": "* (You pour the Sea Tea under&  the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5599": "* HUH !?!?!?!^2?&* That's just the way I want ^1!&* Here's a tip ./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5600": "* (You got 99G.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5604": "* ..^1.&* No you don't ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5609": "* Then ...!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5614": "* (Knock knock)./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5617": "* Oooooaaah ^1!&* Room service !/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5618": "* Got my \"Cinnamon Bun\" ?& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5619": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5623": "* Room service never came ^1.&* (Sigh ...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5628": "* Thanks a trillion ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5632": "* (No response.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5646": "* (You flatten the Cinnamon Bun&  until it's paper thin.)&* (You slide it under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5647": "* HUH !?!?!?!^2?&* That's just the way I want ^1!&* Here's a tip ./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5648": "* (You got 99G.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5652": "* ..^1.&* No you don't ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5657": "* Then ...!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5662": "* (You hear shuffling.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5663": "* (Seems like you could put&  something under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5664": " & &         Put         No Put\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5665": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5669": "* (No response.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5676": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5677": "* (But you didn't have anything&  appealing.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5705": "* (You put a Hot Dog in front&  of the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5706": "* (A white paw shoots out from&  under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5707": "* (It tries to pull the Hot Dog&  into its room...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5708": "* (But it keeps pressing down too&  hard^1, and the hot dog keeps&  spinning away.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5709": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5710": "* (It finally succeeds.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5711": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5712": "* (You hear the grinding of&  stone.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5713": "* (A single hushpuppy slides&  out from under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5714": "* (You got Hush Puppy.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5720": "* (You put a Hot Cat in front&  of the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5721": "* (You hear growling...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5727": "* (You put a Dog Salad in front&  of the door.^1)&* (It slides underneath.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5728": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5729": "* (The Dog Salad was absorbed&  by the darkness.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5736": "* (You put a Dog Residue in&  front of the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5737": "* (It slides underneath the door^1,&  as if pulled by a magnet.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5738": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5743": "* (ZOMMM!!^1!)&* (It shoots back out at a&  high speed!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5747": "* (Two Dog Residues slowly slide&  back out from underneath&  the door.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5755": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5761": "* Yes^1, we know^1.&* The elevator to the city&  is NOT working./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5762": "* Because of this incident^1, rooms&  are running at a special rate!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5763": "* 200G a room^1. Interested^1?& &         Stay        Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5764": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5768": "* 200G a room^1. Interested^1?& &         Stay        Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5769": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5774": "* Did you enjoy your stay?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5775": "* What^1?&* Room..^1.&* Key?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5776": "* No^1, we don't do that./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5777": "* If you leave your room^1,&  you'll have to pay again./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5778": "* 200G a room^1. Interested^1?& &         Stay        Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5779": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5791": "* Fabulous^1!&* We'll escort you to your&  room!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5797": "* ... that's not enough money./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5802": "* Do let us know if you&  change your mind^1.&* Have a sparkular day!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5807": "* ... MY ONE TRUE LOVE?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5808": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5809": "* (YOU LOOK BORED^1, DARLING.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5810": "* (I WANT THIS TO BE A STELLAR&  PERFORMANCE^1, SO IF YOU&  WON'T GIVE IT YOUR ALL...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5811": "* (THEN I'LL SKIP AHEAD FOR&  THE AUDIENCE'S SAKE.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5812": "* (Perform?)& &         Yeah        Skip this\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5813": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5819": "* (UNDERSTOOD.^1)&* (LET'S KNOCK 'EM DEAD!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5823": "* (KA-SIGH...^1)&* (THE SHOW MUST GO ON!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5829": "Interesting./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5830": "You want to go back./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5831": "You want to go bac^1k&to the worl^2d&you destroyed./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5832": "It was you who pushed&everythin^1g to its edge./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5833": "It was you who led the worl^1d&to its destruction./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5834": "But you cannot accept it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5835": "You think you are above&consequences.&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5836": "",
  "SCR_TEXT_5842": "Exactly./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5846": "Then what are you looking for?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5851": "Perhaps./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5852": "We can reach a compromise./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5853": "You still have somethin^1g&I want./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5854": "Give it to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5855": "And I will bring this&world back./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5856": " & &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5857": "",
  "SCR_TEXT_5863": "Then it is agreed./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5864": "You will give me your SOUL.& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5865": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5869": "Then stay here for&all eternity./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5870": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5877": ".../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5878": "Then^1, it is done./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5882": "Then stay here for&all eternity./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5883": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5888": "* hey./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5889": "* is your refrigerator&  running?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5890": " & &         yes         no\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5891": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5897": "* nice^1.&* i'll be over to deposit&  the brewskis./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5901": "* ok^1, i'll send someone&  over to fix it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5902": "* thanks for letting me&  know./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5903": "* good communication is&  important./%%",
