  "obj_actiontable_63": "AH^1, YES^1, ACTION&FIGURES./",
  "obj_actiontable_64": "A GREAT REFERENCE&FOR THEORETICAL&BATTLE SCENARIOS./",
  "obj_actiontable_66": "\\E3HOW DO I HAVE&SO MANY?/",
