  "obj_adate_610": " But she wasn't& at home.../",
  "obj_adate_611": "\\F3 Where the heck& could she be!?/%%",
  "obj_adate_669": "\\E2Oh my god.../",
  "obj_adate_670": "\\E6W... well^1, I guess&it's obvious^1, huh?/",
  "obj_adate_671": "\\E7I...^1 uh..^1.&I really like her./",
  "obj_adate_672": "\\E9I mean^1, more than&I like other people!/",
  "obj_adate_673": "\\E7I'm sorry./",
  "obj_adate_674": "\\E6I j-just figured^1,&y-you know.../",
  "obj_adate_675": "\\E7It'd be f-fun to&go on like^1, a cute^1,&kind of.../",
  "obj_adate_676": "\\E6P\\M3retend date with you^1?&T-to make you feel&better?/",
  "obj_adate_677": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_adate_678": "\\E6Well^1, it sounds even&worse when I put it&like that./",
  "obj_adate_679": "\\E8I\\M0'm sorry^1.&I messed up again./",
  "obj_adate_680": "\\E7Undyne's the person I..^1.&Um..^1. really want to&go on a date with./",
  "obj_adate_681": "But, I mean..^1.&She's way out of&my league./",
  "obj_adate_682": "\\E9N-not that you&aren't^1, um^1, cool!/",
  "obj_adate_683": "\\E7B-but..^1. Undyne.../",
  "obj_adate_684": "She's so confident..^1.&And strong..^1.&And funny.../",
  "obj_adate_685": "\\E8And I'm just a&nobody./",
  "obj_adate_686": "\\M3A fraud./",
  "obj_adate_687": "I'm the royal&scientist^1, but.../",
  "obj_adate_688": "\\M0All I've ever done&is hurt people./",
  "obj_adate_689": "\\E7I've told her so&many lies^1, she thinks&I'm.../",
  "obj_adate_690": "\\E6She thinks I'm a&lot cooler than I&actually am./",
  "obj_adate_691": "\\E7If she gets close&to me^1, she'll.../",
  "obj_adate_692": "\\E8She'll find out the&truth about me./",
  "obj_adate_693": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_adate_694": "\\E7What should I do?/*",
  "obj_adate_708": "                              &   Tell her        Keep     &   the truth       lying    ",
  "obj_adate_732": "\\E9The truth...?/",
  "obj_adate_733": "\\M4But if I tell her&that^1, she'll hate&me./",
  "obj_adate_734": "\\E6I\\M0sn't it better&this way?/",
  "obj_adate_735": "To live a lie where&both people are&happy.../",
  "obj_adate_736": "\\E7Or a truth where&neither of us&are?/",
  "obj_adate_737": "They say \"be&yourself.\"/",
  "obj_adate_738": "\\E8But I don't&really like who&\"myself\" is./",
  "obj_adate_739": "\\E7I'd rather just&be whatever makes&people like me./",
  "obj_adate_740": "\\E6Eheheh.../",
  "obj_adate_741": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_adate_742": "\\E8.../",
  "obj_adate_743": "No, you're right./",
  "obj_adate_744": "Every day I'm&scared.../",
  "obj_adate_745": "\\E7Scared what will&happen if people&learn the truth&on their own./",
  "obj_adate_746": "\\M3They'll all get&hurt because of&me.../",
  "obj_adate_747": "\\E9B\\M4ut how can I&tell UNDYNE the&tr..^1. truth?/",
  "obj_adate_748": "\\E8I d-don't have the&confidence.../",
  "obj_adate_749": "\\E9I'm going to mess&it up^1!&How can I&practice!?/%%",
  "obj_adate_755": "Yeah..^1. yeah^1, you're&right!/",
  "obj_adate_756": "\\E6I\\M0've come this far^1,&I c-can't tell&her now!/",
  "obj_adate_757": "\\E7Sh-she'd be really&hurt if she found&out^1, right?/",
  "obj_adate_758": "\\E5S-so it'll just&be^1, uh^1, a little&secret!/",
  "obj_adate_759": "\\M1What people don't&know can't hurt&them!!/",
  "obj_adate_760": "\\M0Th-thank God I've&got an honest&friend like you!!/",
  "obj_adate_761": ".../",
  "obj_adate_762": "\\E3.../",
  "obj_adate_763": "\\M1B..^1. but what if she&finds out on her&own^1, somehow?/",
  "obj_adate_764": "\\E7O\\M0r if I ever&m-mess up.../",
  "obj_adate_765": "\\M4Sh-she'd find out&the truth^1, and.../",
  "obj_adate_766": "\\E8Pr-probably be even&more hurt than if&I told her myself./",
  "obj_adate_767": "\\E6N\\M0-not to mention^1,&l-lying so far..^1.&h..^1. has.../",
  "obj_adate_768": "\\E8Been really&stressful^1, and scary./",
  "obj_adate_769": "\\E3.../",
  "obj_adate_770": "\\E4I think I'm going&to have to tell&her the truth./",
  "obj_adate_771": "\\E9B-but how!?/",
  "obj_adate_772": "\\E8I..^1. I don't have&the confidence.../",
  "obj_adate_773": "\\E7How am I supposed&to practice&something like that!?/%%",
  "obj_adate_794": "   Let's           Obviously&   Roleplay        Let's    &   It              Roleplay",
  "obj_adate_827": "\\E4R..^1. roleplay?/",
  "obj_adate_828": "\\E3.../",
  "obj_adate_829": "\\E5.\\M1.. That actually&sounds kind of&fun!/",
