  "obj_adate_966": "\\E9Oh^1, forget it!/",
  "obj_adate_967": "\\M0Undyne!!!/",
  "obj_adate_968": "I..^1. I want to&tell you how I&feel!/",
  "obj_adate_969": "\\M4Y-you're so brave^1,&a-and s-strong..^1.&A-and nice.../",
  "obj_adate_970": "Y-you always listen&t-to me when I talk&about n-n-nerdy&stuff.../",
  "obj_adate_971": "\\E0Y-you always d-d-do&your best to m-make&me f-f-feel&special.../",
