  "obj_adate_1080": "\\E9H\\M2-hotbaby!^1?&How dare you call&me that!?/",
  "obj_adate_1081": "\\E5First off^1, I'm a&baby KNIGHT!/",
  "obj_adate_1082": "Captain of the&babies!!!/",
  "obj_adate_1083": "Treat my position&with respect^1, or I&will strike you&down!/",
  "obj_adate_1084": "\\M3Uh^1, now pretend&I'm suplexing a&boulder for no&reason./",
  "obj_adate_1085": "\\E9U\\M0m^1! Anyway^1!&What do you&want to say^1,&Alphys!?/%%",
  "obj_adate_1108": "   Let's tell      Alphys&   Undyne the      gives u&   truth           a kiss,",
  "obj_adate_1132": "What!?/",
  "obj_adate_1133": "So you've been&lying to me the&whole time.../",
  "obj_adate_1134": "\\E7Alphys!!^1!&I can't believe you!/",
  "obj_adate_1135": "\\E8You w-worthless&slime!/",
  "obj_adate_1136": "\\E9How could you&betray our&friendship!!/",
  "obj_adate_1137": "\\E8After how much I&trusted you!!!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1143": "WH-WHAT!^1?&I WOULD NEVER.../",
  "obj_adate_1144": "\\M0Alphys^1!&What are you&d-doing!/",
  "obj_adate_1145": "I s-say^1, pushing&you away from&me.../",
  "obj_adate_1146": "\\E3You sh-shouldn't&k-kiss me...!!/",
