  "obj_adate_1400": "And the history&movies..^1.&those..^2.%",
  "obj_adate_1401": "\\F2Those are just^1, uh^1,&anime^2!&They aren't real^2!%%",
  "obj_adate_1417": "And that time I&told you I was&busy with work on&the phone..^1. I...%",
  "obj_adate_1418": "\\F9Was just eating&frozen yogurt in&my pajamas!%",
  "obj_adate_1419": "\\E3That time I...%%",
  "obj_adate_1433": "Alphys./%%",
  "obj_adate_1444": "\\E5I..^1. I just wanted to&impress you!/",
  "obj_adate_1445": "I just wanted you&to think I was&smart and cool./",
  "obj_adate_1446": "That I wasn't&some..^1.&nerdy loser./%%",
  "obj_adate_1459": "Alphys./%%",
  "obj_adate_1470": "\\E5Undyne^1, I..^1.&I really think you're&neat^1, OK.../%%",
  "obj_adate_1481": "Alphys./",
  "obj_adate_1482": "Shhhh./",
  "obj_adate_1483": "Shhhhhh./%%",
  "obj_adate_1522": "\\F0Alphys!/",
  "obj_adate_1523": "I..^1. think you're&neat^1, too, I guess./",
  "obj_adate_1524": "\\F1But, you've gotta&realize.../",
  "obj_adate_1525": "\\F2Most of what you&said really doesn't&matter to me./",
  "obj_adate_1526": "I don't care if&you're watching kid&cartoons or reading&history books./",
  "obj_adate_1527": "\\F3To me^1, ALL of&that stuff is&just NERDY CRAP!/",
  "obj_adate_1528": "What I like about&you is that you're&PASSIONATE^1!&You're ANALYTICAL!!/",
  "obj_adate_1529": "It doesn't matter&what it is^1!&YOU CARE ABOUT IT!!/",
  "obj_adate_1530": "\\F4100-PERCENT!^1!&AT MAXIMUM POWER!!!/",
  "obj_adate_1531": "\\F5... so^1, you don't&have to lie to me./",
  "obj_adate_1532": "\\F0I don't want you&to have to lie to&anyone anymore./",
  "obj_adate_1533": "\\F6Alphys..^1. I want to&help you become&happy with who&you are!/",
  "obj_adate_1534": "\\F5And I know just&the training you&need to do that!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1566": "Undyne..^1.&You.../",
  "obj_adate_1567": "\\E4Y-you're gonna train&me...?/%%",
  "obj_adate_1574": "\\F2Pffft^1, what^1?&ME?/%%",
  "obj_adate_1594": "\\F6Nah^1, I'm gonna&get Papyrus to&do it./%%",
  "obj_adate_1612": "GET THOSE BONES&SHAKIN'!!!/",
  "obj_adate_1613": "IT'S TIME TO JOG&100 LAPS^1, HOOTING&ABOUT HOW GREAT&WE ARE!!!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1622": "Ready^1?&I'm about to start&the timer!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1636": "\\E5 & &    U-Undyne.../",
  "obj_adate_1637": "\\E1 & &    I'll do my&    best...!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1659": "\\F3OH MY GOD!!!/",
  "obj_adate_1660": "\\F5She was kidding^1,&right!? /",
  "obj_adate_1661": "Those cartoons..^1.&those comics.../",
  "obj_adate_1662": "\\F7Those are still&REAL^1, right!?/",
  "obj_adate_1663": "\\F8ANIME'S REAL^1,&RIGHT?!?!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1688": "   Anime is        Anime &   Real            is not &                   real",
  "obj_adate_1708": "HA HA HA!!!/",
  "obj_adate_1709": "I KNEW IT!!!/",
  "obj_adate_1710": "GIGANTIC SWORDS!!^1!&MAGICAL PRINCESSES^1!&HERE I COME!!!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1714": "\\F3No..^1. NO!!!!/",
  "obj_adate_1715": "I CAN FEEL MY&HEART BREAKING&INTO PIECES!!!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1736": "\\F6.../",
  "obj_adate_1737": "Uhh^1, thanks for&taking care of&Alphys./",
  "obj_adate_1738": "\\F9I didn't get to&say what I wanted&to^1, but.../",
  "obj_adate_1739": "\\F0Things seem like&they're going to get&better for her./",
  "obj_adate_1740": "\\F6Well^1, I gotta go&catch up with&them!/",
  "obj_adate_1741": "Later!/%%",
  "obj_adate_1745": "\\F3.../",
  "obj_adate_1746": "\\F5... no^1, I can&survive this.../",
  "obj_adate_1747": "\\F3I have to be strong./",
  "obj_adate_1748": "\\F9For Alphys./",
  "obj_adate_1749": "\\F0Thank you^1, human^1,&for telling me&the truth./",
  "obj_adate_1750": "\\F9I'll try my best to&live in this&world.../",
  "obj_adate_1751": "\\F0See you later!/%%",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_153": "* (There's no response.)/%%",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_207": "* (...)/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_208": "* (O^1-oh n^1-no^1, is that another&  letter...?)/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_209": "* (I don't want to open it...^1)&* (C-^1can't I just slide it&  back out...?)/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_210": "* (...)/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_211": "* (N..^1. no..^1. I can't keep doing&  this.^1)&* (I'll read this one.)/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_212": "* (...)/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_213": "* (Um...^1)&* (I-it's shut k-kind of&  strongly^1, isn't it?)/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_214": "* (Wait a second...)/%%",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_252": "* Hey^1, if this is a&  joke^1, it's.../",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_253": "\\E1* .../",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_254": "\\E3* Oh My God?/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_255": "\\E5* Did YOU write this&  letter?/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_256": "\\E6* It wasn't signed^1, so^1,&  I had no idea who&  could have.../",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_257": "\\E8* Oh my god^1.&* Oh no./",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_258": "\\E7* That's adorable.../",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_259": "\\E5* And I h-had no idea&  you^1, um^1, wrote that way!/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_260": "\\E9* It's surprising^1, too..^1.&* After all the gross&  stuff I did.../",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_261": "\\E8* I don't really deserve&  to be forgiven./",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_262": "\\E4* Much less^1, um.../",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_263": "\\E5* This?/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_264": "\\E1* And so passionately^1,&  too./",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_265": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_266": "\\E0* You know what^1, okay^1!&* I'll do it!/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_267": "\\E5* It's the least I can&  do to make it up&  to you!/",
  "obj_alabdoor_l_268": "\\W*\\E7 Y-yeah^1!&* \\WLet's \\Rgo on a date\\W!/%%",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_81": "\\E0* On second thought^1,&  maybe I WON'T write&  fanfic of real people./",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_82": "\\E7* I mean^1, isn't real life&  already the greatest&  fanfiction of all?/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_83": "\\E8* .../",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_84": "\\E3* Uh^1, don't tell&  anyone I said that./",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_85": "\\E1* Cause I'm gonna&  post it online!/%%",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_90": "\\E0* I sure am excited&  to finally use the&  human internet./",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_91": "\\E7* I bet they have all&  sorts of things Undyne&  and I can watch!/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_93": "\\E6* Oh man!!!/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_94": "* We're gonna be&  able to watch&  anime online!?/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_96": "\\E7* Of course^1, Undyne!/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_97": "\\E2* What do you think&  we've been fighting&  for all along?/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_99": "\\E2* yeah^1, what do you.../",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_100": "\\E1* whoops./",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_102": "\\E1* Jinx^1!&* I knew you were&  gonna make that joke!/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_104": "\\E3WAIT^1, ALPHYS, I&DIDN'T KNOW YOU&KNEW SANS./",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_106": "\\E5* Well..^1.&* I.../",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_108": "\\E2* doesn't everybody?/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_110": "\\E0* Who the hell is Sans?/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_111": "\\E8* .../",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_112": "\\E0* Who the HECK is Sans?/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_114": "\\E1* TORIEL!?!?!/%%",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_119": "\\E0* Hey Frisk^1, why&  don't you go look&  for Mettaton?/",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_120": "\\E8* He was here for&  a while^1, too.../",
  "obj_alphys_friendc_121": "\\E0* But he said he&  had to go somewhere./%%",
  "obj_alphys_npc_76": "* Th-that last&  question.../",
  "obj_alphys_npc_77": "\\E4* He wasn't s-supposed&  to ask that one.../%%",
  "obj_alphys_npc_82": "* (Yellow feet are tapping&  just behind the door.)/%%",
  "obj_alphys_npc_91": "* I..^1. I just need&  a moment./%%",
  "obj_alphys_npc_99": "* .../%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_108": "* S..^1. Sorry about&  that!/",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_109": "\\E5* L-let's k-keep&  going!/%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_148": "* S-so you're about&  to meet ASGORE^1,&  h-huh?/",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_149": "\\E6* You must be..^1.&* Y-you must be.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_150": "\\E5* Pr..^1. pretty&  excited about all&  that^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_175": "* You'll f-f-finally.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_176": "\\E7* You'll finally get&  to go home!/%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_206": "* W..^1.&* Wait!/%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_228": "* I mean^1, um..^1.&* I.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_229": "\\E1* I was just going&  to..^1.&* ...um.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_230": "\\E2* Say goodbye^1, and.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_231": "* .../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_232": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_233": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_234": "* I can't take&  this anymore./%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_262": "* I.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_263": "\\E5* I lied to you./",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_264": "\\E7* A human SOUL isn't&  strong enough to&  cross the barrier alone./",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_265": "\\E6* It takes at least&  a human soul.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_266": "\\E5* And a monster&  soul./",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_267": "\\E5* .../%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_295": "* If you want to&  go home.../",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_296": "\\E5* You'll have to&  take his soul./",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_297": "\\E7* You'll have to&  kill ASGORE./%%",
  "obj_alphysfollow_event_345": "* I'm sorry./%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_166": "* Oh^1.&* My god./%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_175": "* I didn't expect you&  to show up so&  soon!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_176": "* I haven't showered^1, I'm&  barely dressed^1, it's&  all messy^1, and.../%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_224": "* Ummm.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_225": "* H-h-hiya!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_226": "* I'm Dr. Alphys^1.&* I'm ASGORE's royal&  scientist!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_227": "\\E3* B-b-but^1, ahhhh^1,&  I'm not one of&  the \"bad guys\"!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_228": "\\E0* Actually^1, since you&  stepped out of the&  RUINS^1, I've^1, um.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_229": "\\E7* ... been \"observing\"&  your journey through&  my console./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_230": "\\E3* Your fights..^1.&* Your friendships..^1.&* Everything!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_231": "\\E0* I was originally&  going to stop&  you^1, but.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_236": "\\E7* Watching someone on&  a screen really makes&  you root for them./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_237": "\\E7* Watching you^1, I felt&  like..^1. like I was&  seeing an old friend./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_238": "\\E0* S-so^1, ahhh^1, now I&  want to help you!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_239": "\\E6* Using my knowledge^1,&  I can easily guide&  you through Hotland!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_240": "\\E0* I know a way right&  to ASGORE's castle^1,&  no problem!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_241": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_242": "\\E7* Well^1, actually^1, umm^1,&  there's just a&  tiny issue./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_243": "\\E0* A long time ago^1, I&  made a robot named&  Mettaton./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_244": "* Originally^1, I built&  him to be an&  entertainment robot./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_245": "\\E7* Uh^1, you know^1, like&  a robotic TV star&  or something./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_246": "\\E0* Anyway^1, recently I&  decided to make him&  more useful./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_247": "\\E7* You know^1, just some&  small practical&  adjustments./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_248": "\\E0* Like^1, um.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_249": "\\E4* Anti..^1. anti-human&  combat features?/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_250": "\\E6* Of c-course^1, when I&  saw you coming^1, I&  immediately decided.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_251": "\\E3* I have to remove&  those features!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_252": "\\E4* Unfortunately^1, I may&  have made a teensy&  mistake while doing so./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_253": "* And^1, um.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_254": "\\E5* Now he's an unstoppable&  killing machine with a&  thirst for human blood?/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_255": "* Ehehehehe.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_256": "\\E8* Heh./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_257": "\\E0* But^1, ummm^1, hopefully&  we won't run into&  him!/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_288": "* ...?/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_312": "* Did you hear&  something?/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_344": "* Oh no./%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_393": "* OHHHH YES!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_394": "* WELCOME^1, BEAUTIES.../%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_441": "\\M1* ... TO TODAY'S QUIZ SHOW!!!/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_468": "\\M0* OH BOY^1!&* I CAN ALREADY TELL IT'S&  GONNA BE A GREAT SHOW!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_469": "\\M2* EVERYONE GIVE A BIG&  HAND FOR OUR WONDERFUL&  CONTESTANT!/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_493": "\\M0* NEVER PLAYED BEFORE^1,&  GORGEOUS?/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_494": "\\M2* NO PROBLEM^1!&* IT'S SIMPLE!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_495": "\\M4* THERE'S ONLY ONE&  RULE./",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_496": "* ANSWER CORRECTLY.../%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_514": "* OR YOU DIE!!!/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_566": "* .../",
  "obj_alphystrigger1_567": "\\E0* Well that was&  certainly something./%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_87": "* Wait^1, wait!/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_146": "\\E0* Let me give you my&  ph-phone number!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_147": "\\E7* Th-then..^1. m-maybe..^1.&* If you need help^1,&  I could.../%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_169": "\\E3* Wh..^1. where'd you get&  that phone!?&* It's ANCIENT!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_170": "\\E1* It doesn't even have&  texting./",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_171": "\\E3* W-wait a second^1,&  please!/%%",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_221": "\\E0* Here^1, I upgraded it&  for you!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_222": "* It can do texting^1,&  items^1, it's got a&  key chain.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_223": "* I even signed you up&  for the underground's&  No. 1 social network!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_224": "\\E7* Now we're officially&  friends^1!&* Ehehehe!/",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_225": "\\E0* Heheh.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_226": "\\E0* Heh.../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_227": "\\E0* .../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_228": "\\E1* .../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_229": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_230": "\\E1* .../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_231": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_alphystrigger2_232": "\\E4* I'm going to the&  bathroom./%%",
  "obj_amalgam_fridge_99": "* (It's a refrigerator.^1)&* (It's empty.)/%%",
  "obj_amalgam_fridge_103": "* (It's some sort of cold^1,&  rectangular object.)/%%",
  "obj_amalgam_fridge_107": "* (You found a blue key on&  the ground.^1)&* (You put it on your keychain.)/%%",
  "obj_artclass_sign_208": "* Art Club: Meet here!&* Next meeting:&* October 10th/%%",
  "obj_artclass_sign_213": "* (Art club is cancelled!)/%%",
  "obj_artclass_sign_218": "* (Art is dead.)/%%",
  "obj_artclass_sign_224": "* Let's meet again someday!/%%",
  "obj_artclass_sign_231": "* Who knows what lies in the&  future for Art Club!?/%%",
  "obj_artclass_sign_281": "* Ahhhh!!^1!&* I'm late!!^1!&* I'm late!!!/",
  "obj_artclass_sign_282": "* I'm so sorry!!!/%%",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_178": "* (A strange light fills the&  room.^5)   %",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_179": "* (Twilight is shining through&  the barrier.^3)   %",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_180": "* (It seems your journey is&  finally over.^4)%",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_181": "     * (You're filled with&          DETERMINATION.^5) %%",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_213": "Human.../",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_214": "\\E1It was&nice to&meet&you./",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_215": "\\E0Goodbye./%%",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_220": "\\E1Now,&now./",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_221": "There's&no need&to&fight./",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_222": "Why not&settle&this.../",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_223": "Over a&nice cup&of tea?/%%",
  "obj_asgore_finalintro_496": "* ASGORE attacks!",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_76": "\\E0* Howdy^1, Frisk./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_77": "\\E3* Sorry about almost&  trying to take&  your SOUL./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_78": "\\E5* I feel very bad&  about it./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_79": "\\E0* I hope we can&  still be pals./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_81": "\\E0* Hey^1, don't worry&  about it^1, ASGORE./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_82": "\\E2* I think everybody's&  tried to kill Frisk&  at least once./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_84": "\\E2* Oh..^1. I see!/",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_85": "\\E0* In that case^1, I'm&  not sorry^1, Frisk./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_87": "\\E6* ASGORE^1!&* That's not what I&  meant!/%%",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_97": "\\E3* Oh^1, Frisk^1, if you're&  not busy.../",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_98": "\\E0* On nice days^1, you&  should walk around and&  have a good time./",
  "obj_asgore_friendc_99": "\\E0* That's important./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_243": "Ah.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_244": ".../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_245": "So that&is how&it is./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_246": ".../%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_251": "\\E3Why..^1.&You.../%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_275": "I remember the day&after my son&died./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_276": "The entire underground&was devoid of hope./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_277": "The future had once&again been taken&from us by the&humans./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_278": "In a fit of anger,&I declared war./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_279": "I said that I would&destroy any human&that came here./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_280": "I would use their&souls to become&godlike.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_281": "... and free us from&this terrible prison./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_282": "Then, I would destroy&humanity.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_283": "And let monsters rule&the surface, in peace./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_284": "Soon, the people's&hopes returned./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_285": "My wife, however,&became disgusted with&my actions./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_286": "She left this place,&never to be seen&again./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_294": "Truthfully.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_295": "I do not want power./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_296": "I do not want to&hurt anyone./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_297": "I just wanted everyone&to have hope.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_298": "But.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_299": "I cannot take this&any longer./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_300": "I just want to&see my wife./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_301": "I just want to&see my child./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_302": "Please..^1.&Young one.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_303": "This war has gone&on long enough./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_304": "You have the power.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_305": "Take my soul, and&leave this cursed&place./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_340": ".../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_341": "\\E0After everything I&have done to&hurt you.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_342": "\\E7You would rather&stay down here&and suffer.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_343": "\\E9Than live happily&on the surface?/",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_344": "\\E6.../%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_352": "\\E1Human.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_353": "\\E7I promise you.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_354": "\\E7For as long as&you remain here.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_355": "\\E1My wife and I will&take care of you&as best we can./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_356": "\\E2We can sit in&the living room^1,&telling stories.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_357": "\\E1Eating butterscotch&pie.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_358": "\\E2We could be&like.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_359": "\\E8Like a family.../%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_623": "You&IDIOT./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_627": "\\[C]./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_628": "You&haven't&learned&a thing./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_632": "Hee&hee&hee./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_633": "So you&finally&get it./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_639": "\\[C]./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_640": "So you&DO&recall./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_651": "In&this&world.../%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_692": "It's KILL or BE killed^4.%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_769": "Hee hee hee^1.&Don't worry./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_770": "I know there's no&REAL point in&fighting you./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_771": "The human souls&would probably just&revolt again./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_772": "So...!/%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_778": "Hee hee hee^1./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_779": "Did you REALLY&think killing me&would make a&DIFFERENCE?/",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_780": "No./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_781": "Every time you&load your SAVE^1,&I'll come back./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_782": "And every time you&try to get a&happy ending.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_783": "I'll be there to&tear it away!/",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_784": "Ha ha ha!!!/%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_792": "Well^1, let's get&this over with./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_796": ".../%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_831": "\\E2.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_832": "\\E0No^1.&That's just a&fantasy^1, isn't it?/",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_833": "\\E1Young one^1, when I&look at you.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_834": "\\E2I'm reminded of the&human that fell here&long ago.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_835": "\\E8You have the same&feeling of hope in&your eyes./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_836": "\\E7There is an ancient&prophecy among our&people.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_837": "One day^1, a savior&will come from the&heavens./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_838": "\\E1... I believe the&one that was&prophecied was you./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_839": "Somewhere in the&world outside.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_840": "There must be a way&to free us from our&prison./",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_841": "\\E0It pains me to&give you this&responsiblity^1, but.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_842": "\\E0Please^1.&Take my soul..^1.&and seek the truth./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_898": "\\E0Ha... ha.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_899": "\\E6I'm sorry.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_900": "I couldn't give you&a simple^1, happy&ending.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_901": "But I believe your&freedom.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_902": "... is what my son.../",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_903": "\\E8... what ASRIEL would&have wanted./%%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_979": "See^1?&I never betrayed&you^2! %",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_980": "It was all a&trick, see^2? %",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_981": "I was waiting to&kill him for you^2! %",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_982": "\\E1After all it's me&your best friend^2! %",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_983": "\\E2I'm helpful, I can&be useful to you^1 %",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_984": "\\E1I promise I won't&get in your way^1 %%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_995": "\\E2I can help..^1.&I can..^1.&I can..^2. %%",
  "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_1006": "\\E3Please don't&kill me./%%",
  "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_78": "* How tense.../",
  "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_79": "\\E2* Just think of it like.../",
  "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_80": "\\E0* A visit to the dentist./%%",
  "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_112": "* Are you ready?/",
  "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_113": "\\E3* If you are not^1, I&  understand./",
  "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_114": "\\E2* I am not ready either./%%",
  "obj_asgoreb_652": "* ...",
  "obj_asgoreb_658": "* Asgore has low HP.",
  "obj_asgoreb_692": "* ASGORE 80 ATK 80 DEF /^",
  "obj_asgoreb_705": "* But there was nothing to&  say./^",
  "obj_asgoreb_711": "* You quietly tell ASGORE&  you don't want to fight&  him./",
  "obj_asgoreb_712": "* His hands tremble for a&  moment./^",
  "obj_asgoreb_716": "* You tell ASGORE that you&  don't want to fight him./",
  "obj_asgoreb_717": "* His breathing gets funny&  for a moment./^",
  "obj_asgoreb_721": "* You firmly tell ASGORE to&  STOP fighting./",
  "obj_asgoreb_722": "* Recollection flashes in his&  eyes.../",
  "obj_asgoreb_723": "* ASGORE's ATTACK dropped^1!&* ASGORE's DEFENSE dropped!/^",
  "obj_asgoreb_729": "* Seems talking won't do any&  more good./^",
  "obj_asgoreb_731": "* All you can do is FIGHT./^",
  "obj_asgoreb_748": "* You tell ASGORE that he's&  killed you \\[1]./",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_1": "once before",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_2": "twice before",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_3": "three times",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_4": "four times",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_5": "five times",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_6": "six times",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_7": "seven times",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_8": "eight times",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_9": "nine times",
  "obj_asgoreb_killcount_10": "too many times&  to count",
  "obj_asgoreb_749": "* He nods sadly./^",
  "obj_asgoreb_751": "* He nods grievously./^",
  "obj_asgoreb_753": "* He nods pitifully./^",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_131": "* Dum dee dum.../",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_132": "* Oh^1?&* Is someone there?/",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_133": "* Just a moment!/",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_134": "* I have almost finished watering&  these flowers./%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_138": "* Curious^1.&* I've never seen a plant..^1.&* Cry before./%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_162": "* ... Here we are!/%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_193": "* Howdy^1!&* How can I.../%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_224": "* Oh./%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_247": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_248": "\\E2* I so badly want to&  say^1, \"would you like&  a cup of tea?\"/",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_249": "* But.../",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_250": "\\E3* You know how it is./%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_289": "* Nice day today^1, huh?/",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_290": "* Birds are singing^1,&  flowers are blooming.../",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_291": "* Perfect weather for a&  game of catch./%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_313": "* .../",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_314": "* You know what we must&  do./",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_315": "* When you are ready^1,&  come into the next&  room./%%",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_369": "\\E3* ... huh?/",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_370": "* You must be the one&  that flower just warned&  me about./",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_371": "\\E0* Howdy!/",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_372": "* .../",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_373": "\\E3* Erm..^1.&* What kind of monster&  are you...?/",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_374": "\\E0* Sorry^1, I cannot tell./",
  "obj_asgoremeet_event_375": "* Well^1, we can always%%",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_174": "* I'm so sorry./%%",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_440": "* Ha..^1. ha.../",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_441": "* I don't want to let&  go.../%%",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_495": "\\E7* Frisk.../",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_496": "* You're.../",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_497": "\\E0* You're going to do&  a great job^1, OK?/",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_498": "* No matter what you&  do./",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_499": "* Everyone will be&  there for you^1,&  okay?/%%",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_533": "\\E7* Well..^1.&* My time's running out./",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_534": "* Goodbye./%%",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_572": "* By the way.../",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_573": "* Frisk./",
  "obj_asriel_overworldanim_574": "\\E6* ... take care of Mom&  and Dad for me^1, OK?/%%",
  "obj_asrielappear_110": "Finally./",
  "obj_asrielappear_111": "I was so&tired of&being a&flower./%%",
  "obj_asrielappear_147": "Howdy!/",
  "obj_asrielappear_148": "\\[C]^1,&are you&there?/",
  "obj_asrielappear_149": "It's me^1,&your&best&friend./%%",
  "obj_FinalWriter_34": " ASRIEL   DREEMURR ",
  "obj_asrielb_245": "\\E1You know.../",
  "obj_asrielb_246": "\\M1I \\E0don't care about&destroying this&world anymore./%%",
  "obj_asrielb_251": "\\E1After I defeat you&and gain total&control over the&timeline.../",
  "obj_asrielb_252": "\\E2I just want to reset&everything./%%",
  "obj_asrielb_257": "\\E3All your progress..^1.&Everyone's memories./",
  "obj_asrielb_258": "\\E2I'll bring them all&back to zero!/%%",
  "obj_asrielb_263": "\\E2Then we can do&everything ALL over&again./%%",
  "obj_asrielb_268": "\\E3And you know what&the best part of&all this is?/",
  "obj_asrielb_269": "\\E2You'll DO it./%%",
  "obj_asrielb_274": "\\E1And then you'll&lose to me again./%%",
  "obj_asrielb_279": "\\E3And again./%%",
  "obj_asrielb_284": "\\E3And again!!!/%%",
  "obj_asrielb_289": "\\E1Because you want a&\"happy ending.\"/%%",
  "obj_asrielb_294": "Because you \"love&your friends.\"/%%",
  "obj_asrielb_299": "Because you \"never&give up.\"/%%",
  "obj_asrielb_304": "\\M1I\\E1sn't that&delicious?/",
  "obj_asrielb_305": "\\M0Your \"determination.^1\"&The power that let&you get this far.../",
  "obj_asrielb_306": "\\E2It's gonna be your&downfall!/%%",
  "obj_asrielb_311": "\\E2Now^1, ENOUGH messing&around!/",
  "obj_asrielb_312": "It's time to purge&this timeline once&and for all!/%%",
  "obj_asrielb_541": "* Asriel readies \"STAR BLAZING.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_542": "* Asriel charges \"SHOCKER&  BREAKER.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_543": "* Asriel calls on \"CHAOS SABER.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_544": "* Asriel readies \"CHAOS BUSTER.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_545": "* Asriel readies \"GALACTA&  BLAZING.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_546": "* Asriel calls on \"CHAOS SLICER.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_547": "* Asriel readies \"SHOCKER&  BREAKER II.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_548": "* Asriel readies \"CHAOS&  BLASTER.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_549": "* Asriel readies \"HYPER GONER.\"",
  "obj_asrielb_550": "* Asriel is glowing with a&  strange power.",
  "obj_asrielb_551": "* It's the end.",
  "obj_asrielb_585": "* ASRIEL DREEMURR \\z4   ATK \\z4   DEF&* Legendary being made of every&  SOUL in the underground./^",
  "obj_asrielb_587": "* ASRIEL DREEMURR \\z4   ATK \\z4   DEF&* The Absolute GOD of Hyperdeath!/^",
  "obj_asrielb_597": "* You held on to your hopes..^1.&* You reduced how much DAMAGE&  you'll take this turn!/^",
  "obj_asrielb_598": "* You kept holding on^1.&* DAMAGE reduced!/^",
  "obj_asrielb_614": "* You think about why you're&  here now.../",
  "obj_asrielb_615": "* You can feel the empty&  space in your inventory&  get smaller and smaller!/^",
  "obj_asrielb_618": "* Your items fill up with&  dreams./^",
  "obj_asrielb_669": "\\E0... even after that&attack^1, you're still&standing in my way...?/",
  "obj_asrielb_670": "\\M1W\\E0ow..^1.&You really ARE&something special./",
  "obj_asrielb_671": "\\M0B\\E3ut don't get&cocky./",
  "obj_asrielb_672": "\\E0Up until now^1, I've&only been using&a fraction of my&REAL power!/",
  "obj_asrielb_673": "\\E2Let's see what good&your DETERMINATION&is against THIS!!/%%",
  "obj_asrielbed_87": "* \\[C]^1, please.../",
  "obj_asrielbed_88": "* Wake up!/",
  "obj_asrielbed_89": "* You are the future&  of humans and&  monsters.../%%",
  "obj_asrielbed_93": "* (It felt strange to lie&  in the bed.)/",
  "obj_asrielbed_94": "* (It feels entirely too&  small for you now.)/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_58": "* You feel something faintly&  resonating within ASRIEL.",
  "obj_asrielfinal_59": "* You feel something&  resonating within ASRIEL.",
  "obj_asrielfinal_60": "* You feel something strongly&  resonating within ASRIEL.",
  "obj_asrielfinal_61": "* You feel your friends' SOULs&  resonating within ASRIEL!",
  "obj_asrielfinal_423": "* The whole world is ending.",
  "obj_asrielfinal_425": "* You feel something faintly&  resonating within ASRIEL.",
  "obj_asrielfinal_426": "* You feel something&  resonating within ASRIEL.",
  "obj_asrielfinal_427": "* You feel something strongly&  resonating within ASRIEL.",
  "obj_asrielfinal_428": "* You feel your friends' SOULs&  resonating within ASRIEL!",
  "obj_asrielfinal_429": "* ...",
  "obj_asrielfinal_468": "* Strangely^1, as your friends&  remembered you.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_469": "* Something else began resonating&  within the SOUL^1, stronger&  and stronger./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_470": "* It seems that there's still&  one last person that needs&  to be saved./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_471": "* But who...?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_472": "* .../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_473": "* Suddenly^1, you realize./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_474": "* You reach out and call&  their name./%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_552": "* Can't move your body^1.&* Nothing happened./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_553": "* You struggle..^1.&* Nothing happened./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_554": "* You tried to reach your&  SAVE file^1.&* Nothing happened./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_555": "* You tried again to reach&  your SAVE file^1.&* Nothing happened./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_556": "* Seems SAVING the game really&  is impossible./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_559": "* SAVING over ASRIEL's file&  seems like the only way to&  defeat him.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_560": "* But^1, having never SAVED&  before^1, you lack the power&  to do it./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_561": "* Seems SAVING the game really&  is impossible./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_563": "* .../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_564": "* But.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_565": "* Maybe^1, with what little&  power you have.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_566": "* You can SAVE something else./%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_577": "* Can't move your body./^",
  "obj_asrielfinal_648": "* !?!?",
  "obj_asrielfinal_674": "Huh^1? What are you&doing...!?",
  "obj_asrielfinal_723": "",
  "obj_asrielfinal_724": "",
  "obj_asrielfinal_725": "",
  "obj_asrielfinal_726": "",
  "obj_asrielfinal_732": "",
  "obj_asrielfinal_737": "",
  "obj_asrielfinal_741": "",
  "obj_asrielfinal_746": "%%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_767": "Urah ha ha ha...&Behold my TRUE power!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_771": "I can feel it.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_772": "Every time you die^1,&your grip on this&world slips away./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_773": "Every time you die^1,&your friends forget&you a little more./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_774": "Your life will end&here^1, in a world&where no one&remembers you.../%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_779": "Still^1, you're&hanging on...?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_780": "That's fine./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_781": "In a few moments^1,&you'll forget&everything^1, too./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_782": "That attitude will&serve you well in&your next life!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_787": "Ura ha ha.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_788": "Still!?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_789": "Come on.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_790": "Show me what good&your DETERMINATION&is now!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_796": "Ultimate bepis/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_819": "\\E1Wh..^1.&what did you do...?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_820": "\\E3What's this&feeling...^1?&What's happening&to me?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_821": "\\E2No^1! NO^1!&I don't need&ANYONE!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_826": "\\E6STOP IT^1!&Get away from me!/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_827": "Do you hear me!?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_828": "\\E2I'll tear you&apart!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_833": "\\E3.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_834": "\\E3.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_835": "\\[C]..^1.&Do you know why&I'm doing this...?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_836": "Why I keep fighting&to keep you&around...?/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_841": "\\E4I'm doing this.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_842": "\\E6Because you're&special^1, \\[C]./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_843": "You're the only one&that understands&me./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_844": "You're the only one&who's any fun to&play with anymore./%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_849": "\\E4.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_850": "No.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_851": "\\E1That's not JUST&it./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_852": "I..^1. I.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_853": "\\E4I'm doing this&because I care&about you^1, \\[C]!/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_854": "\\E4I care about you&more than anybody&else!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_859": "\\E4I'm not ready for&this to end./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_860": "I'm not ready for&you to leave./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_861": "I'm not ready to&say goodbye to&someone like&you again.../%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_868": "\\E7So, please..^1.&STOP doing this.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_869": "AND JUST LET ME&WIN!!!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_877": "\\E5.../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_878": "\\[C].../%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_886": "\\E5I'm so alone^1,&\\[C].../%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_894": "\\E5I'm so afraid^1,&\\[C].../%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_903": "\\[C]^1, I.../%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_911": "I...",
  "obj_asrielfinal_976": "* You called out to your&  friends with all your&  heart./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_977": "* From somewhere^1, you felt&  their support.../^",
  "obj_asrielfinal_1007": "* You reached out to ASRIEL's&  SOUL and called out to your&  friends./",
  "obj_asrielfinal_1008": "* They're in there somewhere^1,&  aren't they?/",
  "obj_asrielfinal_1009": "* .../",
  "obj_asrielfinal_1010": "* Within the depths of ASRIEL's&  SOUL^1, something's resonating..!/%%",
  "obj_asrielfinal_1014": "* Within the depths of ASRIEL's&  SOUL^1, something's resonating..!/%%",
  "obj_assortedtrash_79": "* (You rest your hand on&  the rusted bike.^1)/",
  "obj_assortedtrash_80": "* (Its horn wheezes a honk&  of despair.)/%%",
  "obj_assortedtrash_86": "* (A beat-up desktop computer.^1)&* (The inside is empty.)/%%",
  "obj_assortedtrash_91": "* (It's a DVD case for an&  anime.)/",
  "obj_assortedtrash_92": "* (Desperate claw marks cover&  the edges.)/%%",
  "obj_astigmatism_210": "...&...",
  "obj_astigmatism_211": "You've&seen&enough.",
  "obj_astigmatism_212": "Take&your&last&look.",
  "obj_astigmatism_213": "...",
  "obj_astigmatism_220": "What are&you so&afraid&of?",
  "obj_astigmatism_222": "Finally,&someone&gets it.",
  "obj_astigmatism_228": "How&dare&you.",
  "obj_astigmatism_230": "That's&right!",
  "obj_astigmatism_236": "You&dare&defy me?",
  "obj_astigmatism_238": "You've&pushed&your&luck.",
  "obj_astigmatism_242": "That&takes&guts.",
  "obj_astigmatism_248": "...&Don't&pick on&me.",
  "obj_astigmatism_249": "...&Pick on&me.",
  "obj_astigmatism_254": "%%%",
  "obj_astigmatism_456": "* Astigmatism gazes through&  your soul.",
  "obj_astigmatism_457": "* Astigmatism gives you a&  hypnotizing glare.",
  "obj_astigmatism_458": "* Astigmatism clicks its teeth.",
  "obj_astigmatism_459": "* Smells like glasses.",
  "obj_astigmatism_460": "* Astigmatism has gone&  bloodshot.",
  "obj_astigmatism_461": "* Astigmatism doesn't care&  about fighting anymore.",
  "obj_astigmatism_462": "* Astigmatism is watering.",
  "obj_astigmatism_495": "* ASTIGMATISM - ATK 32 DEF 26&* This relentless bully ALWAYS&  gets its way./^",
  "obj_astigmatism_504": "* You pick on Astigmatism./^",
  "obj_astigmatism_518": "* You don't pick on Astigmatism./^",
  "obj_astigmatism_533": "* You stand up to Astigmatism./^",
