  "obj_darksans1_187": "* heheh... the old whoopee&  cushion in the hand&  trick./",
  "obj_darksans1_188": "* it's ALWAYS funny./",
  "obj_darksans1_189": "* anyways^1,&  you're a human, right?/",
  "obj_darksans1_190": "\\E1* that's hilarious./",
  "obj_darksans1_193": "* heh^1, the old whoopee&  cushion in the hand&  trick.../",
  "obj_darksans1_194": "\\E1* wait a sec..^1.&* have you heard it before&  or something?/",
  "obj_darksans1_195": "\\E1* you turned around before&  i said to..^1.&* ... weird./",
  "obj_darksans1_196": "* ... whatever^1.&* you're a human^1, right?/",
  "obj_darksans1_198": "\\E0* i'm sans^1.&* sans the skeleton./",
  "obj_darksans1_199": "* im actually supposed to&  be on watch for&  humans right now./",
  "obj_darksans1_200": "* but..^1. y'know.../",
  "obj_darksans1_201": "\\E1* i dont really care about&  capturing anybody./",
  "obj_darksans1_202": "\\E0* now my brother^1,&  papyrus.../",
  "obj_darksans1_203": "* he's a human-hunting&  FANATIC./",
  "obj_darksans1_204": "\\E1* hey^1, actually^1, I think&  that's him over there./",
  "obj_darksans1_205": "\\E0* i have an idea^1.&* go through this gate&  thingy./",
  "obj_darksans1_206": "* yeah, go right through^1.&* my bro made the bars&  too wide to stop anyone./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_210": "* heheh... the old whoopee&  cushion in the hand&  trick./",
  "obj_darksans1_211": "* it's ALWAYS funny./",
  "obj_darksans1_212": "* .../",
  "obj_darksans1_213": "\\E1* that's^1, uh^1.&* your cue to laugh./",
  "obj_darksans1_214": "\\E2* or^1, uh^1, to emote&  at all...?/",
  "obj_darksans1_215": "\\E0* .../",
  "obj_darksans1_216": "\\E1* (gee^1, lady^1, you really&  know how to pick&  'em, huh...?)/",
  "obj_darksans1_217": "\\E2* OK^1, that's fine^1.&* everyone's got their&  own sense of humor./",
  "obj_darksans1_218": "\\E0* i'm sans^1.&* sans the skeleton./",
  "obj_darksans1_219": "* im actually supposed to&  be on watch for&  humans right now./",
  "obj_darksans1_220": "* but..^1. y'know.../",
  "obj_darksans1_221": "\\E1* i dont really care about&  capturing anybody./",
  "obj_darksans1_222": "\\E0* now my brother^1,&  papyrus.../",
  "obj_darksans1_223": "* he's a human-hunting&  FANATIC./",
  "obj_darksans1_224": "\\E1* hey^1, actually^1, I think&  that's him over there./",
  "obj_darksans1_225": "\\E0* i have an idea^1.&* go through this gate&  thingy./",
  "obj_darksans1_226": "* yeah, go right through^1.&* my bro made the bars&  too wide to stop anyone./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_345": "* Human./",
  "obj_darksans1_346": "* Don't you know how&  to greet a new pal?/",
  "obj_darksans1_347": "* Turn around and shake&  my hand./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_354": "* Human./",
  "obj_darksans1_355": " %",
  "obj_darksans1_356": " %%",
  "obj_darksans1_399": "* quick^1, behind that&  conveniently-shaped&  lamp./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_457": "* sup^1, bro?/",
  "obj_darksans1_459": "YOU KNOW WHAT&\"SUP,^1\" BROTHER!/",
  "obj_darksans1_460": "IT'S BEEN EIGHT&DAYS AND YOU&STILL HAVEN'T.../",
  "obj_darksans1_461": "RECALIBRATED^1.&YOUR^1.&PUZZLES^1!/",
  "obj_darksans1_462": "YOU JUST HANG&AROUND OUTSIDE&YOUR STATION!/",
  "obj_darksans1_463": "WHAT ARE YOU&EVEN DOING?!?/",
  "obj_darksans1_465": "* staring at this lamp^1.&* it's really cool^1.&* do you wanna look?/%%",
  "obj_darksans1_480": "NO!^1!&I DON'T HAVE&TIME FOR THAT!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_481": "WHAT IF A HUMAN&COMES THROUGH&HERE!?!/",
  "obj_darksans1_482": "I WANT TO BE&READY!!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_483": "I WILL BE THE ONE!&I MUST BE THE ONE!/",
  "obj_darksans1_484": "I WILL CAPTURE A&HUMAN!/%%",
  "obj_darksans1_496": "THEN^1, I^1, THE&GREAT PAPYRUS.../",
  "obj_darksans1_497": "WILL GET&ALL THE THINGS I&UTTERLY DESERVE!/",
  "obj_darksans1_498": "RESPECT..^1.&RECOGNITION.../",
  "obj_darksans1_499": "I WILL FINALLY&BE ABLE TO JOIN&THE ROYAL GUARD!/",
  "obj_darksans1_500": "PEOPLE WILL ASK^1,&TO^1, BE MY^1,&\"FRIEND?\"/",
  "obj_darksans1_501": "\\E2I WILL BATHE IN A&SHOWER OF KISSES&EVERY MORNING./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_514": "* hmm.../",
  "obj_darksans1_515": "\\E1* maybe this lamp will&  help you./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_528": "SANS!^1! YOU ARE&NOT HELPING!^1!&YOU LAZYBONES!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_529": "ALL YOU DO IS SIT&AND BOONDOGGLE!/",
  "obj_darksans1_530": "YOU GET LAZIER&AND LAZIER&EVERY DAY!!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_532": "\\W* hey^1, take it easy^1.&* i've gotten a \\Yton\\W &  of work done today./",
  "obj_darksans1_533": "\\W*\\E2 a skele-\\Yton\\W./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_582": "SANS!!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_584": "\\E1* come on^1.&* you're smiling./",
  "obj_darksans1_586": "I AM AND I HATE IT!/",
  "obj_darksans1_587": "\\E3SIGH.../",
  "obj_darksans1_588": "\\E2WHY DOES SOMEONE&AS GREAT AS ME.../",
  "obj_darksans1_589": "\\E3HAVE TO DO SO MUCH&JUST TO GET SOME&RECOGNITION.../",
  "obj_darksans1_591": "* wow^1, sounds like&  you're really working&  yourself.../",
  "obj_darksans1_592": "\\E2* down to the bone./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_604": "UGH!!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_605": "I WILL ATTEND TO&MY PUZZLES.../",
  "obj_darksans1_606": "\\E3AS FOR YOUR WORK?/",
  "obj_darksans1_607": "PUT A LITTLE MORE,/",
  "obj_darksans1_608": "\\E4\"BACKBONE\" INTO&IT!!!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_609": "\\E2NYEHEHEHEHEHE&HEHEHEHEHEHE!!!/%%",
  "obj_darksans1_644": "HEH!/%%",
  "obj_darksans1_666": "* ok^1, you can come out&  now./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_720": "* .../",
  "obj_darksans1_721": "\\E1* uh^1, ok^1, i guess you&  don't have to./%%",
  "obj_darksans1_750": "SANS!!^1!&HAVE YOU FOUND A&HUMAN YET!??!/",
  "obj_darksans1_752": "* yeah./",
  "obj_darksans1_754": "REALLY!?!^1?&WOWIE!!!/",
  "obj_darksans1_755": "GUESS THAT'S&SETTLED!!/%%",
  "obj_darksans1_780": "* that worked out^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_72": "* Why do I look like a weird&  black sausage^1?&* Just the angle./%%",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_76": "* As a youth^1, I would sneak&  out to play by this creepy&  flaming pit./",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_77": "* Since the CORE is always&  re-arranging^1, it was like&  a game trying to find it./",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_78": "* Now it is my special place^1.&* It is nice for cooking s'mores&  and things like that./%%",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_83": "* We were hired by Mettaton&  to destroy you./",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_84": "* But since he never paid us^1,&  we all decided to quit./",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_85": "* No hard feelings./%%",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_90": "* Zzzzzzz.../",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_91": "* (It's taking a nap.)/%%",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_96": "* Why do I look like a black&  sausage and not a knight&  or a wizard?/",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_97": "* Well..^1.&* Everyone has an angle they&  look best from../%%",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_102": "* The core is made up of&  interchangable rooms./",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_103": "* Before you came here^1, the&  layout was altered so you&  would get lost and perish./",
  "obj_darksausagenpc_104": "* Yes^1. Just for you^1.&* Do you feel special?/%%",
  "obj_darksink_91": "* Error./%%",
  "obj_darksink_98": "* (You turned on the sink.)/%%",
  "obj_darksink_100": "* (You really like to wash&  your hands.)/%%",
  "obj_darksink_110": "* (You turned off the sink.)/%%",
  "obj_darksink_122": "* (You turned on the sink.)/%%",
  "obj_darksink_132": "* (There's a red key lying&  in the sink.)/",
  "obj_darksink_133": "* (You took it and put it&  on your keychain.)/%%",
  "obj_dateheart_158": "\\E3I SEE^1. I SEE./",
  "obj_dateheart_159": "\\E0YOU LIKE CARESSING&MY BICEPS WITH A&FLOATING HEART./",
  "obj_dateheart_160": "\\E1BUT WHO DOESN'T!?/%%",
  "obj_dateheart_161": "\\E0TRY AGAIN!/%%",
  "obj_dateheart_165": "\\E0THIS SHIRT DIDN'T&ORIGINALLY SAY&'COOL^1,' BUT I&IMPROVED IT./",
  "obj_dateheart_166": "EXPERT TIP^1: ALL&CLOTHING ARTICLES&CAN BE IMPROVED&THIS WAY./%%",
  "obj_dateheart_167": "\\E1BUT THAT'S NOT A&SECRET!!!/",
  "obj_dateheart_168": "IT'S JUST GOOD&ADVICE!!!/%%",
  "obj_dateheart_172": "\\E2HOLDING MY HAND&SO I'LL TELL&YOU THE ANSWER.../",
  "obj_dateheart_173": "\\E7NO!!^1!&I MUST RESIST!!/%%",
  "obj_dateheart_177": "\\E0THERE'S NO SECRET&TO MY LEGS./",
  "obj_dateheart_178": "JUST HARD WORK&AND PERSEVERANCE.../%%",
  "obj_dateheart_182": "\\E3HUMAN SOULS ARE&STRONGER THAN&MONSTER SOULS.../",
  "obj_dateheart_183": "\\E0BUT THE SOLES OF&OUR SHOES ON THE&OTHER HAND...!/",
  "obj_dateheart_184": "\\E3... ARE ABOUT THE&SAME./%%",
  "obj_dateheart_188": "HAT DIALOGUE./%%",
  "obj_dateheart_365": "\\E0I UNDERSTAND&WHY YOU'RE&RUNNING AWAY./",
  "obj_dateheart_366": "\\E2YOU'RE OVERWHELMED&BY THE SIGHT OF&MY COOL VIBES./",
  "obj_dateheart_367": "\\E0BUT YOU CAN'T&BACK DOWN NOW!!!/%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_73": "\\W* My fave Mettaton Moment(TM)^1?&* Right \\Ywhen everything looks the&  baddest^1, he poses dramatically\\W./",
  "obj_diamondkid_74": "* Like when he's on a cooking&  show and the eggs don't turn&  out right./%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_78": "* But^1!&* Then he says!/",
  "obj_diamondkid_79": "\\W* Even if you suck at cooking^1,&  you can always \\Ybuy an&  MTT-brand Glamburger\\W!/",
  "obj_diamondkid_80": "\\W* Then he \\Yeats one^1!\\W &* Everyone loves it!/",
  "obj_diamondkid_81": "* ... How does he eat it&  without a mouth?/",
  "obj_diamondkid_82": "* Uhhh... well..^1.&* Watch the show!/%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_87": "* That finale was really..^1.&* That was really sad!/",
  "obj_diamondkid_88": "* And Mettaton's schedule&  doesn't show any other&  shows.../%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_93": "* I've been thinking about&  getting a sick skateboard./%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_98": "\\W* My fave Mettaton Moment(TM)&  is when he beats up the&  \\Yheel-turning villains\\W!/",
  "obj_diamondkid_99": "* Even if it's during what's&  supposed to be a quiz show./%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_106": "* Oh^1! And I like when he tries&  on all kinds of different&  fashionable outfits!/",
  "obj_diamondkid_107": "* Even if it's during what's&  supposed to be a newscast./%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_112": "* Did Mettaton retire...?/",
  "obj_diamondkid_113": "* Can't he unretire...?/%%",
  "obj_diamondkid_119": "* On the surface we'll be able&  to watch all kinds of TV.../",
  "obj_diamondkid_120": "* But^1, I bet none of those&  shows are as good as&  Mettaton's!/%%",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_60": "* The door leading through&  the area is closed^1?&* So I tried the puzzle?/",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_61": "* But I kept running out of&  ammo^1, and it kept restarting?/",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_62": "* And my two co-workers won't&  help^1? It's like they don't&  even wanna go to work?/%%",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_63": "* Why don't you try^1?&* Try using the console?/%%",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_67": "* Wow^1?&* You solved it?/",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_68": "* I'm impressed^1?&* You must be a total nerd?/%%",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_73": "* So we're all gonna go&  free...?/",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_74": "* Does that mean I don't&  get to go to work?/%%",
  "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_79": "* Maybe I don't want to go&  to work anymore...?/%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_400": "* Tra la la^1.&* The waters are wild today^1.&* That's good luck.../%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_401": "* Tra la la./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_402": "* Tra la la^1.&* The waters are wild today^1.&* That's bad luck.../%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_403": "* Tra la la^1.&* Eat a mushroom everyday./",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_404": "* Why^1?&* Then I know you're listening&  to me.../%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_405": "* Tra la la^1.&* Remember to take a break&  every-so-often.../%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_406": "* Tra la la^1.&* Did you ever hear the old&  song coming from the sea?/%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_407": "* Tra la la^1.&* What's inside an acorn^1?&* It's really just a mystery./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_408": "* Tra la la^1.&* Dancing on a boat is danger^1.&* But good exercise.../%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_409": "* Tra la la^1.&* I heard ASGORE has a favorite&  food./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_410": "* Tra la la^1.&* I heard spiders have a&  favorite food./",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_411": "* It's spiders./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_412": "* Tra la la^1.&* The piano plays the&  tinkling song./",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_413": "* Hmm..^1. tinkling./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_414": "* Tra la la^1.&* You can never have too&  many hot-dogs./",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_415": "* ... sadly^1, that's not true./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_416": "* Tra la la^1.&* Don't snoop behind people's&  houses.../",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_417": "* You might be mistaken for&  a trash-can./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_418": "* Tra la la^1.&* The angel is coming..^1.&* Tra la la./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_419": "* Hum hum hum^1. Hum hum hum^1.&* I'm having a little concert./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_420": "* Pet pet pet..^1.&* The neck stretches infinitely&  into the cosmos./",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_421": "* ... don't worry about it./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_422": "* Ah,/%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_423": "* Tra la la^1.&* What's a game you can play&  with a dog?/",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_424": "* Asking for a friend.../%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_425": "* Tra la la^1.&* Temmie Village.../",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_426": "* ... the room before the&  darkening lantern room./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_427": "* Tra la la^1.&* Why don't you sing with me^1.&* Tra la la./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_428": "* Tra la la^1.&* Uh oh^1.&* Suddenly^1, feeling tropical.../%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_429": "* Tra la la^1.&* Hmmm.../",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_430": "* I should have worn a few&  more pairs of pants today./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_431": "* Tra la la^1.&* Hmmm.../",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_432": "* I should have worn a few&  million more pairs of pants&  today./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_433": "* Tra la la^1.&* Tri li li^1.&* Tre le le./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_447": "* Tra la la^1.&* Somewhere^1, it's \\[1]^1.&* So be careful./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_450": "* Tra la la^1.&* If it's hot or cold^1, you&  can count on me./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_451": "* Tra la la^1.&* The water is very wet today./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_452": "* Tra la la^1.&* The water is very dry today./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_453": "* Tra la la^1.&* What's my name^1?&* ... It doesn't really matter./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_454": "* Tra la la^1.&* Humans^1, monsters^1...&* Flowers./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_455": "* Tra la la^1.&* Beware of the man who&  speaks in hands./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_456": "* Tra la la^1.&* Beware of the man who came&  from the other world./%%",
  "obj_dogboat_thing_593": "* Come again some time^1.&* Tra la la./%%",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_108": "* Did something move^1?&* Was it my imagination?/",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_109": "* I can only see moving&  things./",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_110": "* If something WAS moving..^1.&* For example^1, a human.../",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_111": "* I'll make sure it NEVER&  moves again!/%%",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_114": "* Did something move^1?&* Was it my imagination?/",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_115": "* I can only see moving&  things./",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_116": "* H..^1. hey!&* I can't stop shivering&  all of a sudden./",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_117": "* Who..^1. who's there!?/%%",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_156": "* S-S-S-Something pet me...&* Something that isn't&  m-m-moving.../",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_157": "* I'm gonna need some dog&  treats for this!!!/%%",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_160": "* A stick appeared out of&  nowhere^1, then disappeared./",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_161": "* Was it a ghost stick?/",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_162": "* Did I just return it to&  the afterlife?/",
  "obj_dogetrigger1_163": "* I need some dog treats&  to think about this./%%",
  "obj_dogfood_98": "* (Unfortunately^1, it's just&  dry food.)/%%",
  "obj_dogfood_99": "* (There's a hot dog cut up&  into the kibble.)/%%",
  "obj_dogfoodbag_57": "* (It's a half-empty bag&  of dog food.)/%%",
  "obj_dogfoodbag_59": "* (It's a bag of dog food.^1)&* (It's half-full.)/%%",
  "obj_dogfoodbag_63": "* (It's a half-empty bag&  of dog food.)/",
  "obj_dogfoodbag_64": "* (...)/",
  "obj_dogfoodbag_65": "* (You just remembered&  something funny.)/%%",
  "obj_dogfoodbag_68": "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%",
  "obj_doggiebed_98": "* (It's too small to sleep&  on.)/%%",
  "obj_dogneckparent_99": "* It's the broken head of&  a snowdog./%%",
  "obj_dogpillarparent_117": "* Seems like the base of a&  snowdog./%%",
  "obj_dogpillarparent_118": "* It's a pile of mushy snow./%%",
  "obj_dogpillarparent_119": "* This dog is staring blankly&  into the snow^1, waiting for&  it to turn into art./%%",
  "obj_dogringbell_148": "* Hello^1?&* Is anybody there...^1?&* No?/%%",
  "obj_dogringbell_149": "* Are you two playing a trick&  on me^1?&* Real funny./%%",
  "obj_dogringbell_150": "* Big guy^1?&* Is that you^1?&* Come on.../%%",
  "obj_dogringbell_151": "* Well^1, it's not the tall&  skeleton..^1.&* He's too loud./%%",
  "obj_dogringbell_152": "* Whoever you are^1, knock it&  off!!!/%%",
  "obj_dogringbell_153": "* .../%%",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_74": "* That dog considers itself&  an artist^1, but doesn't ever&  know what to create./",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_75": "* It probably doesn't help&  that its brain is the size&  of a piece of kibble./%%",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_79": "* That dog from earlier...^1?&* It's at Grillby's^1.&* I think./",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_80": "* After work^1, all of the dogs&  go there to play cards&  together./",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_81": "* But that dog doesn't really&  know how to express itself./",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_82": "* So^1, it ends up playing alone^1,&  instead of introducing&  itself to the others.../%%",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_87": "* A dog just rushed in here^1,&  filled with inspiration./",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_88": "* It kept trying to build&  a snowdog that expressed&  its own emotions.../",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_89": "* But^1, as it built^1, it&  kept getting more excited&  about the sculpture.../",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_90": "* Its neck got longer and&  longer^1, and it added more&  and more snow^1, until.../",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_91": "* It was rather sad to watch^1,&  but I couldn't turn away./%%",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_96": "* We're all free?/",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_97": "* OK^1, OK..^1.&* I'll stop lounging around^1.&* Does that dog know?/",
  "obj_dogroom_npc_98": "* ... it probably doesn't^1,&  does it...?/%%",
  "obj_dogtreat_99": "* (Someone's been smoking&  dog treats.)/%%",
  "obj_doodlebug_368": "* DOODLEBOG - ? ATK ? DEF&* Art lets your wildest&  fantasies come to life!/^",
  "obj_doodlebug_371": "* DOODLEBOG C - ? ATK ? DEF&* The \"C\" stands for \"seafaring.\"&* It likes to ride in a boat./^",
  "obj_doodlebug_381": "* You draw a boat.&* Away it goes./^",
  "obj_doublesans_75": "* say.../",
  "obj_doublesans_76": "\\E1* are you following me?/%%",
  "obj_doublesans_77": "* are you lost?/%%",
  "obj_dummymonster_213": " ^1.^1.^1.^1.^1.",
  "obj_dummymonster_222": "%%%",
  "obj_dummymonster_394": "* Dummy looks like it's&  going to fall over.",
  "obj_dummymonster_395": "* Dummy stands around&  absentmindedly.",
  "obj_dummymonster_400": "* Dummy tires of your&  aimless shenanigans.",
  "obj_dummymonster_437": "* DUMMY - ATK 0 DEF 0^1 &* A cotton heart and a button ey^1e* You are the apple of my eye/%%",
  "obj_dummymonster_445": "* You talk to the DUMMY^2.&* .../",
  "obj_dummymonster_446": "* It doesn't seem much for&  conversation./",
  "obj_dummymonster_447": "* TORIEL seems happy with you./%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_222": "* Hahaha..^1.&* It's just like you to&  run away./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_223": "* FOOL^1!&* You think you can hurt&  ME???/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_224": "* Hahaha..^1.&* Too intimidated to fight&  me^1, huh!?/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_225": "* I am a ghost that lives&  inside a DUMMY./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_226": "* My cousin used to live&  inside a DUMMY^1, too^1.&* Until.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_229": "* YOU CAME ALONG!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_230": "* They were a shy sort^1.&* Living a lonely life in&  the RUINS.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_231": "* They saw you and hoped you&  might TALK to them./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_232": "* Perhaps strike up a&  friendly conversation./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_233": "* But NO!!!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_234": "* You ran away..^1.&* And broke their little&  ethereal heart./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_235": "* Despicable^1.&* Despicable^1!&* DESPICABLE!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_236": "* HUMAN^1!&* I'll show you what REAL&  heartbreak is!/%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_241": "* YOU DESTROYED THEIR HOME!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_242": "* Us ghosts spend our whole&  lives looking for a&  proper vessel./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_243": "* Slowly^1, slowly^1, we grow&  closer to our new&  bodies.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_244": "* Until one day^1, we too&  may become corporeal&  beings./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_245": "* Beings able to laugh^1,&  love^1, and dance like&  any other.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_246": "* But YOU!!!^1!&* My cousin's future...^1!&* You took it all away!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_251": "* Despicable^1.&* Despicable^1!&* DESPICABLE!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_252": "* HUMAN^1!&* I hope you're not too&  attached to YOUR body.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_253": "* Because your SOUL's about&  to get EVICTED!!!/%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_257": "* YOU CAME ALONG!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_258": "* When you talked to them^1,&  they thought they were&  in for a nice chat.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_259": "* But the things you&  SAID...!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_260": "* Horrible^1.&* Shocking^1!&* UNBELIEVABLE!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_261": "* It spooked them right&  out of their dummy!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_262": "* HUMAN^1!&* I'll scare your SOUL&  out of your body!/%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_267": "* YOU...!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_268": "* You.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_269": "* Shucks^1!&* You were really boring!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_270": "* They got annoyed and flew&  away like any self-&  respecting spectre./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_271": "* Well then^1.&* Well then!&* WELL THEN!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_272": "* Boring people are crumbs&  sticking to the face&  of this world./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_273": "* Human!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_274": "* I'll wipe you away with&  the dainty handkerchief&  of vengeance!/%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_279": "* Hahaha..^1.&* It's just like you to&  run away./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_280": "* FOOL^1!&* You think you can hurt&  ME???/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_281": "* Hahaha..^1.&* Too intimidated to fight&  me^1, huh!?/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_282": "* I am a ghost that lives&  inside a DUMMY./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_283": "* My cousin used to live&  inside a DUMMY^1, too^1.&* Until.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_284": "* YOU CAME ALONG!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_285": "* Not only did YOUR actions&  cause them to leave their&  home.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_286": "* But now all of their neighbors&  are gone^1, too!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_287": "* Despicable^1.&* Despicable^1!&* DESPICABLE!!!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_288": "* You're the worst person I've&  ever met^1!&* I've NEVER been more mad!!!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_289": "* Guooooohhhh!!!^1!&* My mannequin levels are&  going OFF THE CHARTS!!!/%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_344": "* well..^1.&* i'm going to head home&  now.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_345": "* oh..^1. umm..^1.&* feel free to \"come&  with\" if you want.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_346": "* but no pressure.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_347": "* i understand if you're&  busy.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_348": "* it's fine.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_349": "* no worries.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_350": "* just thought i'd&  offer.../%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_354": "* well..^1.&* i'm going to head home&  now.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_355": "* just warning you.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_356": "* so you don't accidentally&  follow me to my&  house.../",
  "obj_dummytrigger_357": "* you probably wouldn't&  like that.../%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_417": "* ...?/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_418": "* This..^1.&* This feeling...?/%%",
  "obj_dummytrigger_427": "* Eureka^1.&* Eureka^1!&* EUREKA!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_428": "* Human^1.&* That moment of unbridled&  emotion./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_429": "* It allowed me to finally&  fuse with my body!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_430": "* I'm fully corporeal now^1!&* My lifelong dream^1, realized!/",
  "obj_dummytrigger_431": "* In return^1, I guess I&  won't stomp you./",
  "obj_dummytrigger_432": "* How's that sound?/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_96": "* Error!/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_104": "* All that gives my life&  validation is explaining&  the Echo Flower.../",
  "obj_echoflower_105": "* No one can know.../%%",
  "obj_echoflower_110": "* This is an Echo Flower^1.&* It repeats the last thing&  it heard^1, over and over.../%%",
  "obj_echoflower_114": "* Neat^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_118": "* Never trust a flower..^1.&* That's one of the constants&  of this world./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_123": "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_130": "* Sitting behind rushing water..^1.&* It makes me feel relaxed./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_131": "* I swore I saw something..^1.&* Behind that rushing water.../%%",
  "obj_echoflower_135": "* I just wasn't ready for&  the responsibility./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_141": "* A long time ago^1, monsters would&  whisper their wishes to the&  stars in the sky./",
  "obj_echoflower_142": "* If you hoped with all your&  heart^1, your wish would come&  true./",
  "obj_echoflower_143": "* Now^1, all we have are these&  sparkling stones on the&  ceiling.../%%",
  "obj_echoflower_145": "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_150": "* Thousands of people wishing&  together can't be wrong!/",
  "obj_echoflower_151": "* The king will prove that./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_153": "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_156": "* C'mon^1, sis^1!&* Make a wish!/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_157": "* I wish my sister and I will&  see the real stars someday.../%%",
  "obj_echoflower_159": "* Ah..^1. seems my horoscope is&  the same as last week's.../%%",
  "obj_echoflower_161": "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_166": "* Sitting behind rushing water..^1.&* It makes me feel relaxed./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_171": "* Squeak./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_173": "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_178": "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_179": "* Don't say that^1!&* Come on^1, I promise I&  won't laugh./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_183": "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_184": "* So^1? Don't you have any&  wishes to make?/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_189": "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_190": "* ... hmmm^1, just one^1, but.../",
  "obj_echoflower_191": "* It's kind of stupid./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_194": "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_199": "* I can't run any longer..^1.&* Somebody^1, anybody.../%%",
  "obj_echoflower_205": "* Someday^1, I'd like to climb&  this mountain we're all&  buried under./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_209": "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_210": "* Sorry^1, it's just funny.../",
  "obj_echoflower_211": "* That's my wish^1, too./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_217": "* (You hear laughter.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_218": "* ... hey^1, you said you wouldn't&  laugh at it!/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_223": "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_224": "* Someday^1, I'd like to climb&  this mountain we're all&  buried under./",
  "obj_echoflower_225": "* Standing under the sky^1, looking&  at the world all around..^1.&* That's my wish./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_230": "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_231": "* Of course I won't laugh!/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_236": "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/",
  "obj_echoflower_237": "* ... hmmm..^1. if I say my wish..^1.&* You promise you won't&  laugh at me?/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_243": "* Where oh where could that&  child be...?/",
  "obj_echoflower_244": "* I've been looking all over&  for them.../",
  "obj_echoflower_245": "\\TS* .../",
  "obj_echoflower_246": "\\TF* Hee hee hee./",
  "obj_echoflower_247": "* THAT'S not true./",
  "obj_echoflower_248": "* She'll find another kid^1, and&  instantly forget about you./",
  "obj_echoflower_249": "* You'll NEVER see her again./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_253": "* Where am I...?/",
  "obj_echoflower_254": "* It's so cold here..^1.&* And so dark.../",
  "obj_echoflower_255": "* Someone help me..^1.&* Anyone..^1. please..^1.&* Help me.../",
  "obj_echoflower_256": "\\TF* .../",
  "obj_echoflower_257": "* But nobody came./%%",
  "obj_echoflower_262": "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%",
  "obj_echoflower_301": "* (You stop to smell the&  flowers.)/%%",
  "obj_elevatordoor_215": "* (The elevator isn't working.)/",
  "obj_elevatordoor_218": "\\S-\\Sp* Ring...\\S+/",
  "obj_elevatordoor_219": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_elevatordoor_220": "* What^1?&* The elevator should&  be working.../",
  "obj_elevatordoor_221": "* .../",
  "obj_elevatordoor_222": "\\E6* W-well then^1!&* Go to the right&  and keep heading up!/%%",
  "obj_elevatordoor_223": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_elevatordoor_224": "* Click.../%%",
  "obj_elevatordoor_228": "\\E6* W-well then^1!&* Let's go to the&  left!/%%",
  "obj_elevatordoor_229": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_elevatordoor_230": "* Click.../%%",
  "obj_elevatordoor_234": "* (The elevator isn't working.)/%%",
  "obj_elevatordoor_250": "* (The elevator isn't working.)/%%",
  "obj_elevatordoor_258": "* (The elevator is in use.)/%%",
  "obj_elevatorpanel_104": "* Please select a location./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_188": "\\E0Why...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_189": "Why did you let me go? /",
  "obj_endflowey_190": "\\E7Don't you realize that&being nice.../",
  "obj_endflowey_191": "\\E1... just makes you&get hurt?/",
  "obj_endflowey_192": "\\E0Look at yourself./",
  "obj_endflowey_193": "\\E9You made all these&great friends.../",
  "obj_endflowey_194": "\\E0But now^1, you'll probably&never see them again./",
  "obj_endflowey_195": "\\E9Not to mention how&much they've been&set back by you./",
  "obj_endflowey_196": "\\E6Hurts^1, doesn't it?/",
  "obj_endflowey_197": "\\E7If you had just gone&through without caring&about anyone.../",
  "obj_endflowey_198": "\\E6You wouldn't have to&feel bad now./",
  "obj_endflowey_199": "\\E0So I don't get it./",
  "obj_endflowey_200": "\\E7If you really did&everything the right&way../",
  "obj_endflowey_201": "\\E0Why did things still&end up like this?/",
  "obj_endflowey_202": "\\E6Why...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_203": "\\E5Is life really&that unfair?/",
  "obj_endflowey_204": "\\E9.../",
  "obj_endflowey_205": "\\E0Say./",
  "obj_endflowey_206": "\\E9What if I told you.../",
  "obj_endflowey_207": "\\E0I knew some way&to get you a better&ending?/",
  "obj_endflowey_208": "\\E9You'll have to load&your SAVE file, and.../",
  "obj_endflowey_211": "\\E9You'll have to&start over^1, and.../",
  "obj_endflowey_216": "\\E0Well, in the meantime^1,&why don't you go see&Dr. Alphys?/",
  "obj_endflowey_219": "\\E0Well^1, in the meantime^1,&why don't you go see&Undyne?/",
  "obj_endflowey_223": "\\E0Well^1, in the meantime^1,&why don't you go see&Papyrus^1, then Undyne?/",
  "obj_endflowey_226": "\\E9It seems like you&could have been&better friends./",
  "obj_endflowey_227": "Who knows..^1. maybe&she's got the key&to your happiness...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_228": "\\E4See you soon./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_242": "But^1, despite everything^1,&your happy ending&didn't come./",
  "obj_endflowey_243": "\\E5Why...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_244": "\\E4I know why./",
  "obj_endflowey_245": "\\E4Go to Dr. Alphys./",
  "obj_endflowey_246": "\\E5Your date with her&has really just&begun./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_259": "So you went the&whole way through&without killing.../",
  "obj_endflowey_260": "\\E5And then you decided&to kill ASGORE?/",
  "obj_endflowey_261": "\\E6What the hell is&WRONG with you?/",
  "obj_endflowey_262": "\\E4You COMPLETELY missed&the point./",
  "obj_endflowey_263": "\\E2Are you trolling me?/",
  "obj_endflowey_264": "\\E0Because./",
  "obj_endflowey_265": "\\E4No./",
  "obj_endflowey_266": "\\E5You are only&trolling yourself./",
  "obj_endflowey_267": "\\E6What a waste of&everybody's time./",
  "obj_endflowey_268": "\\E7All you had to&do was make friends./",
  "obj_endflowey_269": "With Papyrus^1, Undyne^1,&and then Alphys./",
  "obj_endflowey_270": "\\E2But you were too&busy messing it up!/%%",
  "obj_endflowey_284": "Hey./",
  "obj_endflowey_285": "Since you defeated me./",
  "obj_endflowey_286": "I've been thinking./",
  "obj_endflowey_287": "\\E3Is killing things&really necessary?/",
  "obj_endflowey_288": "\\E1I.../",
  "obj_endflowey_289": "\\E3I honestly don't&know anymore./",
  "obj_endflowey_290": "\\E0I have a request&for you./",
  "obj_endflowey_291": "\\E4Prove to me.../",
  "obj_endflowey_292": "\\E5Prove to me you&are strong enough&to survive./",
  "obj_endflowey_293": "\\E6Get here from&the beginning./",
  "obj_endflowey_294": "\\E0Without killing a&single thing.../",
  "obj_endflowey_296": "\\E4... and I won't&kill the king./",
  "obj_endflowey_298": "\\E4... and^1, maybe.../",
  "obj_endflowey_299": "\\E7Then you'll have&your so-called&\"happy ending.\"/",
  "obj_endflowey_300": "\\E6So^1, what will&it be?/",
  "obj_endflowey_301": "\\E5Will you prove&yourself?/",
  "obj_endflowey_302": "\\E8Or will I get to&watch you suffer...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_303": "Either way^1, I'm&interested!!!/",
  "obj_endflowey_304": "\\E4Hee hee hee.../%%",
  "obj_endflowey_319": "Interesting.../",
  "obj_endflowey_320": "\\E6So^1, even with&everything you did.../",
  "obj_endflowey_321": "\\E5The outcome's still&the same./",
  "obj_endflowey_322": "\\E9In the end^1, your&choices were an&illusion./",
  "obj_endflowey_323": "\\E9NOTHING you do&really matters!/",
  "obj_endflowey_324": "\\E8Hee hee hee!/",
  "obj_endflowey_325": "\\E8.../",
  "obj_endflowey_326": "\\E0Well./",
  "obj_endflowey_327": "\\E6You DID do what&I told you./",
  "obj_endflowey_328": "\\E5I guess it's up&to me to get you a&REAL happy ending./",
  "obj_endflowey_329": "\\E0For starters^1, you&can't do it by&yourself./",
  "obj_endflowey_330": "Papyrus^1, Undyne^1,&Alphys..^1. these guys./",
  "obj_endflowey_331": "\\E4Are you friends with&all of them yet?/",
  "obj_endflowey_332": "\\E5Maybe you should go&back and..^1. \"hang\"&with them./",
  "obj_endflowey_333": "\\E4The power of&friendship.../",
  "obj_endflowey_334": "That always saves&the day^1, right?/%%",
  "obj_endflowey_349": "\\E0So^1, killing people&is ACTUALLY fine...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_350": "\\E4Sure./",
  "obj_endflowey_351": "I'm glad we agree on&the value of a life./",
  "obj_endflowey_352": "I've learned SO&MUCH from you./",
  "obj_endflowey_353": "\\E0Though..^1. are you&REALLY gonna keep&doing things halfway?/",
  "obj_endflowey_354": "\\E8The amount of people&you killed.../",
  "obj_endflowey_355": "\\E9It's honestly&DISAPPOINTING./",
  "obj_endflowey_356": "\\E8You IDIOT./",
  "obj_endflowey_357": "\\E4You really can't do&ANYTHING right./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_372": "Why^1, \\[C]...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_373": "\\E3Why?/",
  "obj_endflowey_374": "\\E1WHY?/",
  "obj_endflowey_375": "\\E8We were on our way&to REAL victory.../",
  "obj_endflowey_376": "\\E9On our way to making&up for LAST time!/",
  "obj_endflowey_377": "\\E2Why'd you have to&SCREW IT UP?/",
  "obj_endflowey_378": "\\E5Hahaha.../",
  "obj_endflowey_379": "\\E9Is this REVENGE?/",
  "obj_endflowey_382": "\\E1Making me watch you&act so pure and&happy^1, while I...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_386": "\\E1Making me watch you&live out your life^1,&while I...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_389": "\\E1.../",
  "obj_endflowey_390": "\\E7No./",
  "obj_endflowey_391": "\\E8NO./",
  "obj_endflowey_392": "I KNOW what you're&doing./",
  "obj_endflowey_393": "You just want to see&what it's all like./",
  "obj_endflowey_394": "Before we TEAR IT&AWAY from them./",
  "obj_endflowey_395": "Ahahaha.../",
  "obj_endflowey_396": "\\E9Genius^1, \\[C]./",
  "obj_endflowey_397": "\\E4Well^1, I'll let you&mess around./",
  "obj_endflowey_398": "\\E8I know you'll come&back eventually./",
  "obj_endflowey_399": "\\E9And when that time&comes.../",
  "obj_endflowey_400": "\\E4\\[C]./",
  "obj_endflowey_401": "\\E4I'll be waiting&for you./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_415": "Why do you keep&coming back here?/",
  "obj_endflowey_416": "\\E5Oh^1, I get it^1.&You wanna be friends^1,&huh...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_417": "\\E8You're PATHETIC./",
  "obj_endflowey_418": "\\E8You REALLY think I&want to be friends&with YOU?/",
  "obj_endflowey_419": "\\E5Heh.../",
  "obj_endflowey_420": "\\E9You really DON'T&get it^1, do you?/",
  "obj_endflowey_421": "\\E5There's only one&person I could care&about anymore./",
  "obj_endflowey_422": "\\E6And even then^1, I&couldn't TRULY care&about them./",
  "obj_endflowey_423": "\\E5I just like to think&there's someone out&there.../",
  "obj_endflowey_424": "Someone that I&won't get tired of./",
  "obj_endflowey_425": "\\E8Someone like ME./",
  "obj_endflowey_426": "\\E8.../",
  "obj_endflowey_427": "\\E0Say./",
  "obj_endflowey_428": "\\E4Quit looking at me&with that stupid&expression./",
  "obj_endflowey_429": "You're pissing me&off./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_443": "\\E0So you're here&again./",
  "obj_endflowey_444": "\\E2What's wrong with&you?/",
  "obj_endflowey_445": "\\E4Are you trying to&start the Flowey&Fan Club?/",
  "obj_endflowey_446": "\\E5Because if you&want to join THAT.../",
  "obj_endflowey_447": "\\E4You'll have to&talk to Papyrus./",
  "obj_endflowey_448": "\\E6Yeah^1, he started&one./",
  "obj_endflowey_449": "\\E5A few different&times^1, anyway./",
  "obj_endflowey_450": "\\E0I won't lie./",
  "obj_endflowey_451": "\\E4He's one of the&better characters&to mess around with./",
  "obj_endflowey_452": "\\E5Took me a long&time to get bored&of that one./",
  "obj_endflowey_453": "\\E7... Yeah./",
  "obj_endflowey_454": "\\E4Talk to him&about it./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_468": "\\E0So./",
  "obj_endflowey_469": "\\E4Did you start the&Flowey Fan Club?/",
  "obj_endflowey_470": "\\E5Ha^1.&I'm just kidding./",
  "obj_endflowey_471": "\\E9I was watching^1.&I know you didn't./",
  "obj_endflowey_472": "\\E5But I don't care^1.&Really./",
  "obj_endflowey_473": "\\E6He probably would&have invited his&garbage brother./",
  "obj_endflowey_474": "\\E4You know^1.&Smiley Trashbag./",
  "obj_endflowey_475": "\\E0.../",
  "obj_endflowey_476": "\\E4Say./",
  "obj_endflowey_477": "If I have ONE piece&of advice for you.../",
  "obj_endflowey_478": "\\E9DON'T./",
  "obj_endflowey_479": "Let his brother./",
  "obj_endflowey_480": "Find out ANYTHING&about you./",
  "obj_endflowey_481": "\\E6He'll..^1. well.../",
  "obj_endflowey_482": "\\E5Let's just say./",
  "obj_endflowey_483": "\\E9He's caused me more&than my fair share&of resets./",
  "obj_endflowey_484": "\\E4Stay away from&that guy./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_498": "\\E0Why do you keep&coming back here?/",
  "obj_endflowey_499": "You don't REALLY&want to be friends^1,&do you...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_500": ".../",
  "obj_endflowey_501": "\\E4No^1. I get it./",
  "obj_endflowey_502": "You're just like me^1,&aren't you?/",
  "obj_endflowey_503": "You don't care about&anyone./",
  "obj_endflowey_504": "\\E4You're just bored./",
  "obj_endflowey_505": "You just want to&see what I'll say./",
  "obj_endflowey_506": "\\E5So you can laugh&and throw me away&like a broken toy./",
  "obj_endflowey_507": "\\E8Well^1, TOO BAD!/",
  "obj_endflowey_508": "\\E9I'm not LIKE everybody&else./",
  "obj_endflowey_509": "\\E9So, from now on.../",
  "obj_endflowey_510": "\\E4You're not getting&ANYTHING./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_524": ".../",
  "obj_endflowey_525": "\\E4Don't you have&anything BETTER to do?/%%",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_111": "Hi./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_128": "Seems as if everyone&is perfectly happy./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_129": "Monsters have returned&to the surface./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_130": "Peace and prosperity&will rule across the land./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_131": "\\E6Take a deep breath./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_132": "\\E5There's nothing left&to worry about./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_148": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_149": "\\E6Well./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_150": "\\E1There is one thing./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_151": "\\E3One last threat./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_152": "One being with the&power to erase&EVERYTHING.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_153": "\\E1Everything everyone's&worked so hard for./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_154": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_155": "\\E6You know who I'm&talking about^1, don't&you?/",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_156": "\\E1That's right./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_157": "\\E4I'm talking about YOU./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_158": "\\E7YOU still have the&power to reset&everything./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_159": "\\E0Toriel^1, Sans^1, Asgore^1,&Alphys, Papyrus, Undyne.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_160": "If you so choose.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_161": "Everyone will be&ripped from this&timeline.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_162": "... and sent back before&all of this&ever happened./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_163": "\\E6Nobody will&remember anything./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_164": "\\E5You'll be able to&do whatever you&want./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_165": "\\E0.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_166": "\\E7That power./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_167": "\\E3I know that power./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_168": "\\E6That's the power&you were fighting to&stop^1, wasn't it?/",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_169": "\\E7The power that I&wanted to use./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_170": "\\E6But now^1, the idea&of resetting&everything.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_171": "\\E7I.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_172": "\\E1I don't think I&could do it all&again./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_173": "Not after that./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_174": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_175": "\\E1So, please./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_176": "\\E3Just let them go./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_177": "Let Frisk be happy./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_178": "Let Frisk live&their life./%%",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_195": "\\E1.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_197": "\\E3But./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_199": "If I can't change&your mind./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_201": "If you DO end up&erasing everything.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_203": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_205": "\\E6You have to erase&my memories^1, too./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_207": "\\E7.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_209": "\\E6I'm sorry./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_211": "\\E5You've probably heard&this a hundred times&already^1, haven't you...?/",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_213": ".../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_215": "\\E0Well^1, that's all./",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_217": "\\E6See you later.../",
  "obj_endflowey_regret_219": "\\E4\\[1]./%%",
  "obj_endogeny_360": "* Amalgamate is watching you&  intently.",
  "obj_endogeny_361": "* Amalgamate is waiting for&  your command.",
  "obj_endogeny_362": "* It smells like a bunch of dogs.",
  "obj_endogeny_363": "* Amalgamate is hovering close^1,&  looking for affection.",
  "obj_endogeny_366": "* Amalgamate is striking the&  wall with its claws.",
  "obj_endogeny_367": "* Amalgamate is twitching&  affectionately.",
  "obj_endogeny_368": "* Amalgamate's convulsions&  intensify.",
  "obj_endogeny_369": "* Endogeny is contented.",
  "obj_endogeny_370": "* Monster has low HP.",
  "obj_endogeny_371": "* Endogeny is contented.",
  "obj_endogeny_403": "* AMALGAMATE - It's unclear how&  many dogs this counts as./^",
  "obj_endogeny_404": "* ENDOGENY - It's unclear how&  many dogs this counts as./^",
  "obj_endogeny_416": "* The Amalgamate's feelers&  rotate quickly^1.&* Nothing else happens./^",
  "obj_endogeny_420": "* You call the Amalgamate./",
  "obj_endogeny_421": "* It bounds towards you^1,&  flecking a strange liquid&  from an orifice./^",
  "obj_endogeny_435": "* You try looking away^1, but&  it seems to appear everywhere&  you look./^",
  "obj_endogeny_446": "* You pet the Amalgamate./^",
  "obj_endogeny_449": "* You'd give it a tummy rub^1,&  but it's not clear where its&  tummy begins or ends./^",
  "obj_endogeny_455": "* You pet decisively^1.&* The Amalgamate seems to be&  satisfied by all this./^",
  "obj_endogeny_466": "* You pet the Amalgamate^1.&* It starts to generate a&  Stage I Happiness Froth./^",
  "obj_endogeny_475": "* You try to pet the&  Amalgamate but your hand&  phases through it./",
  "obj_endogeny_476": "* It must not want to be pet&  for now./^",
  "obj_endogeny_480": "* You pet the Amalgamate^1.&* It convulses rapidly..^1.&* Then calms down./",
  "obj_endogeny_481": "* It rests quietly on your&  lap for a moment.../",
  "obj_endogeny_482": "* Zzzzz.../",
  "obj_endogeny_483": "* Suddenly^1, it shoots away and&  crawls wildly on the walls!/^",
  "obj_endogeny_491": "* Amalgamate is too far&  away to pet^1.&* You just pet the air./^",
  "obj_endogeny_500": "* You play with the Amalgamate./^",
  "obj_endogeny_503": "* Amalgamate seems too tired&  to play./^",
  "obj_endogeny_507": "* You throw your weapon into&  the corner of the room./",
  "obj_endogeny_508": "* The Amalgamate brings it back&  to you..^1.&* Proudly?/",
  "obj_endogeny_509": "* You repeat this process a&  few times./",
  "obj_endogeny_510": "* Now Amalgamate is very tired..^1.&* It leans its dripping^1,&  amorphous body on you.../^",
  "obj_endogeny_518": "* Amalgamate is not excited&  enough to play with...?/^",
  "obj_essaystuff_159": "Speechless...?&Who can blame you?/%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_160": "Well... that's concise./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_161": "Beautiful. Sometimes&the fewest words&speak the loudest./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_162": "Nice. You get a&gold star./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_163": "Oh my... what a&great answer./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_164": "Oooooh, you said so&much about me.../",
  "obj_essaystuff_165": "I love how&passionate you are./",
  "obj_essaystuff_166": "... even though I&don't understand&what you said.../%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_168": "Beautiful.&Why don't you&write a book?/%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_219": "Nice detail...&You're right, I do&look quite nice./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_220": "Wonderful! Amazing! A+...&I AM completely stunning./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_221": "Oh, I'm blushing...&You're completely right,&I am beautiful in&every way./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_222": "Oh my... I'm speechless...&You've completely&captured how&beautiful I am./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_224": "That's right.&Legs was the&correct answer!/%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_225": "How creative. Arms...&most people just&think about my legs./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_226": "My hair... yes,&I use metal hair&gel./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_233": "Yes^1, my personality&is quite charming^1,&isn't it?/%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_234": "They say I have&the voice of a&Siren..^1./",
  "obj_essaystuff_235": "... awooga!/%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_236": "Dancing...^1?&Thank you^1, I'm&self-taught./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_255": "Huh? This essay is&supposed to be about&me, not about you.../%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_264": "What a touching&confession! I'll add&it to the pile./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_271": "Toby? What the hell&is that?&Sounds... sexy./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_289": "Oh my! This is a family&friendly TV show./",
  "obj_essaystuff_290": "Now stand still while&I murder you./%%",
  "obj_essaystuff_510": "* Mettaton is saving your&  essay for future use.",
  "obj_essaystuff_ja_1": "",
