  "obj_lastsans_trigger_561": "\\E2* why would you think&  that was a secret&  secret codeword?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_562": "\\E1* whoever told you that&  is a dirty liar./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_563": "\\E2* i don't have a secret&  secret codeword./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_564": "\\E3* however./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_565": "\\E2* i do have a secret&  secret triple-secret&  codeword./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_566": "\\E1* which you just said./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_567": "\\E2* so^1, i guess you're&  qualified./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_568": "\\E2* here's the key to my&  room./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_569": "\\E3* it's time.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_570": "* you learned the truth./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_571": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_572": "* (When you looked^1, the key was&  already on your keychain.)/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_578": "\\E0* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_579": "\\E1* huh^1?&* triple secret codeword?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_580": "\\E2* nah^1, i'm out of&  material./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_581": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_582": "* (You felt something on your&  keychain.)/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_634": "\\E0* heya./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_635": "\\E1* you've been busy^1,&  huh?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_636": "* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_637": "\\E0* so^1, i've got a&  question for ya./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_638": "\\E3* do you think even&  the worst person can&  change...?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_639": "\\E3* that everybody can be&  a good person^1, if&  they just try?/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_643": "\\E0* heya./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_644": "\\E1* you look frustrated&  about something./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_645": "\\E4* guess i'm pretty good&  at my job^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_650": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_651": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  twice in a row./",
