  "obj_lastsans_trigger_653": "\\E3* all right./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_654": "\\E4* how 'bout we make it&  a third?/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_659": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_660": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  thrice in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_661": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_662": "\\E1* hey^1, what comes after&  \"thrice^1,\" anyway?/",
