  "obj_lastsans_trigger_668": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_669": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  quice in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_670": "\\E1* quice^1?&* frice?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_671": "\\E4* welp^1, won't have to&  use it again anyways./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_676": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_677": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  five times in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_678": "\\E2* convenient^1, huh^1?&* that's one for each&  finger./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_679": "\\E3* but soon.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_680": "\\E4* you'll need a cool&  mutant hand to count&  all of your deaths./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_685": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_686": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  six times in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_687": "\\E2* that's the number of&  fingers on a mutant&  hand./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_688": "\\E3* but soon.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_689": "\\E4* you'll need to find&  a mutant hand with&  even more fingers./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_694": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_695": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  seven times in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_696": "\\E0* hey^1, that's good^1.&* seven's supposed to be&  a lucky number./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_697": "\\E2* who knows^1, maybe&  you'll hit the&  jackpot.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_698": "\\E4* and that number will&  multiply tenfold./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_703": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_704": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  eight times in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_705": "\\E2* that's the number of&  fingers on a spider./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_706": "\\E3* but soon.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_707": "\\E1* wait^1, don't spiders&  have legs?/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_713": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_714": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  seven times in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_715": "\\E1* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_716": "\\E2* nope^1, wait^1, that's&  definitely nine^1, sorry./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_717": "\\E4* or was it ten?/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_723": "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_724": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  ten times in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_725": "\\E2* hey^1, congrats^1!&* the big one-oh!/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_726": "\\E1* let's invite all your&  friends over for a&  big shindig./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_727": "\\E2* we can have pie^1, and&  hot dogs^1, and.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_728": "\\E3* hmmm..^1. wait^1.&* something's not right./",
