  "obj_lastsans_trigger_736": "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  eleven times in a row./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_737": "\\E2* well^1, give or take./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_738": "\\E1* there's nuance to&  this stuff./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_739": "\\E2* don't think i'll be&  able to count very&  well from here./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_740": "\\E1* count for me^1, ok?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_741": "\\E4* we'll start from 12./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_747": "\\E0* let's just get to&  the point./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_752": "\\E0* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_753": "\\E1* that expression that&  you're wearing.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_754": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_755": "\\E4* well^1, i won't grace&  it with a description./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_759": "\\E0* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_760": "\\E1* that expression that&  you're wearing.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_761": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_762": "\\E4* you're really kind&  of a freak^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_786": "\\E3* heh heh heh heh.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_787": "\\E1* all right./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_788": "\\E3* well^1, here's a better&  question./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_789": "\\E4* do you wanna have&  a bad time?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_790": "\\E3* 'cause if you take&  another step&  forward.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_791": "\\E4* you are REALLY not&  going to like what&  happens next./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_815": "\\E3* welp./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_817": "\\E3* sorry^1, old lady./",
