  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_134": "* Yo.../%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_140": "* Yo..^1./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_141": "* Where's the umbrella...^1?&* Ha... ha.../%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_146": "* Yo^1!&* Ready yet?/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_154": "* Yo^1!&* Ready yet?/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_158": "* Yo^1!&* You got us an umbrella?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_159": "* You're the best!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_167": "* Yo^1, you got an umbrella?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_168": "* Awesome!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_173": "* Yo^1! You can't hold an&  umbrella either?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_174": "* If you're walking anyway^1,&  I guess I'll go with you^1,&  haha.../%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_201": "* Let's go!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_284": "* Yo^1, I already looked^1,&  Undyne's not over here./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_285": "* So I guess I'll see&  ya later^1, haha./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger3_286": "* See ya later!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger4_66": "* Man^1, Undyne is sooooooo&  cool./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger4_67": "* She beats up bad guys and&  NEVER loses./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger4_68": "* If I was a human^1, I would&  wet the bed every night.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger4_69": "* ... knowing she was gonna&  beat me up^1!&* Ha ha./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger5_91": "* Ummm^1, maybe she wouldn't beat&  up the teachers.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger5_92": "* She's too cool to ever&  hurt an innocent person!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger6_192": "* Yo^1, you wanna see&  Undyne^1, right...?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger6_193": "* Climb on my shoulders./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger6_195": "* Put up your umbrella and&  climb on my shoulders./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger6_272": "* Yo^1, you go on ahead./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger6_273": "* Don't worry about me^1.&* I always find a way to&  get through!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger6_276": "* Owww..^1.&* Yo^1, try being a little&  less rough^1, haha./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger6_277": "* Anyway^1, I'll look for&  another way through^1.&* Later!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_124": "* Yo!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_214": "* Yo./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_215": "* Undyne told me to stay&  away from you./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_216": "* She said you..^1.&* You hurt a lot of people./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_217": "* .../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_218": "* But^1, yo^1, that's not true^1,&  right!?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_219": "* .../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_220": "* ... yo..^1.&* Why won't you answer me?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_221": "* A..^1. a..^1. and what's with&  that weird expression...?/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_225": "* Yo^1, dude..^1.&* I..^1. I heard some things^1,&  and.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_226": "* What^1?&* Look over here^1?&* What for  %%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_309": "* Yo^1, w-w-wait^1!&* Help^1!&* I tripped!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_379": "\\W* Wh-what are you \\Ystanding&  around\\W for?&* \\YGet over here^1,\\W dude!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_417": "* I..^1.&* I'm slipping!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_490": "* Undyne..^1. you saved me...?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_491": "* Yo^1, I thought I was a&  goner^1, haha.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_492": "* ... wait^1, are you okay^1?&* It looks like you fell&  pretty hard.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_493": "* Th-this is my fault^1.&* I should have stayed away from&  them^1, like you said./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_494": "* They just stood there..^1.&* Watching..^1.&* Waiting for me to fall./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_495": "* They just went straight to&  fight you instead of&  helping me.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_496": "* I was so scared^1, and you.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_497": "* What^1?&* You're gonna go fight them&  now?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_498": "* But you look hurt..^1.&* You should rest^1, haha.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_499": "* .../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_500": "* W-warriors don't rest^1, huh?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_501": "* Undyne..^1. you're really cool./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_643": "* Y..^1. y..^1. yo..^1. dude.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_644": "* If..^1. If y^1-you wanna hurt&  my friend.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_645": "* You're gonna have to get&  through me^1, first./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_714": "* She's gone.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_715": "* Yo^1, you really saved my skin./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_716": "* Guess being enemies was just&  a nice thought^1, haha./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_717": "* We'll just have to be friends&  instead./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_718": "* ... man^1, I should REALLY go&  home.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_719": "* I bet my parents are worried&  sick about me!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_757": "* Later^1, dude!/%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_836": "* Oh..^1.&* Oh man.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_837": "* (Man^1, my h-heart's pounding&  right out of my chest...)/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_838": "* (... what would Undyne do?)/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_839": "* (...)/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_840": "* Yo.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_841": "* Y-you'd b-better st-stop&  r-right where you are.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_842": "* Cause if you w-wanna hurt&  anyone else..^1. you're.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_843": "* You're gonna have to get&  through me^1, first./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_844": "* A..^1. and..^1. and..^1.%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_901": "* S-see^1?&* I knew y-you weren't so&  bad!/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_902": "* I've gotta go tell Undyne&  she was wrong about you!/%%",
