  "obj_napstablook_actor_199": "* because i cried the&  letters into my hand/%%",
  "obj_napstablook_actor_204": "* oh no..^1.&* the letters in my hand&  are joining together/",
  "obj_napstablook_actor_205": "* oh no..^1.&* i'm going to forget your&  name.../",
