  "obj_napstablook_actor_207": "* oh no..^1.&* the tears are all forming&  a big pile.../",
  "obj_napstablook_actor_208": "* oh no..^1.&* your name's getting really&  long/%%",
  "obj_napstablook_cd_113": "* (You still need to recover&  after all that lying down.)/%%",
  "obj_napstablook_farm1_73": "* awkward..^1.&* i'm working right now.../",
