  "obj_nicecreamguy_152": "* I relocated my store^1, but&  there are still no&  customers.../%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_164": "* You must have something better to do than read this message./%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_183": "* I thought for sure if I&  went to Hotland^1, I'd sell&  some Nice Creams./",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_184": "* But nobody wants them^1.&* Everyone's just eating&  Starfaits and Glamburgers./",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_185": "* So!!!/%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_197": "* You must have something better to do than read this message./%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_211": "* I'm so happy!^1!&* Nice Cream is really&  changing the world!!/%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_215": "* Hey^1!&* It's you again^1!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_216": "* Business is excellent here^1!&* These two fellas bought&  ALL my ice cream!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_217": "* I've actually sold out of&  everything!!!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_218": "* ... sorry./",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_219": "* Wait^1!&* I've still got something&  for you!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_220": "* ... a big smile^1!&* How about that!/%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_227": "* I'm so excited to sell&  Nice Cream on the surface!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_230": "* If all humans are like you^1,&  then...!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_231": "* ... then I'll still be&  able to sell to monsters^1,&  I hope./%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_234": "* If all humans are like you^1,&  I think it'll be a modest&  success!/%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_236": "* If all humans are like you^1,&  I think it'll be really&  popular!/%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_288": "* OH!!!^1!&* A CUSTOMER!!!/%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_291": "* Fortunately^1, I've thought&  of a solution!!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_292": "* Punch cards!!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_293": "* Every time you buy a&  Nice Cream^1, you can take a&  punch card from the box./",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_294": "* If you have 3 cards^1, you&  can trade them for a&  free Nice Cream!/",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_295": "* They're sure to get the&  customers to come back!/%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_296": "* Anyway.../%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_302": "* I'm having a going out of&  business sale./%%",
  "obj_nicecreamguy_320": "* You must have something better to do than read this message./%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_107": "* Oh^1?&* About that piece I gave you?/",
  "obj_nicesnowman_108": "* .../",
  "obj_nicesnowman_109": "* ... I never gave you anything./%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_120": "* Ah..^1. I can feel that piece&  of me has been well taken&  care of./",
  "obj_nicesnowman_121": "* Thank you./",
  "obj_nicesnowman_122": "* Hmmm...^1?&* The barrier's opened up?/",
  "obj_nicesnowman_123": "* Hmmm..^1.&* Then^1, if it's not too much&  to ask.../",
  "obj_nicesnowman_124": "* ... could you take that&  piece of me to the surface?/",
  "obj_nicesnowman_125": "* I would really appreciate&  it./%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_133": "* So^1, did you take that&  piece of me very far&  away...?/",
  "obj_nicesnowman_134": "* .../",
  "obj_nicesnowman_135": "* Where's the piece!?/%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_140": "* Ah^1, the barrier's open...?/",
  "obj_nicesnowman_141": "* You know I cannot move^1.&* Why are you telling me^1?&* To mock me?/",
  "obj_nicesnowman_142": "* Everyone may think you are a&  good person^1, but this snowman&  knows the truth./",
  "obj_nicesnowman_143": "* Someday^1, your friends will&  realize your heart is as&  cold as my butt./%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_155": "* (You're carrying too many&  items.)/%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_161": "* Hello^1.&* I am a snowman^1.&* I cannot move./",
  "obj_nicesnowman_162": "* Traveller^1, if you could.../",
  "obj_nicesnowman_163": "* (You got the Snowman Piece.)/%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_167": "* Oh me^1, oh my^1.&* What are you doing?/",
  "obj_nicesnowman_168": "* Soon there won't be any&  of me left.../",
  "obj_nicesnowman_169": "* (You got the Snowman Piece.)/%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_173": "* Stop..^1.&* Please.../",
  "obj_nicesnowman_174": "* (You got the Snowman Piece.)/%%",
  "obj_nicesnowman_177": "* (A useless pile of snow.)/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_112": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* oopswait how's the humnan&  doing/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_120": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* Top 10 Shows That Make You&  Forget To Do Your Frickin Job/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_142": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* OMG? ppl think Mew Mew 2&  is better than Mew Mew 1?/",
  "obj_notify_room_143": "* LOLLLLL that's a joke&  right.../%%",
  "obj_notify_room_151": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* omg... DONT THEY GET IT RUINS&  Mew Mew's ENTIRE CHARACTER ARC/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_159": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* My Mew Mew 2 Review:/",
  "obj_notify_room_160": "* Mew Mew Kissy Cutie 2 Is&  Neither Kissy Nor Cutie.&* Its Trash. 0 stars/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_178": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* that's the last time i try&  to help with a puzzle lmao/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_197": "\\YALPHYS posted a picture.\\W &* dinner with the girlfriend ;)/",
  "obj_notify_room_198": "* (It's a picture of a catgirl&  figurine next to a bowl of&  instant noodles.)/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_206": "\\YCoolSkeleton95 posted a picture.\\W &* ARE WE POSTING HOT \"PICS???\"&* HERE IS ME AND MY COOL FRIEND/",
  "obj_notify_room_207": "* (It's a picture of Papyrus&  flexing in front of a mirror.)&* (He is wearing sunglasses.)/",
  "obj_notify_room_208": "* (Giant muscular biceps are&  pasted onto his arms.)/",
  "obj_notify_room_209": "* (The biceps are also wearing&  sunglasses.)/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_217": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* LOL, CoolSkeleton95!&* ... that's a joke^1, right?/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_225": "\\YCoolSkeleton95 updated status.\\W &* THE ONLY JOKE HERE^1, IS&  HOW STRONG MY MUSCLES ARE./%%",
  "obj_notify_room_243": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* whatever!!! i'll just explain&  it!!!/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_258": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* wonder if it would be unfun&  if i explained the puzzle.../%%",
  "obj_notify_room_279": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* Oh My God i Forgot to Tell&  THem Where To Go/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_284": "\\YALPHYS posted a picture.\\W &* CUte PIC OF ME RIGHT NOW ^0.^0 /",
  "obj_notify_room_285": "* (It's a photo of a garbage can&  with several pink^1, glittery&  filters over it.)/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_307": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* OMG I DID IT!!!/",
  "obj_notify_room_308": "* claws haven't shook like that&  since undyne called me to ask&  about the weather... v.v/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_314": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* WAIT THERE'S NO WEATHER DOWN&  HERE WHY DID SHE CALL ME/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_336": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* I HATE USING THE PHONE I DON'T&  WANT TO DO THIS LMAO ^0.^0 /%%",
  "obj_notify_room_342": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* omg ive had my claw over&  the last digit for 5 minutes/",
  "obj_notify_room_343": "* omg i'm just gonna do it&* i'm just gonna call!!!!/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_372": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* gonna call them in a&  minute!!! =^0.^0=/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_378": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* for now i gotta call up the&  human and guide them =^0.^0=/%%",
  "obj_notify_room_385": "\\YALPHYS updated status.\\W &* well i know she's unbeatable&  i'll ask her abt it later ^0.^0 /%%",
