  "obj_notify_room_398": " ",
  "obj_npc_room_271": "* (It's a trash can.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_272": "* (It's full of crumpled-up&  recipes for butterscotch&  pie.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_277": "* (It's a trophy.^1)&* (Number 1 Nose-Nuzzle&  Champs '98!)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_282": "* This is an Echo Flower^1.&* It repeats the last thing&  it heard^1, over and over.../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_283": "* Neat^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_284": "* Never trust a flower..^1.&* That's one of the constants&  of this world./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_291": "* This cheese has been here so&  long^1, a magical crystal has&  grown around it./",
  "obj_npc_room_292": "* It's stuck to the table.../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_295": "* (Seems like the mouse has&  freed some of the cheese&  from the crystal somehow.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_300": "* What's a star?/",
  "obj_npc_room_301": "* Can you touch it?/",
  "obj_npc_room_302": "* Can you eat it?/",
  "obj_npc_room_303": "* Can you kill it?/",
  "obj_npc_room_304": "* .../",
  "obj_npc_room_305": "* Are you a star?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_308": "* What are you holding^1?&* Is that a star?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_313": "* We can go and see the&  real stars now.../",
  "obj_npc_room_314": "* But I still don't know&  what those are./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_319": "* One of the stars faded out./",
  "obj_npc_room_320": "* What does that mean...?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_334": "* (It's a dirty sock with a&  series of notes on it.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_335": "\\TP %",
  "obj_npc_room_336": "SANS^1!&PLEASE PICK UP YOUR SOCK!/",
  "obj_npc_room_337": "\\Ts %",
  "obj_npc_room_338": "* ok./",
  "obj_npc_room_339": "\\TP %",
  "obj_npc_room_340": "DON'T PUT IT BACK DOWN^1!&MOVE IT!/",
  "obj_npc_room_341": "\\Ts %",
  "obj_npc_room_342": "* ok./",
  "obj_npc_room_343": "\\TP %",
  "obj_npc_room_344": "YOU MOVED IT TWO INCHES^1!&MOVE IT TO YOUR ROOM!/",
  "obj_npc_room_345": "\\Ts %",
  "obj_npc_room_346": "* ok./",
  "obj_npc_room_347": "\\TP %",
  "obj_npc_room_348": "AND DON'T BRING IT BACK!/",
  "obj_npc_room_349": "\\Ts %",
  "obj_npc_room_350": "* ok./",
  "obj_npc_room_351": "\\TP %",
  "obj_npc_room_352": "IT'S STILL HERE!/",
  "obj_npc_room_353": "\\Ts %",
  "obj_npc_room_354": "* didn't you just say not&  to bring it back to my&  room?/",
  "obj_npc_room_355": "\\TP %",
  "obj_npc_room_356": "FORGET IT!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_368": "* What^1.&* What^1?&* WHAT!?/",
  "obj_npc_room_369": "* It's a living./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_372": "* So^1, you helped get us&  all free.../",
  "obj_npc_room_373": "* I guess I really acted&  like a dummy to you./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_377": "* Sorry for acting like a&  dummy before./",
  "obj_npc_room_378": "* You've really helped me&  out!!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_384": "* (It's a snail.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_385": "* (For some reason^1, you can't&  help but wonder what it&  tastes like...)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_388": "* (It's a snail.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_389": "* (You wonder if Toriel has&  seen it.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_406": "* We were hanging out&  when suddenly^1, a buncha puzzles&  reactivated out of nowhere./",
  "obj_npc_room_407": "* This is a huge problem..^1.&* It rules^1! They've GOTTA&  cancel school over this!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_409": "* Wait a second..^1.&* Auuuugh^1, it's summer vacation!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_417": "* Hey^1, did you hear^1?&* The barrier's opened up!/",
  "obj_npc_room_418": "* Now school HAS to be&  cancelled^1, right!?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_423": "* Why should we bother going&  to school^1, anyway...?/",
  "obj_npc_room_424": "* This world's got no future./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_430": "* Finally!&* Someone turned off that laser!/",
  "obj_npc_room_431": "* Now that we're free we can..^1.&* Well^1, uh^1, I guess we'll just&  keep standing here./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_434": "* Hm^1?&* Nice try^1, but your loitering&  technique still needs work./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_436": "* There will be lots of places&  to loiter on the surface^1,&  I bet./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_440": "* Loitering around..^1.&* What's the point?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_451": "* The way to work is blocked^1,&  so I had time to catch&  Mettaton's show on my phone.../",
  "obj_npc_room_452": "* The special effects were&  amazing today^1!&* That human almost looked REAL!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_454": "* Of course^1, an experienced&  viewer like me knows CGI&  when they see it.../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_458": "* The barrier's opened up^1, so&  we don't have to go to&  work today./",
  "obj_npc_room_459": "* I mean^1, sure^1, we're free^1,&  but it's the little&  things^1, you know?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_464": "* That last episode had me&  really shaken.../",
  "obj_npc_room_465": "* But Mettaton's OK^1.&* Everyone knows it's just CGI!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_470": "* Mettaton^1?&* Yeah^1, he's the most popular&  star in the underground!/",
  "obj_npc_room_471": "* His fan club probably has&  at least two..^1. no^1, THREE&  dozen members!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_474": "* And that's not even counting&  me!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_478": "* Today^1, we all started as&  co-workers.../",
  "obj_npc_room_479": "* Who knows what we'll be&  tomorrow?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_484": "* What a heartbreaker./",
  "obj_npc_room_485": "* I bet his fanclub's almost&  doubled in size from that!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_508": "* (There's a piece of cheese&  inside this computerized&  laser-safe.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_509": "* (The lasers have melted the&  edges of the cheese..^1.)&* (It's stuck to the table.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_513": "* (Seems like the mouse hacked&  the safe and took the&  cheese out.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_523": "* It's so nice to&  have you over!/",
  "obj_npc_room_524": "* Why not take a&  seat at the&  table?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_527": "* Sit at the freakin'&  table^1, you little&  nerd./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_534": "* I..^1. I..^1. I ended up buying a&  donut.../",
  "obj_npc_room_535": "* I..^1. I..^1. I didn't want to^1, but&  that girl..^1. even though I told&  her no^1, she.../",
  "obj_npc_room_536": "* ... kept staring at me in this&  creepy way and licking her&  lips./",
  "obj_npc_room_537": "* N..^1. now I'm outta cash./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_540": "* Maybe I can sell it online&  and double my money back.../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_545": "* On the surface^1, I won't&  buy any donuts from&  spiders./",
  "obj_npc_room_546": "* That's my resolution./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_551": "* .../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_568": "* (It's just a regular flower.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_580": "* .../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_582": "* ... what?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_588": "* (It's an empty dog food&  bowl.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_593": "* (It's a treadmill.^1)&* (There's a message attached.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_594": "* \"the truth is that you got&  owned^1, nerd......\"/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_599": "* (... he seems happy.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_604": "* Sn..^1. ow..^1. y.../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_615": "\\E0* There you are^1,&  Frisk-darling./",
  "obj_npc_room_616": "\\E8* Feast your eyes^1!&* Dr. Alphys completed&  my wonderful new body./",
  "obj_npc_room_617": "\\E7* Oooh^1!&* And did you hear^1?&* The barrier's OPEN!/",
  "obj_npc_room_618": "\\E4* I can't wait to see&  the sun.../",
  "obj_npc_room_619": "\\E5* ... the greatest&  spotlight of all!!/",
  "obj_npc_room_620": "\\E9* Oh yes^1.&* I suppose I should thank&  you^1, too^1, darling./",
  "obj_npc_room_621": "\\E2* Before fighting you^1,&  I had.../",
  "obj_npc_room_622": "\\E4* Forgotten how fun it&  was to perform with&  others./",
  "obj_npc_room_623": "\\E6* So I've been searching&  for HOT TALENTS to fill&  up my upcoming troupe./",
  "obj_npc_room_624": "\\E0* So far^1, Shyren's agreed&  to be my back-up singer./",
  "obj_npc_room_625": "\\E0* And Bl..^1.&* Napstablook^1, here^1, will&  be my sound mixer!/",
  "obj_npc_room_626": "\\E2* The three of us&  performing together.../",
  "obj_npc_room_627": "\\E4* It really feels overdue^1,&  doesn't it?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_631": "\\E0* Frisk^1, darling^1.&* Can you help me with&  something?/",
  "obj_npc_room_632": "\\E2* What kind of merchandise&  do you think humans&  would want to buy...?/",
  "obj_npc_room_633": "\\E1* I've thought of a few&  ideas so far./",
  "obj_npc_room_634": "\\E6* Buttons (with my face)&* Stickers (with my face)&* CDs (with my face)/",
  "obj_npc_room_635": "\\E7* Posters (with my face)&* T-shirts (with my face)&* Underwear (with my face)/",
  "obj_npc_room_636": "\\E9* ... and plush dolls of&  TORIEL./",
  "obj_npc_room_638": "\\E8* But, you know^1.&* With my face instead&  of hers./",
  "obj_npc_room_640": "\\E0* So what do you think?/",
  "obj_npc_room_641": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_npc_room_642": "* (...)/",
  "obj_npc_room_644": "* (A yes or no prompt was not&  provided.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_645": "\\TS \\F8 \\TM %",
  "obj_npc_room_646": "\\E9* Fabulous^1!&* I completely agree!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_651": "\\E2* Oh^1, Frisk^1.&* Why don't you go see&  how Alphys is doing?/",
  "obj_npc_room_652": "\\E1* Since the flash of light&  she's been working hard&  to set everything right./",
  "obj_npc_room_653": "\\E0* Ha-Ha^1.&* About time^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_662": "* (By barking with text-to-speech&  on^1, the dog accidentally&  programmed a whole game.)/",
  "obj_npc_room_663": "* (Hmmm..^1. seems fine.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_669": "* Blub blub..^1.&* You'll have to reserve a&  table to eat here./",
  "obj_npc_room_670": "* You'll also need to reserve&  your chair^1, your silverware^1,&  your food^1, your.../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_674": "* Blub blub..^1.&* Now we can live life&  without reservations./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_679": "* Blub blub..^1.&* Mettaton isn't here to press&  his face into the steaks./",
  "obj_npc_room_680": "* He told me that if he ever&  disappeared^1, we could use&  my face instead.../",
  "obj_npc_room_681": "* But^1, I'm nervous^1.&* What if my face doesn't&  taste very good...?/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_686": "* As I came in^1, I realized I&  forgot to make a reservation./",
  "obj_npc_room_687": "* But I didn't want to look&  like I messed up^1.&* So I kept walkin' in anyway./",
  "obj_npc_room_688": "* Now I'm just..^1. kinda..^1.&* Consuming dew off this ficus./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_692": "* Oh^1, we're all free?/",
  "obj_npc_room_693": "* Oh..^1.&* Guess I can..^1.&* Stop lickin' this ficus./",
  "obj_npc_room_694": "* ... but I don't want to look&  like I messed up^1, so&  I'll keep going.../%%",
  "obj_npc_room_699": "* What would Mettaton think if&  he saw me licking this&  plant of his...?/",
  "obj_npc_room_700": "* Eh..^1. who cares./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_709": "* I work at the CORE^1.&* The inside is a maze made of&  swappable parts.../",
  "obj_npc_room_710": "* That means we can shuffle the&  layout at will./",
  "obj_npc_room_711": "* Boy^1, was today a FUN day^1!&* I sure love PUZZLE!!!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_715": "* So^1, if we're leaving^1, will&  my job...?/",
  "obj_npc_room_716": "* Ugh^1, and I just got a raise^1!&* Well^1, guess every apple has&  its CORE^1, heheh./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_721": "* Today^1, we received the&  promise of a lot of money&  from a strange source./",
  "obj_npc_room_722": "* It may not be kosher^1, but..^1.&* Whew^1! I love puzzle!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_728": "* Originally^1, we dug mazes&  with puzzles in order to&  foil human attacks./",
  "obj_npc_room_729": "* But now^1, building things&  winding and confusing...^1.&* It's some awful tradition./",
  "obj_npc_room_730": "* You can't go (ugh) two feet&  without being up to your&  armpits in puzzles./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_734": "* The surface world..^1.&* Really!/",
  "obj_npc_room_735": "* Maybe I'll be able to&  go two feet without running&  into a puzzle./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_740": "* One thing I can say.../",
  "obj_npc_room_741": "* I respect Mettaton for not&  putting any puzzles here./",
  "obj_npc_room_742": "* At another hotel^1, I had&  to find 12 magic keys just to&  unlock the shower./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_751": "* Mettaton looked really..^1.&* Really cool in that dress./",
  "obj_npc_room_752": "* It sort of makes me feel like&  I could wear one^1, too!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_756": "* Mettaton..^1.!&* He recognized my voice from&  when I called in^1, and.../",
  "obj_npc_room_757": "* He..^1. he gave me his dress^1!&* I'm so...^1!&* Ha ha ha!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_762": "* Please don't talk to me^1.&* I am feeling discouraged&  about something./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_769": "* Welcome to MTT Resort - &* Hotland's biggest apartment-&  building-turned-hotel!/",
  "obj_npc_room_770": "* Whether you're here for a night&  or still live here^1, MTT Resort&  prides itself on a great stay!/",
  "obj_npc_room_771": "* Just passing through...^1? Nice^1!&* MTT Resort prides itself on&  being passed through!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_775": "* Sorry - the resort's shutting&  down./",
  "obj_npc_room_776": "* But I think you'll find it's&  still great to pass through!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_781": "* Welcome to MTT Resort^1!&* Have you seen Mettaton?/",
  "obj_npc_room_782": "* He hasn't come by lately^1.&* I have a lot of respect for&  that man./",
  "obj_npc_room_783": "* I had trouble getting a job&  because I am so pointy and&  angular./",
  "obj_npc_room_784": "* But^1, being a rectangle^1, he&  understood my struggles./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_792": "* I love hot dogs!/",
  "obj_npc_room_793": "* Hey..^1.&* Isn't it weird there's&  SNOW on that guy's roof?/",
  "obj_npc_room_794": "* ... guess he's just too lazy&  to clean it off./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_798": "* I love hot dogs!/",
  "obj_npc_room_799": "* But the hot dog guy left..^1.&* Even though all of his&  stuff is still here./",
  "obj_npc_room_800": "* ... guess he's just too lazy&  to clean it away./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_805": "* I wanted another hot dog^1.&* But the hot dog guy never&  came back./",
  "obj_npc_room_806": "* Besides that^1?&* Today was fine./",
  "obj_npc_room_807": "* Count your blessings^1.&* Even if you don't get a&  second hot dog./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_812": "* Toasty bun!/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_817": "* (It's hard-boiled.)/%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_181": "* Hey..^1. there..^1.&* Noticed you were..^1.&* Here.../",
  "obj_onionsan_event_182": "\\M1* I'm Onionsan^1!&* Onionsan^1, y'hear!/%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_211": "\\M1* You're visiting Waterfall^1, huh^1!* It's great here^1, huh^1!&* You love it^1, huh!/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_212": "\\M0* Yeah^1!&* Me too^1!&* It's my Big Favorite./%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_224": "\\M3* Even though^1, the water's&  getting so shallow here..^1./",
  "obj_onionsan_event_225": "* I^1, have to sit down all&  the time^1, but.../",
  "obj_onionsan_event_226": "\\M1* He^1-hey^1! That's OK^1!&* It beats moving to the city!/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_227": "* And living in a crowded&  aquarium!/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_228": "\\M2* Like all my friends did!/%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_241": "\\M3* And the aquarium's full^1,&  a-anyway^1, so^1, even if I&  wanted to^1, I.../",
  "obj_onionsan_event_242": "\\M1* That's okay though^1, y'hear!&* Undyne's gonna fix&  everything^1, y'hear!/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_243": "* I'm gonna get out of here&  and live in the ocean^1!&* Y'hear!/%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_256": "\\M2* Hey..^1. there..^1.&* That's the end of this room./",
  "obj_onionsan_event_257": "* I'll see you around^1!&* Have a good time!/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_258": "* In Waterfalllllllllllllllll&  lllllllllllll/%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_312": "\\M1* Oh^1!&* Did y'hear!!!/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_313": "\\M1* .../",
  "obj_onionsan_event_314": "\\M1* I got nothing else..^1.&* To talk about.../%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_317": "\\M2* I've been wondering when&  we're all gonna go free./",
  "obj_onionsan_event_318": "\\M3* S-since..^1. if we did..^1.&* How would I ever know?/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_319": "\\M1* Well^1, I'll keep my&  tentacles out for you^1!&* Y'hear!/",
  "obj_onionsan_event_320": "* As soon as I know I'll be&  the first to tell you^1!&* Y'hear!!/%%",
  "obj_onionsan_event_337": "\\M0* It's gotta be any day now!/%%",
  "obj_operatingtable_64": "* (It's some kind of operating&  table.)/",
  "obj_operatingtable_65": "* (It's sticky...)/%%",
  "obj_otherphonecall_100": "* (Ring... ring...)/%%",
  "obj_otherphonecall_115": "* U-uhhh..^1.&* (Oh my god^1, help...)/",
  "obj_otherphonecall_116": "* I'd like to order a..^1.&* Um..^1.&* A pizza...?/",
  "obj_otherphonecall_117": "* With^1, uhh..^1.&* The toppings are^1, uh.../",
  "obj_otherphonecall_118": "* I have them copied^1, I'll&  just paste them to you./",
  "obj_otherphonecall_119": "\\T0 %",
  "obj_otherphonecall_120": "* (Your phone is too old to&  receive texts...)/",
  "obj_otherphonecall_121": "* (It reads out loud^1, character-&  by-character^1, an ASCII art&  of an anime catgirl.)/",
  "obj_otherphonecall_122": "\\TA* .../%%",
  "obj_otherphonecall_133": "* (Click...)/%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_158": "\\E0* welp./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_159": "\\E1* someone's gotta keep&  him from getting&  into trouble./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_160": "\\E2* see you guys./%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_183": "\\E0* Man^1, do I have&  to do EVERYTHING?/",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_184": "\\E6* Papyrus^1, wait!!!/%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_219": "\\E0* Hey^1, Undyne!^1!&* Wait up!!/%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_255": "* Whoops./%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_273": "* Uh^1, should I do&  something?/",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_275": "* .../",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_277": "* Well^1, gotta go!/%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_309": "* It seems that everyone&  is quite eager to&  set off./%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_344": "* What?/",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_345": "\\E1* Frisk.../",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_346": "\\E0* You really are a&  funny child./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_347": "\\E1* If you had said that&  earlier^1, none of this&  would have happened./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_348": "\\E0* It is a good thing&  you took so long to&  change your mind./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_349": "* Hee hee hee./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_350": "* Well..^1.&* I suppose./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_351": "* If you really do&  not have any other&  place to go.../",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_352": "* I will do my best to&  take care of you^1, for&  as long as you need./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_353": "* All right?/",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_354": "* Now^1, come along./%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_372": "* Everyone is waiting&  for us!/%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_413": "\\E1* Ah./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_414": "\\E0* ... I see./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_415": "\\E1* .../",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_416": "\\E0* Well^1, I hope that&  I am not keeping&  you./%%",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_478": "* Frisk./",
  "obj_outsideworld_event_479": "* \"See you around.\"/%%",
  "obj_papbookshelf_63": "THAT BOOK'S ONE&OF MY&FAVORITES./",
  "obj_papbookshelf_64": "\"ADVANCED PUZZLE&CONSTRUCTION FOR&CRITICAL MINDS.\"/",
  "obj_papbookshelf_66": "THAT NEXT BOOK'S&ANOTHER ONE OF&MY FAVORITES./",
  "obj_papbookshelf_67": "\"PEEK-A-BOO WITH&FLUFFY BUNNY.\"/",
  "obj_papbookshelf_68": "\\E3THE ENDING&ALWAYS GETS ME./%%",
  "obj_papbookshelf_71": "* (Complex manuals and&  children's books.)/%%",
  "obj_papbookshelf_76": "* (The bookshelf is filled&  with complex tomes&  about puzzle creation.)/",
  "obj_papbookshelf_77": "* (And children's books.)/%%",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_98": "* There's some narration on this&  cardboard box./",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_99": "\\TP %",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_100": "YOU OBSERVE THE&WELL-CRAFTED&SENTRY STATION./",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_101": "WHO COULD HAVE&BUILT THIS^1, YOU&PONDER.../",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_102": "I BET IT WAS&THAT VERY FAMOUS&ROYAL GUARDSMAN!/",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_103": "(NOTE: NOT YET A&VERY FAMOUS&ROYAL GUARDSMAN^1.)/%%",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_107": "(NOTE: NOT YET A&VERY FAMOUS&ROYAL GUARDSMAN^1.)/",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_108": "(UPDATE: AM I A&ROYAL GUARDSMAN&YET???)/%%",
  "obj_papcheckpoint_112": "* These instructions&  are written in&  chicken scratch./%%",
  "obj_papcomputer_63": "THE INTERNET^1!&I'M QUITE&POPULAR THERE./",
  "obj_papcomputer_64": "I'M JUST A&DOZEN AWAY.../",
  "obj_papcomputer_65": "FROM A DOUBLE&DIGIT FOLLOWER&COUNT!/",
  "obj_papcomputer_66": "\\E3OF COURSE^1, FAME&HAS A STEEP&PRICE./",
  "obj_papcomputer_67": "\\E1A JEALOUS TROLL&HAS BESIEGED MY&ONLINE PERSONA./",
  "obj_papcomputer_68": "ALWAYS SENDING&ME BAD PUNS IN&A GOOFY FONT.../%%/",
  "obj_papcomputer_73": "* (The computer's internet&  browser is opened to&  a social media site.)/%%",
  "obj_papcomputer_79": "* (The computer's internet&  browser is opened to&  a social media site.)/%%",
  "obj_papcomputer_84": "* (The computer's internet&  browser is opened to&  a music-sharing forum.)/%%",
  "obj_papcomputer_90": "* (Looks like this dog makes&  a lot of bad posts&  on-line.)/",
  "obj_papcomputer_91": "* (Text to speech is on.)/",
  "obj_papcomputer_92": "* (Seems like the dog barks^1,&  and it translates to these&  bad posts.)/",
  "obj_papcomputer_93": "* (It doesn't really know what&  it's saying.)/",
  "obj_papcomputer_94": "* (Seems like most bad posts&  on-line^1, are actually this&  dog.)/",
  "obj_papcomputer_95": "* (Thinking about this...^1)&* (Brings you relief.)/%%",
