  "obj_papdate_332": "FORTUNATELY^1, IT&ONLY SAYS TO&ASK!!!/",
  "obj_papdate_334": "\\E0I GUESS THAT&MEANS IT'S&TIME FOR PART&THREE!!!/",
  "obj_papdate_335": "\\F4 \\E8 %",
  "obj_papdate_336": "\"STEP THREE..^1.&PUT ON NICE&CLOTHES TO&SHOW YOU CARE!\"/",
