  "obj_papdate_460": "YOU'RE WAY BETTER&AT HANGING OUT&THAN I AM!!!/",
  "obj_papdate_461": "\\XN\\E6-NOOOO!!!&YOUR \\BFRIENDSHIP&POWER\\X!!!/%%",
  "obj_papdate_465": "\\E3DESPITE THAT^1, YOU&CHOSE TO WEAR&CLOTHING TODAY^1, OF&ALL DAYS...?/",
