  "obj_phonecall_room_290": "* Ring.../%%",
  "obj_phonecall_room_302": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_303": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_phonecall_room_304": "* Hi^1, Alphys here!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_305": "* This room is like&  the room we saw&  before./",
  "obj_phonecall_room_306": "* There are two puzzles&  to the north and&  south.../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_307": "* You'll have to solve&  them both to proceed!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_308": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_309": "\\E0* A-also... I'd like&  to say!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_310": "\\E3* I don't really...&* Like giving away&  puzzle solutions./",
  "obj_phonecall_room_311": "\\E6* But if you need&  help^1, just call&  me^1, ok?/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_312": "\\E3* Actually^1, wait^1, I&  have an idea!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_313": "\\E0* Let's be friends&  on UnderNet!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_314": "\\E7* Then you can just&  ping me when you&  need help!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_315": "\\E0* .../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_316": "\\E4* Wait^1, we're already&  friends^1, aren't we?/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_317": "\\E5* I signed you up^1,&  didn't I?/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_318": "\\E5* You've been reading&  my posts the whole&  time.../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_319": "\\E6* Well^1! I hope^1!&  You agree with me^1!&* About Mew Mew 2!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_320": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_phonecall_room_321": "* Click.../%%",
  "obj_phonecall_room_353": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_354": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_phonecall_room_355": "* Uh^1, h-h-hey!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_356": "\\E0* I'm going to the&  bathroom^1, so I'll&  be MIA for a bit./",
  "obj_phonecall_room_357": "* I'm..^1. I'm sure you&  can handle this&  puzzle yourself!/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_358": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_phonecall_room_359": "* Click.../%%",
  "obj_phonecall_room_372": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_373": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_phonecall_room_374": "* S-see that building in&  the distance?/",
  "obj_phonecall_room_375": "\\E0* That's the CORE^1.&* The source of all power&  for the underground./",
  "obj_phonecall_room_376": "\\E6* It converts geothermal&  energy into magical&  electricity^1, by.../",
  "obj_phonecall_room_377": "\\E3* Uhh^1, anyway^1, that's&  where we're going to&  go./",
  "obj_phonecall_room_378": "\\E0* In the CORE is an&  elevator directly to&  ASGORE's castle./",
  "obj_phonecall_room_379": "\\E0* And from there..^1.&* You can go home./",
