  "obj_readable_room1_200": "* When monsters get old and&  kick the bucket^1, they turn&  into dust./",
  "obj_readable_room1_201": "* At funerals^1, we take that&  dust and spread it on that&  person's favorite thing./",
  "obj_readable_room1_202": "* Then their essence will live&  on in that thing.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_203": "* Uhhh^1, am I at the page&  minimum yet^1?&* I'm kinda sick of writing this./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_208": "\\W* Mom says that sleeping&  can recover your health&  \\Yabove your maximum HP\\W./",
  "obj_readable_room1_209": "* ... what's maximum HP?/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_213": "* Mom says that we can&  go to the surface world&  now!/",
  "obj_readable_room1_214": "* ... what's so great about&  that^1, anyway^1?&* I don't wanna move./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_219": "* (It's merely a decoy.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_228": "* \"The power to take their&  SOULs.\"/",
  "obj_readable_room1_229": "* \"This is the power that&  the humans feared.\"/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_235": "* (Ancient writing covers the&  walls..^1. you can just make&  out the words.)/",
  "obj_readable_room1_236": "* \"The War of Humans and&  Monsters.\"/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_241": "* The northern room hides a&  great treasure./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_247": "* Hurt, beaten, and fearful for&  our lives, we surrendered&  to the humans./",
  "obj_readable_room1_248": "* Seven of their greatest&  magicians sealed us underground&  with a magic spell./",
  "obj_readable_room1_249": "* Anything can enter through the&  seal, but only beings with a&  powerful SOUL can leave./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_256": "* However...&* There is a prophecy./",
  "obj_readable_room1_257": "* The Angel...&* The One Who Has Seen The&  Surface.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_258": "* They will return.&* And the underground will go&  empty./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_263": "* The ancient glyphs have been&  painted over with a list of&  21 different flavors./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_269": "* Achoo^1!&* Tried to catch a bug^1, but&  I just caught a cold.../%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_274": "* The humans, afraid of our&  power^1, declared war on us./",
  "obj_readable_room1_275": "* They attacked suddenly, and&  without mercy./%%",
