  "obj_readable_room1_320": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_321": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_readable_room1_322": "* Um^1, is it really&  a good idea to be&  getting a snack?/",
  "obj_readable_room1_323": "\\E8* Well^1, I guess I&  really shouldn't&  judge you.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_324": "\\E0* After all^1, I'm the&  one eating potato&  chips in my PJs!/",
  "obj_readable_room1_325": "\\E5* Uhhh^1, I mean..^1.&* H-hey^1, go over to&  the right!/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_328": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_329": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_readable_room1_330": "* H-hey^1!&* Head over to the&  right!/%%",
