  "obj_readable_room2_295": "* Why did the humans attack^1?&* Indeed^1, it seemed that they&  had nothing to fear./",
  "obj_readable_room2_296": "* Humans are unbelievably strong.&* It would take the SOUL of&  nearly every monster.../",
  "obj_readable_room2_297": "* ... just to equal the power&  of a single human SOUL./%%",
  "obj_readable_room2_302": "* This power has no counter.&* Indeed, a human cannot&  take a monster's SOUL./",
  "obj_readable_room2_303": "* When a monster dies, its&  SOUL disappears./",
  "obj_readable_room2_304": "* And an incredible power&  would be needed to take the&  SOUL of a living monster./%%",
  "obj_readable_room2_310": "* There is only one way to&  reverse this spell./",
  "obj_readable_room2_311": "* If a huge power, equivalent&  to seven human SOULs, attacks&  the barrier.../",
  "obj_readable_room2_312": "* It will be destroyed./%%",
  "obj_readable_room2_318": "* In the end, it could&  hardly be called a war./",
  "obj_readable_room2_319": "* United, the humans were too&  powerful, and us monsters,&  too weak./",
  "obj_readable_room2_320": "* Not a single SOUL was taken,&  and countless monsters were&  turned to dust.../%%",
