  "obj_readable_room3_176": "IT ALWAYS REMINDS&ME OF WHAT'S&IMPORTANT IN LIFE./%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_180": "* (It's a painting of a&  cartoon bone.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_195": "* (Whenever the girl moves her&  net^1, this bug scurries straight&  into it.)/%%",
