  "obj_readable_room3_248": "* What^1?&* I'm not gonna&  serenade you./%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_254": "* ENTRY NUMBER 3/",
  "obj_readable_room3_255": "* But extracting a SOUL from&  a living monster would&  require incredible power.../",
  "obj_readable_room3_256": "* Besides being impractical^1,&  doing so would instantly&  destroy the SOUL's host./",
  "obj_readable_room3_257": "* And^1, unlike the persistent&  SOULs of humans.../",
  "obj_readable_room3_258": "* The SOULs of most monsters&  disappear immediately upon&  death./",
  "obj_readable_room3_259": "* If only I could make a&  monster's SOUL last.../%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_261": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
