  "obj_readable_room4_110": "* (It's a king-sized bed.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_114": "* \"MONSTER HISTORY PART 4\"/",
  "obj_readable_room4_116": "* Fearing the humans no longer^1,&  we moved out of our old&  city^1, HOME./",
  "obj_readable_room4_117": "* We braved harsh cold^1, damp&  swampland^1, and searing heat.../",
  "obj_readable_room4_118": "* Until we reached what we now&  call our capital./",
  "obj_readable_room4_119": "* \"NEW HOME.\"/",
  "obj_readable_room4_120": "* Again^1, our King is really&  bad at names...?/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_126": "* Excuse me..^1.&* Yes^1, you^1, with the striped&  shirt./",
  "obj_readable_room4_127": "* Can you do something about&  your friend...?/",
  "obj_readable_room4_128": "* Yes^1, your friend..^1.&* The one behind you^1, with the&  creepy smile./%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_131": "* Hmmm^1?&* Where'd your friend go?/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_139": "* If a monster defeats a human^1,&  they can take its SOUL./",
  "obj_readable_room4_140": "* A monster with a human SOUL..^1.&* A horrible beast with&  unfathomable power./%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_145": "* (It's a video feed of your&  location.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_146": "* It's you...?/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_147": "* It's me^1, \\[C]./%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_159": "* (It's a microwave.^1)&* (That's great if you're a&  microwave fan.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_161": "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_168": "* MTT-BRAND MICROWAVE^1!&* ORIGIN OF THE MTT CHALLENGE!/",
  "obj_readable_room4_169": "* PUT YOUR FOOD IN AND SET&  THE MICROWAVE ON HIGH FOR&  FIVE MINUTES.../",
  "obj_readable_room4_170": "* IF YOU CAN STILL RECOGNIZE&  YOUR MEAL^1, WE'LL DOUBLE YOUR&  MONEY BACK!!!/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_174": "* STILL FIDDLING WITH THAT&  MICROWAVE, EH, DARLING?/",
  "obj_readable_room4_175": "* CAN'T BLAME YOU FOR BEING&  TOTALLY ENAMORED WITH AN&  ELECTRONIC BOX./%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_182": "* (In the sink is a teacup&  in the shape of a fish.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room4_193": "* ENTRY NUMBER 5/",
  "obj_readable_room4_194": "* I've done it./",
  "obj_readable_room4_195": "* Using the blueprints^1, I've&  extracted it from the&  human SOULs./",
  "obj_readable_room4_196": "* I believe this is what&  gives their SOULs the strength&  to persist after death./",
  "obj_readable_room4_197": "* The will to keep living..^1.&* The resolve to change fate./",
