  "obj_sans_friendc_86": "\\E0THIS REALLY PUTS&OUR RELATIONSHIP&IN A NEW LIGHT./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_88": "\\E1* hey^1, tori^1, do you&  have any other&  embarrassing stories?/",
