  "obj_sans_friendc_107": "\\E0* It took a couple&  minutes./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_109": "\\E0* frisk..^1.&* i gotta tell ya./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_110": "\\E2* that's^1, uh^1, not the&  best way to get&  to know someone./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_112": "\\E3IT'S NOT???/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_114": "\\E9* Papyrus^1, we've been&  over this./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_116": "\\E4WHATEVER^1, MOM!!!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_118": "\\E1* Don't talk back to&  me like that!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_119": "\\E6* Go to your room^1,&  Papyrus!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_121": "\\E5OK^1, UNDYNE./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_123": "\\E1* Wait^1!&* Don't ACTUALLY go&  to your room!!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_125": "\\E7I'M GETTING MIXED&  MESSAGES HERE!!!/%%",
  "obj_sans_friendc_131": "\\E0* frisk^1, tori was telling&  me how she made&  b'scotch pie for you./",
