  "obj_sansb_335": "\\E1you^1, uh^1, really&like swinging that&thing around^1,&huh?/",
  "obj_sansb_336": "\\E0.../",
  "obj_sansb_337": "\\E4listen./",
  "obj_sansb_338": "i know you didn't&answer me before^1,&but.../",
  "obj_sansb_339": "\\E4somewhere in&there^1.&i can feel it./",
  "obj_sansb_340": "\\E0there's a glimmer&of a good person&inside of you./",
  "obj_sansb_341": "\\E4the memory of&someone who once&wanted to do the&right thing./",
  "obj_sansb_342": "\\E1someone who^1, in&another time^1,&might have even&been.../",
  "obj_sansb_343": "\\E4a friend?/",
  "obj_sansb_344": "\\E3c'mon^1, buddy./",
  "obj_sansb_345": "\\E0do you remember&me?/",
  "obj_sansb_346": "\\E4please^1, if you're&listening.../",
  "obj_sansb_347": "\\E9let's forget all&this^1, ok?/",
  "obj_sansb_348": "\\E3just lay down&your weapon^1, and.../",
