  "obj_sansb_353": "\\E9ugh..^1.&that being said.../",
  "obj_sansb_354": "\\E1you^1, uh^1, really&like swinging that&thing around^1,&huh?/",
  "obj_sansb_355": "\\E0.../",
  "obj_sansb_356": "\\E4listen./",
  "obj_sansb_357": "friendship.../",
  "obj_sansb_358": "\\E3it's really great^1,&right?/",
  "obj_sansb_359": "let's quit fighting./%%",
  "obj_sansb_380": "\\E3welp^1, it was&worth a shot./",
  "obj_sansb_381": "\\E5guess you like&doing things the&hard way^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_384": "\\E3woah^1, you look&REALLY pissed off.../",
  "obj_sansb_385": "\\E4heheheh.../",
  "obj_sansb_386": "\\E5did i getcha?/",
  "obj_sansb_387": "\\E4well^1, if you came&back anyway.../",
  "obj_sansb_388": "\\E1i guess that means&we never really&WERE friends^1, huh?/",
  "obj_sansb_389": "\\E4heh./",
  "obj_sansb_390": "\\E9don't tell that&to the other&sans-es^1, ok?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_398": "\\E4sounds strange^1, but&before all this i&was secretly hoping&we could be friends./",
  "obj_sansb_399": "\\E1i always thought the&anomaly was doing&this cause they&were unhappy./",
  "obj_sansb_400": "and when they got&what they wanted^1,&they would stop&all this./%%",
  "obj_sansb_405": "\\E3and maybe all they&needed was..^1.&i dunno./",
  "obj_sansb_406": "\\M1some good food^1,&some bad laughs^1,&some nice friends./%%",
  "obj_sansb_411": "\\E4but that's&ridiculous^1,&right?/",
  "obj_sansb_412": "\\E5yeah^1, you're the&type of person&who won't EVER&be happy./%%",
  "obj_sansb_417": "\\E5you'll keep&consuming timelines&over and over^1,&until.../",
  "obj_sansb_418": "\\E4well./",
  "obj_sansb_419": "\\M1hey./",
  "obj_sansb_420": "\\E3take it from me^1,&kid./",
  "obj_sansb_421": "someday.../",
  "obj_sansb_422": "you gotta learn&when to QUIT./%%",
  "obj_sansb_423": "%%%",
  "obj_sansb_427": "\\E3and that day's&TODAY./%%",
  "obj_sansb_433": "\\E4cause..^1.&y'see../",
  "obj_sansb_434": "\\E1all this fighting&is really tiring&me out./%%",
  "obj_sansb_441": "\\E4and if you keep&pushing me.../",
  "obj_sansb_442": "\\Xt\\E3hen i'll be&forced to use my\\R &special attack\\X./%%",
