  "obj_sansb_450": "\\E3so^1, if you don't&wanna see it^1, now&would be a good&time to die./%%",
  "obj_sansb_456": "\\E4well^1, here goes&nothing.../",
  "obj_sansb_457": "\\E3are you ready?/",
  "obj_sansb_458": "\\Xs\\E5urvive THIS^1, and&i'll show you my\\R &special attack\\X!/%%",
