  "obj_shyren_283": "%%%",
  "obj_shyren_470": "* Shyren hums very faintly.",
  "obj_shyren_471": "* Shyren pretends to be a&  pop idol.",
  "obj_shyren_472": "* Shyren taps a little beat&  with her fins.",
  "obj_shyren_473": "* Shyren thinks about doing&  karaoke by herself.",
  "obj_shyren_474": "* Smells like music.",
  "obj_shyren_475": "* Shyren's voice gets raspy.",
  "obj_shyren_476": "* Shyren seems much more&  comfortable singing along.",
  "obj_shyren_479": "* Sans is selling tickets&  made of toilet paper.",
  "obj_shyren_480": "* A hooded figure watches&  the commotion from afar.",
  "obj_shyren_482": "* The crowd tosses clothing^1.&* It's a storm of socks.",
  "obj_shyren_483": "* Shyren thinks about her&  future.",
  "obj_shyren_502": "* SHYREN - ATK 19 DEF 0&* Tone deaf^1. She's too ashamed&  to sing her deadly song./^",
  "obj_shyren_503": "* SHYREN - ATK 19 DEF 0&* A talented singer^1, with&  a little help./^",
  "obj_shyren_504": "* SHYREN - ATK 19 DEF 0&* That's Shyren^1.&* She's your band-mate./^",
  "obj_shyren_514": "* You hum a funky tune^1.&* Shyren follows your melody./^",
  "obj_shyren_515": "* You hum a sad song^1.&* Shyren follows your melody./^",
  "obj_shyren_516": "* You hum a jazz ballad^1.&* Shyren follows your melody./^",
  "obj_shyren_517": "* You hum some more^1.&* Monsters are drawn to the&  music./",
  "obj_shyren_518": "* Suddenly^1, it's a concert.../^",
  "obj_shyren_519": "* You hum some more^1.&* The seats are sold out^1.&* You feel like a rock star./^",
  "obj_shyren_520": "* You hum some more^1.&* But the constant attention.../",
  "obj_shyren_521": "* The tours..^1.&* The groupies..^1.&* It's all.../^",
  "obj_shyren_522": "* You and Shyren have come so&  far^1, but it's time./",
  "obj_shyren_523": "* You both have your own&  journeys to embark on./",
  "obj_shyren_524": "* You hum a farewell song./^",
  "obj_shyren_537": "* You smile^1.&* You ask to see Shyren's smile^1,&  too./",
  "obj_shyren_538": "* Shyren gets quieter^1.&* In the corner^1, Aaron nods&  his head approvingly./^",
  "obj_shyren_539": "* You keep smiling^1.&* But nothing happened./^",
  "obj_shyren_540": "* You give a darling smile and&  a little wink./",
  "obj_shyren_541": "* The crowd goes wild!/^",
  "obj_shyren_550": "* You wave your arms wildly^1.&* You are now vulnerable&  to electric attacks./^",
  "obj_shyren_551": "* You wave your arms wildly^1.&* The crowd eats it up./^",
  "obj_shyrenstrewn_60": "* It's a mixture of socks^1,&  fanmail^1, and toilet paper./%%",
  "obj_shyrenstrewn_61": "* There's a conspicuous&  lack of anything on the&  ground./%%",
