  "obj_womandog_473": "* The Dogs are re-evaluating&  your smell.",
  "obj_womandog_474": "* The Dogs are practicing for&  the next couples contest.",
  "obj_womandog_475": "* The Dogs are saying sickly&  sweet things to each other.",
  "obj_womandog_476": "* The Dogs may want to&  re-smell you.",
  "obj_womandog_477": "* The Dogs think that you&  may be a lost puppy.",
  "obj_womandog_478": "* Every dog loves to play&  fetch!!!",
  "obj_womandog_479": "* The Dogs' minds have been&  expanded.",
  "obj_womandog_480": "* The Dogaressa is on the&  warpath.",
  "obj_womandog_496": "* DOGARESSA - ATK 14 DEF 5&* This puppy finds her&  hubby lovely^1. SMELLS ONLY?/^",
