  "mettquiz_q1_text": "What's the prize#for answering#correctly?",
  "mettquiz_q1_a1": "Money",
  "mettquiz_q1_a2": "Mercy",
  "mettquiz_q1_a3": "New car",
  "mettquiz_q1_a4": "More questions",
  "mettquiz_q2_text": "What's the king's#full name?",
  "mettquiz_q2_a1": "Lord Fluffybuns",
  "mettquiz_q2_a2": "Fuzzy Pushover",
  "mettquiz_q2_a3": "Asgore Dreemurr",
  "mettquiz_q2_a4": "Dr. Friendship",
  "mettquiz_q3_text": "What are robots#made of?",
  "mettquiz_q3_a1": "Hopes&Dreams",
  "mettquiz_q3_a2": "Metal&Magic",
  "mettquiz_q3_a3": "Snips&Snails",
  "mettquiz_q3_a4": "Sugar&Spice",
  "mettquiz_q4_text": "Two trains, Train A and Train B,#simultaneously depart Station A#and Station B.#Station A and Station B are 252.5 miles#apart from each other.#Train A is moving at 124.7mph towards#Station B, and Train B is moving at#253.5mph towards station A.#If both trains departed at 10:00AM and it#is now 10:08, how much longer until#both trains pass each other?",
  "mettquiz_q4_a1": "31.054 minutes",
  "mettquiz_q4_a2": "16.232 minutes",
  "mettquiz_q4_a3": "32.049 minutes",
  "mettquiz_q4_a4": "32.058 minutes",
  "mettquiz_q5_text": "How many flies are#in this jar?",
  "mettquiz_q5_a1": "54",
  "mettquiz_q5_a2": "53",
  "mettquiz_q5_a3": "55",
  "mettquiz_q5_a4": "52",
  "mettquiz_q6_text": "What monster is this?",
  "mettquiz_q6_a1": "Froggit",
  "mettquiz_q6_a2": "Whimsun",
  "mettquiz_q6_a3": "Moldsmal",
  "mettquiz_q6_a4": "Mettaton",
  "mettquiz_q7_text": "Would you smooch#a ghost?",
  "mettquiz_q7_a1": "Heck Yeah",
  "mettquiz_q7_a2": "Heck Yeah",
  "mettquiz_q7_a3": "Heck Yeah",
  "mettquiz_q7_a4": "Heck Yeah",
  "mettquiz_q8_text": "How many letters in#the name Mettaton",
  "mettquiz_q9_text": "In the dating#simulation video game#\"Mew Mew Kissy Cutie\"#what is Mew Mew's#favorite food?",
  "mettquiz_q10_text": "Who does Dr. Alphys#have a crush on?",
  "mettquiz_q10_a1": "Undyne",
  "mettquiz_q10_a2": "Asgore",
  "mettquiz_q10_a3": "The human",
  "mettquiz_q10_a4": "Don't know",
  "SCR_TEXT_mewmew_0": "   * Check         * Touch",
  "SCR_TEXT_mewmew_1": "   * Check         * Talk",
  "SCR_TEXT_mewmew_2": "* (It's a strange doll.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_mewmew_3": "* (Take a closer look?)& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_mewmew_4": "* (It glares back at you...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_mewmew_5": "* (You decided to explore the&  various other activities&  provided in this room.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_mewmew_6": "* What are YOU looking at!?/%%",
  "monstername_77": "Mew Mew Doll",
  "monstername_77b": "Mad Mew Mew",
  "scr_battlegroup_mewmew_1": "* There's a doll here.",
  "scr_battlegroup_mewmew_2": "* Mad Mew Mew blocks the way!",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_0": "* (The rope has become brittle&  with rust.)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_1": "* (It seems like the more&  they tried to tie things&  together...)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_2": "* (The more frayed everything&  became...)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_3": "* (It's a photo of Papyrus...^1)&* (It creaks from disuse.)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_4": "* (It's a photo of Papyrus...^1)&* (Somehow^1, even the spaghetti in&  the picture has gone rancid...)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_5": "* (It seems it lost the&  will to fight...)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_6": "* (A single gold coin sits at&  the bottom of the box...)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_7": "* (Could it be the source of&  this travesty...?)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_8": "* (It's a tap that dispenses&  dog food...)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_9": "* (You pressed it.)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_10": "* (... all that came out was&  dog sand.)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_11": "* (The dumpling is hardening...)&* (It's turning back into&  a regular dump.)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_12": "* (It's some kind of rejected&  certificate.)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_13": "* (It seems to have been&  rejected over and over...)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_14": "* (The boombox has totally&  fossilized.)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_15": "* (Now it can only play \"rock\"&  music.)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_16": "* (It's a broken game CD.)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_17": "* (You saw yourself reflected in&  the shattered pieces of&  the game...)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_18": "* (It's some kind of blueprint^1,&  marked with red X's...)/",
  "obj_sign_room_ds2_19": "* (It's hard to tell if it&  means rejection^1, or treasure.)/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_0": "* You thought you could stop&  ME from using this body!^1?&* HA!!!/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_1": "* I may be in pieces^1, but&  I still gotta be myself!/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_2": "* Your days are numbered^1, mew~/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_3": "* You...^1!&* YOU!!!!!!/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_4": "* Thanks a lot for your help&  earlier^1, mew~/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_5": "* I'm starting to feel GREAT&  in this new form!!^1!&* I want everyone to see it!!/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_6": "* Who knows^1, maybe I'll even&  start my OWN TV show and&  take the world by storm!/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_7": "* Watch out^1, Mettaton!!^1!&* I'll STEP on your puny metal&  behind!^1! Hahaha!!!/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_8": "* .../",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_9": "* ... hey^1, do you think&  Undyne's going to come&  back here soon^1, or...?/%%",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_10": "* Isn't it NORMAL to think a&  lady might want to watch her&  own house burn down!?/",
  "obj_sign_room_mew_11": "* It's sort of like^1, er^1,&  your own personal fireworks&  show^1! VERY personal!/%%",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_0": "\\W* (The door is locked^5 with a&  \\Ymysterious seal\\W...)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_1": "* (... upon closer inspection^1,&  it's actually pretty&  shoddily made.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_2": "* (It'll probably naturally fall&  off by the time your journey&  is nearly over.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_3": "* (The seal on the door is gone^1,&  but it seems the door is&  still stuck...)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_4": "* (There's an image of two analog&  sticks being pushed apart on&  the ceiling above the door...?)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_5": "* (On the ceiling above the door,&  there's an image of two analog&  sticks being pushed apart.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_6": "* (Two analog sticks...&  Opposite directions...&  What could it mean...?)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_ds2_7": "* (Maybe it means motion&  controls were too difficult&  to implement.)/%%",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_0": "* Ah^1, my chum^1!&* My compatri-art^1!&* My^1, er^1, fellow Club Member!/",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_1": "* Our little shindig back&  there really boosted my&  spirits!/",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_2": "* Thanks to you^1, I think I'll&  bring Art Club to the&  surface!/",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_3": "* I'm^1, haha^1, BURSTING with&  confidence!!/",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_4": "* I've got confidence OOZING&  FROM MY PORES^1, BUDDY!!!/",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_5": "* ...th- thanks for putting up&  with me./%%",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_6": "* ... you're still sticking&  around?/",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_7": "* That means you like me^1!&* You genuinely like me!/",
  "obj_npc_room_sosorry_8": "* I just have to remember that!/%%",
  "obj_clamgirl_106": "* But please don't despair^1.&* Because the time that you&  will meet her.../%",
  "obj_clamgirl_107": "* ... is fast approaching./%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_105": "\\E4FOOL! You think you&can hurt ME&with that&puny weapon!?/",
  "obj_mewmew_body_106": "\\E7As long as my&guard's up,&this body is&INVINCIBLE!/",
  "obj_mewmew_body_107": "\\E2(And cute, mew~)/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_110": "\\E8WERE YOU LISTENING!?&You can't hurt&me!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_body_111": "\\E6Wait^1.&Wait^1!&WAIT!/",
  "obj_mewmew_body_112": "\\E7I get it!!&You're trying to&bring out my&deepest feelings!/",
  "obj_mewmew_body_113": "\\E4Hack away^1, you&despicable&fleshling!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_117": "\\E4Don't you think&I could EASILY&become the world's&CUTEST dullahan!?/",
  "obj_mewmew_body_118": "\\E2I just have to&find a giant cat&for my steed,&and I'll off!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_122": "\\E8ALRIGHT^1, it's&starting to&get ANNOYING&again!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_127": "\\E8READ THE ROOM!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_132": "\\E0I suppose I&should have&expected that./%%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_347": "* Mad Mew Mew is mewing madly.",
  "obj_mewmew_body_371": "NEW LIFE!!!^8 %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_372": "COOL LIFE!!!^8 %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_383": "I'LL RESPECT&THEM!!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_384": "I'LL RESPECT&THEIR&RELATIONSHIP!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_385": "HAHAHA!!!&HAPPY FOR&HER!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_386": "NOTHING&BUT THE&BEST!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_387": "BEST OF&LUCK!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_388": "HAHAHA!!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_394": "EAT THIS!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_395": "AND THIS!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_396": "AND SOME&OF THIS!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_397": "BUT NOT&THIS!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_398": "DON'T EAT&THAT!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_399": "IT'S FOR&ME!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_body_400": "I DIDN'T&MEAN&TO USE IT!!^8! %%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_24": "\\E7COMBAT!^1!&BLOODLUST!^1!&DESTRUCTION!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_25": "\\E4It's the perfect&emotional cocktail.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_26": "\\E1To fuse with my&new body^1, mew~/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_27": "\\E3And^1, with my new&special ability.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_28": "\\E7This battle will&be TRULY&INTERESTING!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_32": "\\E4Wondering where I&got this body?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_33": "\\E7WOULDN'T YOU LIKE&TO KNOW!^1?&HA HA HA HA!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_34": "\\E1Sure^1, I'll tell&you./%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_40": "\\E8Weak!^1!&WEAK!^1!&WEAK!^1!&COME ON!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_41": "You have to make&this CHALLENGING!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_42": "Try pressing apart on&BOTH ANALOG STICKS!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_47": "\\E8ARRRGHHH!&ENOUGH!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_48": "Practice moving&around NOW^1,&while I'm&talking!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_49": "\\E6Got it^1?&Moved around&enough?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_50": "\\E4Alright^1,&let's go!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_67": "\\E5I found it in..^1.&A strange place./",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_68": "\\E6A..^1. sciencey place./%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_72": "\\E5No idea what was&going on THERE^1,&but.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_73": "\\E6As soon as I saw&this body^1, I just&knew --/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_74": "\\E7IT WAS ME!!^1!&ME!!^1!&ME!!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_79": "\\E5So I TOOK it^1!&You can't blame me!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_80": "\\E6Why does a&scientist need a&life-sized girl&statue anyway!?/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_85": "\\E5I probably saved&it from&EXPERIMENTS!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_86": "\\E7I'm a HERO^1, and&I rescued MYSELF!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_91": "\\E7And now^1, with&this new body,/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_92": "\\E2I've got a BRAND&NEW life ahead of&me!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_97": "\\E7And NOW^1, I'll&finally be able&to.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_98": "\\E5I'll..^1. finally be&able to.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_99": "\\E6Uhh^1, continue&being Undyne's&Training Dummy./",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_100": "\\E7BUT BETTER!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_105": "\\E2Ah^1, Undyne..^1.&Sweet^1, violent^1,&Undyne~/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_106": "\\E2I can't wait to&see the look on&her face when she&sees me~/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_111": "\\E2She'll blast me&with a storm of&spears~/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_112": "\\E2I'll be the&world's greatest&pin cushion~/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_117": "\\E5H-Huh...!^1?&That look on your&face --/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_118": "\\E6She's already&got.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_119": "\\E9... somebody else?/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_124": "\\E9.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_125": "\\E4Heheheh..^1.&Heheh.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_126": "\\E6Well^1, if she's&got somebody&else.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_127": "\\E7THEN YOU KNOW&WHAT I'M GONNA&DO TO THEM!??/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_132": "\\E8Enough^1.&ENOUGH^1.&ENOUGH!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_133": "WHY haven't I&FUSED yet!?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_134": "Do I have to use&my FULL POWER!?/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_139": "\\E8COME ON^1!&IS THIS ENOUGH&FOR YOU!?/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_146": "\\E5What the hey!^1?&You're some kind&of freak, aren't&you!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_147": "\\E6You dodged ALL of&my attacks without&getting hit!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_148": "\\E5Unbelievable^1.&Unbelievable^1!&UNBELIEVABLE!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_149": "\\E7YOU^1! Let's see&what you think&of THIS^1, then!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_154": "\\E8Huuuuu...!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_155": "\\E8Don't think that&was NEARLY enough&to earn my&praise!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_156": "\\E7Take THIS!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_161": "\\E2Mewsers^1!&That was Gnarly!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_162": "\\E1Tubular! Way Cool!&Awesome! Groovy!&Mondo! Outrageous!&Funky!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_163": "\\E8IS THAT WHAT YOU&WANTED ME TO SAY!?&BECAUSE WE AREN'T&DONE YET!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_168": "\\E9What am I doing&wrong...?/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_173": "\\E0Show me what LOVE&is!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_238": "* Mad Mew Mew mews madly.",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_239": "* Mad Mew Mew glares into an&  elaborate pink mirror^1, then&  turns to you the same way.",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_240": "* A pre-recorded, peppy voice&  squawks out of Mad Mew Mew's&  torso.",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_241": "* Mad Mew Mew tightens her head.",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_242": "* Mad Mew Mew considers ska&  dancing but the music isn't&  nearly appropriate enough.",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_243": "* Smells like perfume and nerds.",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_246": "* It seems like Mad Mew Mew&  might listen to you now...",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_248": "* How will you show your LOVE...?",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_252": "* It glares at you.",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_336": "* MEW MEW DOLL - AT 0 DF 0&* It's a life-sized Mew Mew Doll.&* For..^1. something?/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_338": "* MAD MEW MEW - AT 45 DF ??&* Mew Mew 2: Mew Mew's&  Pissed Off And Ready To Mew!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_349": "* You scratched the Mew Mew Doll&  gently behind the ears./%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_354": "* You talked to Mad Mew Mew^1.&* ... doesn't seem much for&  conversation./%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_359": "* You told Mad Mew Mew that&  anger might not be the&  only way./%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_365": "* ... but it was hard to&  express your LOVE just&  through words./%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_451": "\\E6H..^1. huh?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_452": "You mean I might&have to try.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_453": "\\E5... other..^1.&...emotions?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_454": "\\E6You mean something&like.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_455": "\\E2Love?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_456": "\\E9Then^1, I.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_457": ".../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_458": "\\E5Human!!^1!&Go ahead!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_474": "* (...?)/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_475": "* (... it sounded like the doll&  was..^1. laughing...?)/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_506": "\\E8ENOUGH!!^1!&ENOUGH!!!^1!&ENOUGH!!!!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_507": "FOOL!^1! DON'T YOU KNOW&NOT TO TOUCH&PEOPLE YOU&DON'T KNOW!?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_508": "ESPECIALLY!^1!&WHEN!!^1!&THEY'RE!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_509": "\\E2Ticklish./",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_510": "\\E6Huh^1?&You don't&recognize me...?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_511": "\\E3Ohhh ho ho.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_512": "\\E5That's all for&the better~!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_513": "\\E7Once I fuse with&this PERFECT&new body^1, mew~/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_514": "\\E0A brand new^1,&WONDERFUL life is&going to begin!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_515": "\\E6... but as much&as I try to&fuse.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_516": "\\E8IT'S!^1!&NOT!!^1!&WORKING!!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_517": "MY EMOTIONS&AREN'T PURE&ENOUGH---!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_518": "I need TENSION^1!&CONFLICT!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_519": "Something to&bring out my&ANGER!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_520": "\\E5.../",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_521": "\\E0That's it!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_522": "\\E5YOU!!^1! Human!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_523": "\\E7Fight with me!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_564": "\\E8Enough^1.&ENOUGH^1.&ENOUGH!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_565": "WHY ISN'T IT&WORKING!?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_566": "NO MATTER HOW&MAD I GET,/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_567": "NO MATTER HOW&MUCH I FIGHT,/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_568": "I JUST CAN'T&FUSE WITH THIS&BODY!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_569": "\\E5WHAT AM I DOING&WRONG!?!?/",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_570": "\\E9What am I doing&wrong.../%%",
  "obj_mewmew_boss_585": "* It seems like Mad Mew Mew&  might listen to you now...",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_76": "* (The Animatronic Limited&  Edition Mew Mew Machine&  was shattered into pieces...)/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_77": "* YOU^1! I had finally found&  the perfect body...!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_78": "* I even came to a secluded&  place to fuse in PEACE^1,&  but.../",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_79": "* I guess I made an ENEMY!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_80": "* Just WAIT^1! After I repair&  this body^1, you're REALLY&  going to suffer!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_81": "* Someday^1.&* Someday^1!&* SOMEDAY!!!/%%",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_85": "* Huh...^1?&* Such..^1. such kindness...!/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_86": "* It's..^1. making me FEEL&  something!/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_87": "* It may be a while before I&  can truly fuse with this&  body./",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_88": "* But^1, I think this is&  a start...!/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_89": "* Heh^1, to think that even&  though I hid here to be&  alone.../",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_90": "* ... I somehow made a friend!!!/",
  "obj_mewmew_npc_91": "* Thank you^1.&* Thank you^1!&* THANK YOU!!/%%",
  "obj_ds3_box_0": "* (It's a donation box^1, but for&  some kind of Coin's you&  don't have...)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_0": "* (It's a sign of Sans poorly&  stretched vertically^1, with&  jpeg artifacting.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_1": "* ('You must be this tall and&  jpeg artifacted to play&  Poker.')/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_2": "* (It's a poker table.^1)&* (It's so tall there's no&  way you can ever play.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_3": "* (It's some kind of statue&  advertising fried dog food.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_4": "* (Felt as if you put something&  into the dog's hands...)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_5": "* (... it might solve some kind&  of puzzle.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_6": "* (That's completely untrue.^1)&* (It's just the kind of&  feeling it has.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_7": "* (It's some kind of fried food&  dog effigy.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_8": "* (It's a fast food box.^1)&* (Inside^1, dressed with ketchup&  and buns...)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_9": "* (Are some game controllers.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_10": "* (There are bite marks.^1)&* (Seems the dog didn't get&  what it was buying.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_11": "* (It's a fast food container&  with controllers inside.^1)&* (No mustard.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_12": "* (It's a Gamer's Treaty&  which declares the only&  50 good games to ever exist.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_13": "* (It seems to be war-torn...)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_14": "* (Various beautification creams&  for Skin Care Loving Gamers.)&* (It has a slogan...)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_15": "* (Use this if you love skin!)&* (Use this if you love having&  skin!)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_16": "* (It's a backwards baseball&  cap.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_17": "* (It may be said that since no&  one is wearing it^1, it can't&  be forwards or backwards...)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_18": "* (But in this context^1, it's&  definitely backwards.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_19": "* (It's a definitely backwards&  baseball cap.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_20": "* (It's a ticket to a live Gaming&  Performance of a famous&  star.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_21": "* (Your hand phases through...^1)&* (Seems like the ticket is&  incorporeal somehow.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_22": "* (It's a kind of stolen ticket.^1)&* (It brings into question where&  many items here came from.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_23": "* (It's the GamerBOX GameCamera.^1)&* (It lets you play using your&  movements in real time.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_24": "* (It even comes bundled with the&  popular MTT Dance Off^1, feat. &  famous star Mettaton.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_25": "* (As Mettaton dances^1, the camera&  checks if you're applauding^1.)&* (Stop clapping and you lose!)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_26": "* (It's the GamerBOX GameCamera.^1)&* (Looks like it needs a&  refill of thermal paper.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_27": "* (You found a GamerBOX game&  console system.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_28": "* (You can now play a virtual&  slot machine exclusively on&  the GamerBOX console!)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_29": "* (However^1, you get nothing&  from it in real life^1, so&  there's not much point.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_30": "* (It's the GamerBOX^1, the number&  one console for Gamers&  who love to Game.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_31": "* (It's a stack of cherry-&  flavored Gamerblood&  Energy Drink's.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_32": "* (You need various vitamins to&  keep you energized while&  you game.)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_33": "* (Like Vitamin B1, Vitamin B2,&  Vitamin B3, Vitamin B4,&  Vitamin B5, Caffeine...)/",
  "obj_readable_room5_34": "* (And whatever vitamins are in&  radioactive waste.)/%",
  "obj_readable_room5_35": "* (It's cherry soda but with&  things in it that make&  you sick.)/%",
